        {
          "text": "things were beginning to change.",
          "offset": 6690,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "111:29"
        },
        {
          "text": "For in that year, Tersin sings of a",
          "offset": 6693,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "111:32"
        },
        {
          "text": "fierce battle fought on a Saturday",
          "offset": 6696,
