          "text": "morning on an unnamed river Ford in a",
          "offset": 6699,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "111:38"
        },
        {
          "text": "wood called Argawad Lefane.",
          "offset": 6702,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "111:42"
        },
        {
