          "formattedTime": "62:30"
        },
        {
          "text": "borders as it had prior to the coming of",
          "offset": 3753,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "62:32"
        },
        {
          "text": "the Vikings.",
          "offset": 3755,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "62:35"
        },
        {
          "text": "Yet, astonishingly, she didn't stop",
          "offset": 3759,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "62:39"
        },
        {
          "text": "there.",
          "offset": 3762,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "62:42"
        },
        {
          "text": "By mid [music] 918, the Vikings of",
          "offset": 3764,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "62:43"
        },
        {
          "text": "Yorvik agreed to submit to Ethelfled",
          "offset": 3766,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "62:46"
        },
