          "formattedTime": "11:53"
        },
        {
          "text": "disappearing under the flood.",
          "offset": 715,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "11:54"
        },
        {
          "text": "the first of many similar investments by",
          "offset": 721,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "12:00"
        },
        {
          "text": "the Turkish government in order to feed",
          "offset": 724,
