          "formattedTime": "12:03"
        },
        {
          "text": "and water the tens of millions of people",
          "offset": 726,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "12:06"
        },
        {
          "text": "living in the dry southeast of the",
          "offset": 729,
          "duration": 5,
