        },
        {
          "text": "followed.",
          "offset": 766,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "12:46"
        },
        {
          "text": "Accompanying the colossal construction",
          "offset": 771,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "12:50"
        },
        {
          "text": "projects to flood ancient river valleys",
          "offset": 773,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "12:53"
        },
        {
          "text": "came a number of cuttingedge digs",
          "offset": 777,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "12:56"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 781,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "13:00"
        },
        {
          "text": "instigated both by Turkish teams now",
          "offset": 784,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "13:04"
        },
        {
          "text": "catching up with the West in terms of",
          "offset": 788,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "13:07"
        },
        {
          "text": "sophistication",
          "offset": 790,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "13:09"
        },
        {
          "text": "and an invasion of wellfunded",
          "offset": 792,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "13:11"
        },
        {
          "text": "researchers from all over the world.",
          "offset": 794,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "13:13"
        },
        {
          "text": "invited in to help with this unique",
          "offset": 800,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "13:19"
        },
        {
