        },
        {
          "text": "ancient past.",
          "offset": 805,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "13:25"
        },
        {
          "text": "It wasn't long before astounding",
          "offset": 811,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "13:30"
        },
        {
          "text": "discoveries began to be made.",
          "offset": 814,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "13:33"
        },
        {
          "text": "4 years earlier in 1964,",
          "offset": 830,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "13:49"
        },
        {
          "text": "an American team working at the",
          "offset": 833,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "13:53"
        },
        {
          "text": "Neolithic site of Chanu had already",
          "offset": 835,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "13:55"
        },
        {
          "text": "pushed the clock back in the region by",
          "offset": 838,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "13:58"
        },
        {
          "text": "thousands of years.",
          "offset": 841,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "14:00"
        },
        {
          "text": "under the supervision of Robert",
          "offset": 844,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "14:03"
        },
        {
          "text": "Bradwood. The settlement had been found",
          "offset": 845,
          "duration": 10,
          "formattedTime": "14:05"
        },
        {
          "text": "to date to well over 10,000 years ago.",
          "offset": 848,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "14:08"
        },
        {
          "text": "Braidwood would continue to work at",
          "offset": 856,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "14:15"
        },
        {
          "text": "Chanu for another 14 seasons.",
          "offset": 858,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "14:18"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 862,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "14:21"
        },
        {
          "text": "But it was at Navali Chry where",
          "offset": 863,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "14:23"
        },
        {
          "text": "headlines around the world would truly",
          "offset": 866,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "14:25"
        },
        {
          "text": "be made.",
          "offset": 869,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "14:28"
        },
        {
          "text": "Hidden in a small side valley of the",
          "offset": 873,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "14:33"
        },
        {
          "text": "Euphrates in a region already earmarked",
          "offset": 876,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "14:35"
        },
        {
          "text": "for submersion under another lake that",
          "offset": 879,
          "duration": 6,
