        },
        {
          "text": "was planned to be formed.",
          "offset": 882,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "14:41"
        },
        {
          "text": "Navali Chry translating rather ominously",
          "offset": 886,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "14:46"
        },
        {
          "text": "as the valley of the plague",
          "offset": 890,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "14:49"
        },
        {
          "text": "was initially investigated in 1979.",
          "offset": 895,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "14:54"
        },
        {
          "text": "At first thought to be early Bronze Age",
          "offset": 899,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "14:58"
        },
        {
          "text": "in origin,",
          "offset": 901,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "15:01"
        },
        {
          "text": "it turned out to be so much older.",
          "offset": 903,
          "duration": 9,
          "formattedTime": "15:03"
        },
        {
          "text": "Like Chanu, Navali Chry was well over",
          "offset": 908,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "15:08"
        },
        {
          "text": "10,000 years old.",
          "offset": 912,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "15:12"
        },
        {
          "text": "When excavations began at the early",
          "offset": 922,
