          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 975,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "16:14"
        },
        {
          "text": "Unfortunately, its head was missing.",
          "offset": 979,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "16:18"
        },
        {
          "text": "The archaeologists were simply",
          "offset": 985,
