          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "16:34"
        },
        {
          "text": "of early 1992,",
          "offset": 997,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "16:37"
        },
        {
          "text": "left to ponder the ancestors, gods, or",
