        },
        {
          "text": "San Leura.",
          "offset": 1028,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "17:08"
        },
        {
          "text": "His name was Klouse Schmidt",
          "offset": 1032,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "17:12"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 1036,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "17:15"
        },
        {
          "text": "and we will be hearing much more from",
          "offset": 1038,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "17:18"
        },
        {
          "text": "him soon.",
          "offset": 1040,
          "duration": 12,
          "formattedTime": "17:20"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 1044,
          "duration": 11,
          "formattedTime": "17:23"
        },
        {
          "text": "With a population of well over a",
          "offset": 1052,
