          "offset": 1121,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "18:41"
        },
        {
          "text": "given by his soldiers to remind them of",
          "offset": 1124,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "18:43"
        },
        {
          "text": "the Adessa in their homeland of Macedon.",
          "offset": 1126,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "18:46"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 1130,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "18:50"
        },
        {
          "text": "But even in those days, the place was",
          "offset": 1133,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "18:53"
        },
        {
          "text": "already old.",
          "offset": 1136,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "18:56"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 1139,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "18:58"
        },
        {
          "text": "Situated around a number of castic",
