          "text": "stretches out in all directions.",
          "offset": 1150,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "19:10"
        },
        {
          "text": "just as it has for millennia.",
          "offset": 1154,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "19:14"
        },
        {
          "text": "The great rain providing chain of the",
          "offset": 1158,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "19:17"
        },
        {
          "text": "Taurus mountains and the Anatolian",
          "offset": 1160,
