          "formattedTime": "20:56"
        },
        {
          "text": "losing himself for a time among the",
          "offset": 1264,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "21:03"
        },
        {
          "text": "myriad Byzantine and Greco Roman altars.",
          "offset": 1266,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "21:05"
        },
        {
          "text": "Though it seemed an entirely ordinary",
          "offset": 1275,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "21:15"
        },
        {
          "text": "day,",
          "offset": 1278,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "21:18"
        },
        {
          "text": "everything in his life was about to",
          "offset": 1280,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "21:19"
        },
        {
          "text": "change.",
          "offset": 1283,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "21:22"
        },
        {
          "text": "Now armed with the newly gained",
          "offset": 1288,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "21:27"
        },
        {
          "text": "knowledge of Navali Chry, Klaus Schmidt",
          "offset": 1290,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "21:29"
        },
        {
          "text": "saw something in the Museum that",
          "offset": 1294,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "21:33"
        },
        {
          "text": "shouldn't have been there.",
          "offset": 1297,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "21:36"
        },
        {
          "text": "Two naturalistic statues,",
          "offset": 1300,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "21:39"
        },
        {
          "text": "reptilian in form,",
          "offset": 1305,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "21:44"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 1308,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "21:47"
        },
        {
          "text": "erroneously categorized as Byzantine,",
          "offset": 1312,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "21:52"
        },
        {
          "text": "Schmidt immediately knew better,",
          "offset": 1315,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "21:55"
        },
        {
          "text": "recognizing similarities to the vastly",
          "offset": 1319,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "21:59"
        },
        {
          "text": "more ancient sites he'd been working on.",
          "offset": 1322,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "22:02"
        },
        {
          "text": "But how had they got to the museum and",
          "offset": 1328,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "22:08"
        },
        {
          "text": "where had they come from?",
          "offset": 1332,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "22:11"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 1336,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "22:15"
        },
        {
          "text": "Thankfully, someone at the museum knew",
          "offset": 1338,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "22:18"
        },
        {
          "text": "exactly.",
          "offset": 1341,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "22:21"
        },
        {
          "text": "And just a few hours later, Schmidt",
          "offset": 1343,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "22:23"
        },
        {
          "text": "along with two colleagues were in a taxi",
          "offset": 1346,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "22:25"
        },
        {
          "text": "heading along dirt roads to the hill",
          "offset": 1353,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "22:32"
        },
        {
          "text": "country northeast of the city",
          "offset": 1355,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "22:35"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 1358,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "22:38"
        },
        {
          "text": "to an obscure plot of land on a desolate",
          "offset": 1361,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "22:40"
        },
        {
          "text": "rock",
          "offset": 1364,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "22:43"
        },
        {
          "text": "known as Potbelly Hill.",
          "offset": 1365,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "22:45"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 1369,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "22:48"
        },
        {
          "text": "And as Schmidt would soon find out, its",
          "offset": 1371,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "22:51"
        },
        {
          "text": "Turkish name, Gobeclete,",
          "offset": 1374,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "22:54"
        },
        {
          "text": "was already known to archaeology.",
          "offset": 1377,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "22:57"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 1380,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "22:59"
        },
        {
          "text": "Seven or eight years earlier, local land",
          "offset": 1385,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "23:05"
        },
        {
          "text": "owner Ibrahim Yildis and his son Mammoot",
          "offset": 1388,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "23:07"
        },
        {
          "text": "had been clearing scrub land up on the",
          "offset": 1391,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "23:11"
        },
        {
          "text": "hill overlooking their property",
          "offset": 1394,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "23:13"
        },
        {
          "text": "when one of their spades hit something",
          "offset": 1396,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "23:16"
        },
        {
          "text": "solid.",
          "offset": 1399,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "23:18"
        },
        {
          "text": "Strange statues were then pulled up out",
          "offset": 1403,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "23:23"
        },
        {
          "text": "of the ground.",
          "offset": 1406,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "23:26"
        },
        {
          "text": "But there was a problem.",
          "offset": 1410,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "23:29"
        },
        {
          "text": "In the confused days that followed, as",
          "offset": 1412,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "23:31"
        },
        {
          "text": "one of the statues clearly had a large",
          "offset": 1415,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "23:34"
        },
        {
          "text": "penis showing, the two men kept them",
          "offset": 1417,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "23:37"
        },
        {
          "text": "hidden as a steady stream of villagers",
          "offset": 1420,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "23:40"
        },
        {
          "text": "came by to see the discovery.",
          "offset": 1423,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "23:43"
        },
        {
          "text": "Not wanting to be perceived as",
          "offset": 1427,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "23:46"
        },
        {
          "text": "idolatrous and bring shame upon their",
          "offset": 1428,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "23:48"
        },
        {
          "text": "family, eventually the local Imam came",
          "offset": 1430,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "23:50"
        },
        {
          "text": "to see the finds.",
          "offset": 1434,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "23:53"
        },
        {
          "text": "Far from chastising the men, recognizing",
          "offset": 1439,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "23:58"
        },
        {
          "text": "the potential significance of the finds,",
          "offset": 1442,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "24:01"
        },
        {
          "text": "he encouraged the two farmers to take",
          "offset": 1444,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "24:04"
        },
        {
          "text": "them to the Museum.",
          "offset": 1447,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "24:06"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 1453,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "24:13"
        },
        {
          "text": "heading by horse cart along the old road",
          "offset": 1456,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "24:16"
        },
        {
          "text": "to the west. Once the two men arrived,",
          "offset": 1458,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "24:18"
        },
        {
          "text": "the museum manager politely informed",
          "offset": 1462,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "24:22"
        },
        {
          "text": "them the pieces were regrettably not",
          "offset": 1465,
          "duration": 9,
          "formattedTime": "24:24"
        },
        {
          "text": "very old, nor particularly significant.",
          "offset": 1468,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "24:27"
        },
        {
          "text": "Demoralized, thinking the journey had",
          "offset": 1475,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "24:34"
        },
        {
          "text": "been for nothing,",
          "offset": 1477,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "24:37"
        },
        {
          "text": "in order to not have to pay for another",
          "offset": 1480,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "24:40"
        },
        {
          "text": "cart ride home,",
          "offset": 1482,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "24:42"
        },
        {
          "text": "they left the pieces in the museum",
          "offset": 1484,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "24:44"
        },
        {
          "text": "garden.",
          "offset": 1486,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "24:46"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 1487,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "24:47"
        },
        {
          "text": "No blame should be placed on the museum",
          "offset": 1491,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "24:51"
        },
        {
          "text": "staff, however, nor the farmers, for at",
          "offset": 1493,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "24:53"
        },
        {
          "text": "the time nothing of the sort had ever",
          "offset": 1497,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "24:57"
        },
        {
          "text": "been found before.",
          "offset": 1500,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "25:00"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 1502,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "25:01"
        },
        {
          "text": "And this wasn't the first time the",
          "offset": 1505,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "25:04"
        },
        {
          "text": "significance of Gobeclete had been",
          "offset": 1507,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "25:07"
        },
        {
          "text": "missed.",
          "offset": 1510,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "25:09"
        },
        {
          "text": "Close to 30 years earlier in the 1960s",
          "offset": 1515,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "25:14"
        },
        {
          "text": "during Robert Braidwood's initial work",
          "offset": 1519,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "25:18"
        },
        {
          "text": "at Chanu,",
          "offset": 1521,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "25:21"
        },
        {
          "text": "another American archaeologist had",
          "offset": 1525,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "25:24"
        },
        {
          "text": "scoured the region in search of evidence",
          "offset": 1527,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "25:27"
        },
        {
          "text": "for similar sites.",
          "offset": 1530,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "25:29"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 1532,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "25:32"
        },
        {
          "text": "And though his ensuing report dating",
          "offset": 1535,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "25:34"
        },
        {
          "text": "from 1963 until 1972",
          "offset": 1538,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "25:37"
        },
        {
          "text": "ultimately missed the true significance",
          "offset": 1541,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "25:41"
        },
        {
          "text": "of the place, Peter Benedict had spent",
          "offset": 1543,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "25:43"
        },
        {
          "text": "quite some time at Gobeclete.",
          "offset": 1547,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "25:47"
        },
        {
          "text": "Amidst a vast carpet of thousands of",
          "offset": 1552,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "25:52"
        },
        {
          "text": "flint stones gleaming under the",
          "offset": 1555,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "25:55"
        },
        {
          "text": "scorching sun,",
          "offset": 1557,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "25:57"
        },
        {
          "text": "he'd found broken pottery pieces, flint",
          "offset": 1560,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "25:59"
        },
        {
          "text": "blades, and stone artifacts,",
          "offset": 1563,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "26:03"
        },
        {
          "text": "many of which had been piled up by",
          "offset": 1567,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "26:07"
        },
        {
          "text": "farmers over the span of decades,",
          "offset": 1569,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "26:09"
        },
        {
          "text": "if not centuries.",
          "offset": 1573,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "26:12"
        },
        {
          "text": "And yet, Goeclete was just one tell",
          "offset": 1577,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "26:16"
        },
        {
          "text": "amongst thousands.",
          "offset": 1581,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "26:20"
        },
        {
          "text": "Curiously, in the shadow of a great",
          "offset": 1587,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "26:26"
        },
        {
          "text": "malbury tree rising from the crest of",
          "offset": 1589,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "26:29"
        },
        {
          "text": "the hill,",
          "offset": 1592,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "26:32"
        },
        {
          "text": "Benedict wrote of locating a cemetery",
          "offset": 1594,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "26:34"
        },
        {
          "text": "site,",
          "offset": 1597,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "26:37"
        },
        {
          "text": "one which has never been found.",
          "offset": 1599,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "26:38"
        },
        {
          "text": "Islamic burial grounds are of course",
          "offset": 1604,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "26:43"
        },
        {
          "text": "taboo for archaeologists,",
          "offset": 1606,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "26:46"
        },
        {
          "text": "which could be the cause of him writing",
          "offset": 1609,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "26:49"
        },
        {
          "text": "the place off for further investigation.",
          "offset": 1611,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "26:51"
        },
        {
          "text": "It simply didn't cross Benedict's",
          "offset": 1616,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "26:55"
        },
        {
          "text": "wildest imagination that practically the",
          "offset": 1618,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "26:58"
        },
        {
          "text": "entire hill could be a great man-made",
          "offset": 1622,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "27:01"
        },
        {
          "text": "tell dating from the pre- pottery",
          "offset": 1625,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "27:04"
        },
        {
          "text": "Neolithic.",
          "offset": 1628,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "27:07"
        },
        {
          "text": "built up from the refues of thousands of",
          "offset": 1631,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "27:11"
        },
        {
          "text": "years of occupation.",
          "offset": 1634,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "27:13"
        },
        {
          "text": "But when Schmidt arrived in 1994,",
          "offset": 1639,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "27:18"
        },
        {
          "text": "it wasn't long before he made that exact",
          "offset": 1643,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "27:22"
        },
        {
          "text": "conclusion.",
          "offset": 1646,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "27:26"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 1649,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "27:29"
        },
        {
          "text": "Far from a cemetery site, the half",
          "offset": 1652,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "27:32"
        },
        {
          "text": "buried stones on the top of the hill, in",
          "offset": 1655,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "27:35"
        },
        {
          "text": "the process of being gradually dug out",
          "offset": 1658,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "27:37"
        },
        {
          "text": "by local farm workers,",
          "offset": 1660,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "27:40"
        },
        {
          "text": "were the very same style of T-shaped",
          "offset": 1663,
          "duration": 9,
          "formattedTime": "27:42"
        },
        {
          "text": "pillars previously found at Navali Chry.",
          "offset": 1665,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "27:45"
        },
        {
          "text": "But here they were everywhere he looked.",
          "offset": 1672,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "27:51"
        },
        {
          "text": "With just a little trial digging,",
          "offset": 1679,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "27:58"
        },
        {
          "text": "artifacts too could be pulled out easily",
          "offset": 1681,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "28:01"
        },
        {
          "text": "from the ground.",
          "offset": 1685,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "28:04"
        },
        {
          "text": "Just like the ones from the Earth",
          "offset": 1687,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "28:07"
        },
        {
          "text": "Museum,",
          "offset": 1689,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "28:09"
        },
        {
          "text": "without which the site might not have",
          "offset": 1691,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "28:10"
        },
        {
          "text": "been found.",
          "offset": 1694,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "28:13"
        },
        {
          "text": "When Turkish archaeologist Morat Akman",
          "offset": 1698,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "28:18"
        },
        {
          "text": "arrived at the hill, whose previous",
          "offset": 1701,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "28:21"
        },
        {
          "text": "digging experience included both Shanu",
          "offset": 1704,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "28:24"
        },
        {
          "text": "and at Navali Chry under Schmidt's",
          "offset": 1707,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "28:26"
        },
        {
          "text": "mentor Harold Hman,",
          "offset": 1709,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "28:29"
        },
        {
          "text": "Schmidt didn't have to say anything at",
          "offset": 1712,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "28:31"
        },
        {
          "text": "all. With little more than a look, both",
          "offset": 1715,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "28:34"
        },
        {
          "text": "men knew intuitively",
          "offset": 1718,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "28:38"
        },
        {
          "text": "everything in their field was about to",
          "offset": 1721,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "28:40"
        },
        {
          "text": "change.",
          "offset": 1723,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "28:43"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 1725,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "28:44"
        },
        {
          "text": "Southeastern Turkey could be a dangerous",
          "offset": 1729,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "28:48"
        },
        {
          "text": "place at that time, shaken by fierce",
          "offset": 1731,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "28:51"
        },
        {
          "text": "fighting with Kurdish separatist groups.",
          "offset": 1735,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "28:54"
        },
        {
          "text": "And when the local villagers saw a group",
          "offset": 1739,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "28:59"
        },
        {
          "text": "of strangers wandering around their",
          "offset": 1742,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "29:01"
        },
        {
          "text": "fields that day, they turned up armed",
          "offset": 1744,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "29:03"
        },
        {
          "text": "and ready to defend themselves.",
          "offset": 1747,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "29:06"
        },
        {
          "text": "Eventually, through the diplomatic",
          "offset": 1752,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "29:12"
        },
        {
          "text": "skills of a Kurdish taxi driver, the",
          "offset": 1754,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "29:14"
        },
        {
          "text": "situation became disarmed and the AK-47",
          "offset": 1757,
          "duration": 9,
          "formattedTime": "29:16"
        },
        {
          "text": "wielding village guardians backed down.",
          "offset": 1761,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "29:20"
        },
        {
          "text": "On that day, Claus Schmidt realized for",
          "offset": 1767,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "29:26"
        },
        {
          "text": "better or for worse, his previous",
          "offset": 1770,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "29:30"
        },
        {
          "text": "research plans had become utterly",
          "offset": 1773,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "29:33"
        },
        {
          "text": "irrelevant.",
          "offset": 1776,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "29:35"
        },
        {
          "text": "He had no choice but to dedicate the",
          "offset": 1778,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "29:37"
        },
        {
          "text": "rest of his life to the place.",
          "offset": 1781,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "29:40"
        },
        {
          "text": "Just one year later, a massive team",
          "offset": 1789,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "29:49"
        },
        {
          "text": "arrived",
          "offset": 1793,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "29:52"
        },
        {
          "text": "and one of the great digs in world",
          "offset": 1794,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "29:54"
        },
        {
          "text": "history began.",
          "offset": 1797,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "29:56"
        },
        {
          "text": "The farmers already inadvertently in the",
          "offset": 1803,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "30:02"
        },
        {
          "text": "process of excavating were paid",
          "offset": 1806,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "30:05"
        },
        {
          "text": "compensation for their land.",
          "offset": 1808,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "30:07"
        },
        {
          "text": "And even though the damage wrought by",
          "offset": 1811,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "30:11"
        },
        {
          "text": "spade and plow over the decades and",
          "offset": 1814,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "30:13"
        },
        {
          "text": "centuries was great,",
          "offset": 1816,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "30:15"
        },
        {
          "text": "the sheer scale and preservation of the",
          "offset": 1818,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "30:18"
        },
        {
          "text": "site was astounding to behold.",
          "offset": 1821,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "30:21"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 1834,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "30:34"
        },
        {
          "text": "The dig was slow and methodical,",
          "offset": 1836,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "30:36"
        },
        {
          "text": "utilizing the very latest in cuttingedge",
          "offset": 1841,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "30:40"
        },
        {
          "text": "scientific techniques.",
          "offset": 1844,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "30:43"
        },
        {
          "text": "But almost immediately, a number of",
          "offset": 1848,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "30:47"
        },
        {
          "text": "realizations were made.",
          "offset": 1850,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "30:50"
        },
        {
          "text": "Not just one area, but the entire hill",
          "offset": 1854,
          "duration": 9,
          "formattedTime": "30:54"
        },
        {
          "text": "was coated in megalithic architecture.",
          "offset": 1858,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "30:58"
        },
        {
          "text": "All sides worked carefully by hand.",
          "offset": 1864,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "31:03"
        },
        {
          "text": "Not only that, but broken pieces were",
          "offset": 1868,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "31:08"
        },
        {
          "text": "everywhere, too. Many now housed in the",
          "offset": 1872,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "31:11"
        },
        {
          "text": "so-called garden of stones on one side",
          "offset": 1875,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "31:15"
        },
        {
          "text": "of the hill.",
          "offset": 1878,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "31:18"
        },
        {
          "text": "The earliest semi-ubteran enclosures of",
          "offset": 1882,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "31:22"
        },
        {
          "text": "Navali Chry meticulously documented in",
          "offset": 1885,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "31:25"
        },
        {
          "text": "the 1980s",
          "offset": 1889,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "31:28"
        },
        {
          "text": "did indeed have similar features to",
          "offset": 1890,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "31:30"
        },
        {
          "text": "those found at Gabbecepe.",
          "offset": 1893,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "31:32"
        },
        {
          "text": "They dated from the same time when",
          "offset": 1896,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "31:36"
        },
        {
          "text": "carbon dated",
          "offset": 1899,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "31:39"
        },
        {
          "text": "some 12,000 years ago,",
          "offset": 1902,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "31:41"
        },
        {
          "text": "not long after the end of the last ice",
          "offset": 1905,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "31:45"
        },
        {
          "text": "age.",
          "offset": 1908,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "31:47"
        },
        {
          "text": "But these were much bigger.",
          "offset": 1910,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "31:50"
        },
        {
          "text": "A couple of seasons later and Gabbec was",
          "offset": 1917,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "31:57"
        },
        {
          "text": "the most famous archaeological site in",
          "offset": 1921,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "32:00"
        },
        {
          "text": "the world.",
          "offset": 1924,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "32:03"
        },
        {
          "text": "stretching for some 25 acres. At least",
          "offset": 1928,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "32:07"
        },
        {
          "text": "20 stone circles were unearthed,",
          "offset": 1932,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "32:12"
        },
        {
          "text": "each containing pillars as much as 9 ft",
          "offset": 1935,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "32:15"
        },
        {
          "text": "tall, coated in completely",
          "offset": 1938,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "32:18"
        },
        {
          "text": "unprecedented, elaborate carvings,",
          "offset": 1942,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "32:21"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 1945,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "32:25"
        },
        {
          "text": "predating Stonehenge and the pyramids of",
          "offset": 1948,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "32:27"
        },
        {
          "text": "Egypt by some 7,000 years.",
          "offset": 1950,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "32:30"
        },
        {
          "text": "The evidence clearly showed the makers",
          "offset": 1954,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "32:34"
        },
        {
          "text": "of this extraordinary set of monuments",
          "offset": 1957,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "32:37"
        },
        {
          "text": "to be a people without the technology to",
          "offset": 1960,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "32:39"
        },
        {
          "text": "create pottery.",
          "offset": 1963,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "32:42"
        },
        {
          "text": "And even more astonishingly,",
          "offset": 1966,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "32:45"
        },
        {
          "text": "just like the earliest levels of Navali",
          "offset": 1969,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "32:48"
        },
        {
          "text": "Chry contemporary with it, entirely",
          "offset": 1971,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "32:51"
        },
        {
          "text": "devoid of agriculture,",
          "offset": 1975,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "32:54"
        },
        {
          "text": "only the remains of wild animals and",
          "offset": 1978,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "32:57"
        },
        {
          "text": "wild plants being found.",
          "offset": 1981,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "33:01"
        },
        {
          "text": "Within eyesight of",
          "offset": 1989,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "33:08"
        },
        {
          "text": "somehow having avoided discovery for all",
          "offset": 1992,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "33:11"
        },
        {
          "text": "those millennia,",
          "offset": 1995,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "33:14"
        },
        {
          "text": "Gobecletepe had once been a place of",
          "offset": 1997,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "33:16"
        },
        {
          "text": "immense significance.",
          "offset": 2000,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "33:20"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 2003,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "33:22"
        },
        {
          "text": "And as the seasons went on and the",
          "offset": 2007,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "33:26"
        },
        {
          "text": "evidence continued to mount up,",
          "offset": 2009,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "33:29"
        },
        {
          "text": "Klaus Schmidt began to form his opinions",
          "offset": 2012,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "33:32"
        },
        {
          "text": "of the place",
          "offset": 2015,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "33:35"
        },
        {
          "text": "as a spiritual center for an affluent",
          "offset": 2017,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "33:37"
        },
        {
          "text": "nomadic people in a changing world,",
          "offset": 2020,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "33:40"
        },
        {
          "text": "beginning to settle down and farm. But",
          "offset": 2024,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "33:43"
        },
        {
          "text": "here, not yet.",
          "offset": 2027,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "33:46"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 2031,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "33:50"
        },
        {
          "text": "clearly possessing a complex and",
          "offset": 2032,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "33:52"
        },
        {
          "text": "well-developed culture and mythology",
          "offset": 2035,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "33:54"
        },
        {
          "text": "reminiscent of our Paleolithic",
          "offset": 2038,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "33:58"
        },
        {
          "text": "ancestors.",
          "offset": 2040,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "34:00"
        },
        {
          "text": "This was a sanctuary of profound",
          "offset": 2044,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "34:03"
        },
        {
          "text": "importance",
          "offset": 2046,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "34:06"
        },
        {
          "text": "on the border between hunter gatherers",
          "offset": 2050,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "34:10"
        },
        {
          "text": "and our settled world to come.",
          "offset": 2053,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "34:12"
        },
        {
          "text": "Now some 20 years later, digs continue",
          "offset": 2059,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "34:18"
        },
        {
          "text": "and the site which will always get",
          "offset": 2064,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "34:23"
        },
        {
          "text": "funding only becomes more and more",
          "offset": 2066,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "34:26"
        },
        {
          "text": "interesting.",
          "offset": 2070,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "34:30"
        },
        {
          "text": "Geoysical surveys continue to show vast",
          "offset": 2075,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "34:34"
        },
        {
          "text": "numbers of other structures still buried",
          "offset": 2078,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "34:38"
        },
        {
          "text": "under the earth. Only 5% of the site",
          "offset": 2081,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "34:40"
        },
        {
          "text": "having been excavated.",
          "offset": 2084,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "34:44"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 2086,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "34:45"
        },
        {
          "text": "Today, Gabbecepe remains one of the key",
          "offset": 2091,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "34:51"
        },
        {
          "text": "sites for understanding the transition",
          "offset": 2094,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "34:54"
        },
        {
          "text": "from hunters to farming",
          "offset": 2097,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "34:56"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 2100,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "35:00"
        },
        {
          "text": "and the birth of civilization as we know",
          "offset": 2102,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "35:02"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 2109,
          "duration": 13,
          "formattedTime": "35:08"
        },
        {
          "text": "When viewed from the old castle in Urer,",
          "offset": 2118,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "35:18"
        },
        {
          "text": "Goeclete can clearly be seen on the",
          "offset": 2121,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "35:21"
        },
        {
          "text": "western horizon.",
          "offset": 2124,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "35:24"
        },
        {
          "text": "Its pot-bellied silhouette is the",
          "offset": 2127,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "35:26"
        },
        {
          "text": "highest point on the windswept earth",
          "offset": 2129,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "35:29"
        },
        {
          "text": "plane.",
          "offset": 2132,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "35:31"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 2135,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "35:34"
        },
        {
          "text": "On first glance, particularly in the",
          "offset": 2136,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "35:35"
        },
        {
          "text": "height of summer, it seems an",
          "offset": 2138,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "35:38"
        },
        {
          "text": "unforgiving place, trapped in the gaze",
          "offset": 2140,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "35:40"
        },
        {
          "text": "of the boiling sun, without any obvious",
          "offset": 2144,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "35:43"
        },
        {
          "text": "source of water.",
          "offset": 2148,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "35:47"
        },
        {
          "text": "And yet, the probable remains of a Roman",
          "offset": 2153,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "35:53"
        },
        {
          "text": "watchtower stand on the hillside.",
          "offset": 2156,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "35:56"
        },
        {
          "text": "clear evidence of ancient quarrying all",
          "offset": 2160,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "35:59"
        },
        {
          "text": "around.",
          "offset": 2163,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "36:02"
        },
        {
          "text": "On closer inspection, at more than half",
          "offset": 2167,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "36:06"
        },
        {
          "text": "a meter in diameter, it's possible that",
          "offset": 2170,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "36:09"
        },
        {
          "text": "the large stone rings all over the site",
          "offset": 2172,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "36:12"
        },
        {
          "text": "could have served as sisterns for",
          "offset": 2175,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "36:15"
        },
        {
          "text": "rainwater.",
          "offset": 2177,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "36:17"
        },
        {
          "text": "And from the top of the hill, you can",
          "offset": 2182,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "36:21"
        },
        {
          "text": "see springs dotted around, such as those",
          "offset": 2184,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "36:24"
        },
        {
          "text": "at nearby Balac, and perhaps more",
          "offset": 2188,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "36:28"
        },
        {
          "text": "existed in antiquity,",
          "offset": 2192,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "36:31"
        },
        {
          "text": "long since having dried away.",
          "offset": 2194,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "36:34"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 2199,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "36:38"
        },
        {
          "text": "What is obvious from walking the ridge",
          "offset": 2200,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "36:40"
        },
        {
          "text": "line on the pot-bellied hill",
          "offset": 2203,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "36:42"
        },
        {
          "text": "is that it very much possesses a",
          "offset": 2206,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "36:45"
        },
        {
          "text": "commanding view of a landscape all",
          "offset": 2208,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "36:48"
        },
        {
          "text": "around.",
          "offset": 2210,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "36:50"
        },
        {
          "text": "the Taurus mountains to the north and",
          "offset": 2213,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "36:52"
        },
        {
          "text": "the plains of Haran to the south.",
          "offset": 2215,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "36:55"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 2218,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "36:58"
        },
        {
          "text": "When arriving from the south, in",
          "offset": 2223,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "37:02"
        },
        {
          "text": "particular, the next city of Mardin,",
          "offset": 2225,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "37:05"
        },
        {
          "text": "another vaunted settlement famous from",
          "offset": 2228,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "37:08"
        },
        {
          "text": "Crusader times,",
          "offset": 2231,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "37:10"
        },
        {
          "text": "Gobecletepe can clearly be picked out",
          "offset": 2233,
          "duration": 9,
          "formattedTime": "37:13"
        },
        {
          "text": "from a distance of some 20 km or more.",
          "offset": 2236,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "37:16"
        },
        {
          "text": "With the benefit of hindsight, it is",
          "offset": 2242,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "37:22"
        },
        {
          "text": "difficult to understand how such a place",
          "offset": 2244,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "37:24"
        },
        {
          "text": "was missed.",
          "offset": 2247,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "37:27"
        },
        {
          "text": "The landscape itself seeming to hint at",
          "offset": 2249,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "37:29"
        },
        {
          "text": "a certain level of significance",
          "offset": 2252,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "37:32"
        },
        {
          "text": "once you know where you're looking.",
          "offset": 2256,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "37:35"
        },
        {
          "text": "And when the buildings finally began to",
          "offset": 2263,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "37:42"
        },
        {
          "text": "be stabilized and excavated in the mid",
          "offset": 2265,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "37:45"
        },
        {
          "text": "1990s,",
          "offset": 2268,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "37:47"
        },
        {
          "text": "sunken chambers dug deep into the",
          "offset": 2270,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "37:50"
        },
        {
          "text": "hillside, opening up for the first time",
          "offset": 2273,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "37:52"
        },
        {
          "text": "in well over 10,000 years.",
          "offset": 2276,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "37:56"
        },
        {
          "text": "The place only became more and more",
          "offset": 2280,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "37:59"
        },
        {
          "text": "unusual.",
          "offset": 2284,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "38:03"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 2286,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "38:05"
        },
        {
          "text": "No obvious fireplaces were found,",
          "offset": 2288,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "38:07"
        },
        {
          "text": "no ovens,",
          "offset": 2291,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "38:11"
        },
        {
          "text": "no trace of domestic life of any sort,",
          "offset": 2294,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "38:13"
        },
        {
          "text": "wrote Claus Schmidt in an early report,",
          "offset": 2297,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "38:17"
        },
        {
          "text": "concluding the structures to not only be",
          "offset": 2302,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "38:21"
        },
        {
          "text": "unroved, but ultimately unsuitable for",
          "offset": 2304,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "38:24"
        },
        {
          "text": "human habitation.",
          "offset": 2308,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "38:27"
        },
        {
          "text": "In stark contrast to Navali Chry which",
          "offset": 2311,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "38:30"
        },
        {
          "text": "in its later phases at least was settled",
          "offset": 2315,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "38:34"
        },
        {
          "text": "by very early sedentary farmers living",
          "offset": 2318,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "38:38"
        },
        {
          "text": "in permanent houses.",
          "offset": 2322,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "38:41"
        },
        {
          "text": "Goeclete",
          "offset": 2324,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "38:44"
        },
        {
          "text": "with no evidence of settled agriculture",
          "offset": 2326,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "38:45"
        },
        {
          "text": "whatsoever",
          "offset": 2329,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "38:48"
        },
        {
          "text": "seemed to be purely ceremonial in",
          "offset": 2330,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "38:50"
        },
        {
          "text": "character.",
          "offset": 2334,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "38:53"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 2335,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "38:55"
        },
        {
          "text": "For Schmidt, all of the excavated",
          "offset": 2338,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "38:58"
        },
        {
          "text": "buildings from the second and third",
          "offset": 2341,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "39:00"
        },
        {
          "text": "levels at Gbeclete",
          "offset": 2343,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "39:02"
        },
        {
          "text": "had been houses,",
          "offset": 2345,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "39:05"
        },
        {
          "text": "but of the divine,",
          "offset": 2348,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "39:07"
        },
        {
          "text": "at least in the lower levels, built not",
          "offset": 2354,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "39:14"
        },
        {
          "text": "by early Neolithic farmers,",
          "offset": 2358,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "39:17"
        },
        {
          "text": "but by hunter gatherers still living",
          "offset": 2361,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "39:20"
        },
        {
          "text": "from the foraged bounty of the earth.",
          "offset": 2364,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "39:23"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 2367,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "39:26"
        },
        {
          "text": "Just maybe like Greek Deli or Kusco in",
          "offset": 2369,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "39:29"
        },
        {
          "text": "Peru,",
          "offset": 2373,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "39:33"
        },
        {
          "text": "sacred navls of the earth where pilgrims",
          "offset": 2375,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "39:34"
        },
        {
          "text": "would travel from afar for sporadic",
          "offset": 2378,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "39:37"
        },
        {
          "text": "festival activities including the",
          "offset": 2381,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "39:41"
        },
        {
          "text": "raising of vast monuments to ancient",
          "offset": 2384,
          "duration": 9,
          "formattedTime": "39:43"
        },
        {
          "text": "gods, ancestors or demons.",
          "offset": 2387,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "39:46"
        },
        {
          "text": "But not living at the site all year",
          "offset": 2392,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "39:52"
        },
        {
          "text": "round.",
          "offset": 2395,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "39:54"
        },
        {
          "text": "Quebec could have been a cultic site.",
          "offset": 2396,
          "duration": 9,
          "formattedTime": "39:56"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 2402,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "40:02"
        },
        {
          "text": "A vast collection of animal remains have",
          "offset": 2406,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "40:05"
        },
        {
          "text": "been uncovered at Gbeclete,",
          "offset": 2409,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "40:08"
        },
        {
          "text": "including cattle, pigs, goats, and large",
          "offset": 2412,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "40:11"
        },
        {
          "text": "numbers of gazelle.",
          "offset": 2416,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "40:16"
        },
        {
          "text": "But after intense study by some of the",
          "offset": 2419,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "40:19"
        },
        {
          "text": "leading experts in the world, all of the",
          "offset": 2422,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "40:21"
        },
        {
          "text": "animals were found to have been wild and",
          "offset": 2425,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "40:24"
        },
        {
          "text": "not domesticated variants which have",
          "offset": 2428,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "40:28"
        },
        {
          "text": "different bone structures.",
          "offset": 2431,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "40:31"
        },
        {
          "text": "Same as the plant remains, wild almond,",
          "offset": 2435,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "40:34"
        },
        {
          "text": "pistachio, and grains being found in",
          "offset": 2439,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "40:38"
        },
        {
          "text": "abundance,",
          "offset": 2442,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "40:41"
        },
        {
          "text": "wild variants of which still grow in the",
          "offset": 2444,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "40:43"
        },
        {
          "text": "area today.",
          "offset": 2447,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "40:46"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 2448,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "40:48"
        },
        {
          "text": "One early idea that made its way into",
          "offset": 2452,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "40:51"
        },
        {
          "text": "the popular zeitgeist in the late '9s,",
          "offset": 2454,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "40:54"
        },
        {
          "text": "posited in part due to the glossed",
          "offset": 2457,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "40:57"
        },
        {
          "text": "sickle blades and early forms of wild",
          "offset": 2460,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "40:59"
        },
        {
          "text": "wheat found at the site,",
          "offset": 2463,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "41:02"
        },
        {
          "text": "was the suggestion of Gbeclete having",
          "offset": 2465,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "41:05"
        },
        {
          "text": "been one of the actual locations where",
          "offset": 2468,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "41:08"
        },
        {
          "text": "the process of neolithsization",
          "offset": 2471,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "41:10"
        },
        {
          "text": "began.",
          "offset": 2474,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "41:13"
        },
        {
          "text": "In other words, where hunter gatherers",
          "offset": 2480,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "41:20"
        },
        {
          "text": "first began experimenting with farming.",
          "offset": 2483,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "41:22"
        },
        {
          "text": "After all, when agriculture did begin to",
          "offset": 2490,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "41:30"
        },
        {
          "text": "take hold, analysis of ancient grains",
          "offset": 2493,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "41:33"
        },
        {
          "text": "does seem to place one of its origin",
          "offset": 2497,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "41:36"
        },
        {
          "text": "points on the earth plane.",
          "offset": 2499,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "41:38"
        },
        {
          "text": "One early idea suggests the controlled",
          "offset": 2505,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "41:45"
        },
        {
          "text": "use of cereals and other food stuff to",
          "offset": 2508,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "41:48"
        },
        {
          "text": "have resulted from overexloitation of",
          "offset": 2511,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "41:51"
        },
        {
          "text": "local resources",
          "offset": 2514,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "41:53"
        },
        {
          "text": "as a result of increasingly large groups",
          "offset": 2516,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "41:55"
        },
        {
          "text": "of people congregating over an extended",
          "offset": 2518,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "41:58"
        },
        {
          "text": "period of time.",
          "offset": 2521,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "42:01"
        },
        {
          "text": "In his 2004 masterpiece, After the Ice,",
          "offset": 2525,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "42:04"
        },
        {
          "text": "Steven Mithan goes further, conjuring up",
          "offset": 2528,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "42:08"
        },
        {
          "text": "images of acolytes ritualistically",
          "offset": 2532,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "42:12"
        },
        {
          "text": "handing seeds back and forth at some",
          "offset": 2535,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "42:14"
        },
        {
          "text": "long-lost ancient ceremonies",
          "offset": 2537,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "42:17"
        },
        {
          "text": "before moving on to other local to",
          "offset": 2541,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "42:20"
        },
        {
          "text": "spread some foundational message or",
          "offset": 2544,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "42:23"
        },
        {
          "text": "story.",
          "offset": 2547,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "42:26"
        },
        {
          "text": "We know from elsewhere in the world that",
          "offset": 2550,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "42:30"
        },
        {
          "text": "stone circles and megaliths are often",
          "offset": 2553,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "42:33"
        },
        {
          "text": "erected at times of great turmoil and",
          "offset": 2556,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "42:36"
        },
        {
          "text": "change.",
          "offset": 2560,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "42:39"
        },
        {
          "text": "By 2014, Klaus Schmidt had published a",
          "offset": 2565,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "42:44"
        },
        {
          "text": "number of articles and a detailed book",
          "offset": 2568,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "42:48"
        },
        {
          "text": "on the initial finds at Gabbecepe",
          "offset": 2572,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "42:52"
        },
        {
          "text": "and another was on the way.",
          "offset": 2575,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "42:55"
        },
        {
          "text": "Still only 3 or 4% of the site having",
          "offset": 2579,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "42:59"
        },
        {
          "text": "been excavated,",
          "offset": 2583,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "43:02"
        },
        {
          "text": "though already making it one of the top",
          "offset": 2584,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "43:04"
        },
        {
          "text": "archaeological destinations in the",
          "offset": 2587,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "43:07"
        },
        {
          "text": "world,",
          "offset": 2589,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "43:09"
        },
        {
          "text": "making its way into all sorts of",
          "offset": 2592,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "43:12"
        },
        {
          "text": "pseudoarchchaeological theories in the",
          "offset": 2594,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "43:14"
        },
        {
          "text": "process.",
          "offset": 2596,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "43:16"
        },
        {
          "text": "For 20 years, ever modest and patient,",
          "offset": 2601,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "43:21"
        },
        {
          "text": "Claus Schmidt had been a willing servant",
          "offset": 2604,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "43:24"
        },
        {
          "text": "to the site,",
          "offset": 2607,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "43:26"
        },
        {
          "text": "devoting all of his energy to speaking",
          "offset": 2609,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "43:29"
        },
        {
          "text": "tours and tourism, to fighting",
          "offset": 2612,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "43:31"
        },
        {
          "text": "misinformation and spreading awareness",
          "offset": 2614,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "43:34"
        },
        {
          "text": "of archaeology to the general public.",
          "offset": 2617,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "43:36"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 2620,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "43:39"
        },
        {
          "text": "always making himself available, even",
          "offset": 2622,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "43:42"
        },
        {
          "text": "when publicly attacked by fringe",
          "offset": 2625,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "43:45"
        },
        {
          "text": "theorists and dogmatic aging",
          "offset": 2628,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "43:47"
        },
        {
          "text": "archaeologists alike.",
          "offset": 2630,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "43:49"
        },
        {
          "text": "Finally, by 2014, it all came to an end.",
          "offset": 2635,
          "duration": 9,
          "formattedTime": "43:55"
        },
        {
          "text": "One Sunday afternoon, in a swimming pool",
          "offset": 2642,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "44:01"
        },
        {
          "text": "back in his native Germany, Klaus",
          "offset": 2644,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "44:04"
        },
        {
          "text": "Schmidt's heart gave out.",
          "offset": 2647,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "44:07"
        },
        {
          "text": "By the time of his death in 2014,",
          "offset": 2656,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "44:15"
        },
        {
          "text": "Klaus Schmidt had already cemented his",
          "offset": 2661,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "44:20"
        },
        {
          "text": "place in the annals of archaeology.",
          "offset": 2664,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "44:23"
        },
        {
          "text": "His dig will go down as one of the most",
          "offset": 2668,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "44:27"
        },
        {
          "text": "famous in all of history,",
          "offset": 2670,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "44:30"
        },
        {
          "text": "completely altering our understanding of",
          "offset": 2674,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "44:33"
        },
        {
          "text": "the origins of civilization as we know",
          "offset": 2676,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "44:36"
        },
        {
          "text": "it.",
          "offset": 2679,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "44:38"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 2680,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "44:39"
        },
        {
          "text": "Like Troy, Olympia, and the great Mayan",
          "offset": 2681,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "44:41"
        },
        {
          "text": "ruins of Copan, digs will likely go on",
          "offset": 2684,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "44:44"
        },
        {
          "text": "for another century or more. The place",
          "offset": 2688,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "44:47"
        },
        {
          "text": "will never struggle to get funding.",
          "offset": 2691,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "44:51"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 2694,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "44:54"
        },
        {
          "text": "And most amazing of all, by that time,",
          "offset": 2697,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "44:56"
        },
        {
          "text": "and in the years since, yet more similar",
          "offset": 2701,
          "duration": 9,
          "formattedTime": "45:00"
        },
        {
          "text": "sites have been unearthed, too.",
          "offset": 2704,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "45:04"
        },
        {
          "text": "perhaps most famously at Carahan Teepe,",
          "offset": 2713,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "45:12"
        },
        {
          "text": "but a whole host of others being dug",
          "offset": 2717,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "45:17"
        },
        {
          "text": "too, partly by an entire new generation",
          "offset": 2720,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "45:19"
        },
        {
          "text": "of eager Turkish archaeologists",
          "offset": 2723,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "45:23"
        },
        {
          "text": "inspired by the likes of Klaus Schmidt.",
          "offset": 2727,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "45:26"
        },
        {
          "text": "The results are astonishing.",
          "offset": 2733,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "45:32"
        },
        {
          "text": "Far from an isolated phenomenon,",
          "offset": 2736,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "45:35"
        },
        {
          "text": "Gabbecepe was part of an entire culture",
          "offset": 2738,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "45:38"
        },
        {
          "text": "similarly built by hunter gatherers,",
          "offset": 2743,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "45:42"
        },
        {
          "text": "many of whom, like its Chanu and Navali",
          "offset": 2745,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "45:45"
        },
        {
          "text": "Chry, turned ultimately to incipient",
          "offset": 2748,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "45:48"
        },
        {
          "text": "agriculture by the end of the lifespans",
          "offset": 2751,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "45:51"
        },
        {
          "text": "of their settlements.",
          "offset": 2754,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "45:53"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 2755,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "45:55"
        },
        {
          "text": "When compared to the common model of",
          "offset": 2759,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "45:58"
        },
        {
          "text": "previously discovered early farming",
          "offset": 2761,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "46:01"
        },
        {
          "text": "communities in the near east, generally",
          "offset": 2763,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "46:03"
        },
        {
          "text": "located further along the Levventine",
          "offset": 2766,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "46:05"
        },
        {
          "text": "shore to the south at places like",
          "offset": 2768,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "46:08"
        },
        {
          "text": "Jericho,",
          "offset": 2770,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "46:10"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 2771,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "46:11"
        },
        {
          "text": "Gobecley and its sister sites offers a",
          "offset": 2774,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "46:13"
        },
        {
          "text": "very different point of view",
          "offset": 2778,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "46:17"
        },
        {
          "text": "here. Rather than domestic dwellings,",
          "offset": 2783,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "46:22"
        },
        {
          "text": "the utmost effort seems to have been",
          "offset": 2786,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "46:25"
        },
        {
          "text": "placed in creating monuments of a",
          "offset": 2788,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "46:28"
        },
        {
          "text": "nonutilitarian",
          "offset": 2791,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "46:31"
        },
        {
          "text": "nature.",
          "offset": 2793,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "46:32"
        },
        {
          "text": "Vast amounts of time and energy going",
          "offset": 2795,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "46:34"
        },
        {
          "text": "into creating more than 200 T-shaped",
          "offset": 2798,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "46:37"
        },
        {
          "text": "pillars, the largest of which stand",
          "offset": 2801,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "46:40"
        },
        {
          "text": "three or four times taller than the",
          "offset": 2804,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "46:44"
        },
        {
          "text": "height of a person.",
          "offset": 2806,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "46:46"
        },
        {
          "text": "intricately arrayed into at least 20",
          "offset": 2809,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "46:49"
        },
        {
          "text": "stone circles coated in carvings.",
          "offset": 2812,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "46:52"
        },
        {
          "text": "Stretching for some 25 acres, the place",
          "offset": 2816,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "46:56"
        },
        {
          "text": "was clearly of the utmost importance to",
          "offset": 2820,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "47:00"
        },
        {
          "text": "all who took part,",
          "offset": 2823,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "47:03"
        },
        {
          "text": "only to be intentionally filled around",
          "offset": 2827,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "47:07"
        },
        {
          "text": "8,000 BC,",
          "offset": 2830,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "47:10"
        },
        {
          "text": "consigned to oblivion at the end of its",
          "offset": 2833,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "47:12"
        },
        {
          "text": "life.",
          "offset": 2836,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "47:15"
        },
        {
          "text": "Even more paradigm-breaking was the fact",
          "offset": 2839,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "47:18"
        },
        {
          "text": "that it was the earliest levels that",
          "offset": 2842,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "47:21"
        },
        {
          "text": "yielded some of the largest and most",
          "offset": 2844,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "47:24"
        },
        {
          "text": "impressive pillars and animal carvings.",
          "offset": 2847,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "47:27"
        },
        {
          "text": "In complete defiance of conventional",
          "offset": 2852,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "47:32"
        },
        {
          "text": "logic, the monoliths seemed to get",
          "offset": 2855,
          "duration": 9,
          "formattedTime": "47:35"
        },
        {
          "text": "smaller and more modest over time.",
          "offset": 2859,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "47:38"
        },
        {
          "text": "Far from a hypothesized beginning of all",
          "offset": 2865,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "47:45"
        },
        {
          "text": "things,",
          "offset": 2868,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "47:48"
        },
        {
          "text": "Gobeclete",
          "offset": 2870,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "47:50"
        },
        {
          "text": "seems curiously like an end,",
          "offset": 2872,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "47:51"
        },
        {
          "text": "hinting of a great mythological",
          "offset": 2877,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "47:56"
        },
        {
          "text": "tradition stretching far back into the",
          "offset": 2879,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "47:59"
        },
        {
          "text": "perennial mists of the Ice Age.",
          "offset": 2882,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "48:02"
        },
        {
          "text": "It's even possible that longlost wooden",
          "offset": 2890,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "48:10"
        },
        {
          "text": "circles preceded it.",
          "offset": 2894,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "48:14"
        },
        {
          "text": "similarly once vaunted monuments that",
          "offset": 2897,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "48:17"
        },
        {
          "text": "rotted away to oblivion so many",
          "offset": 2900,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "48:20"
        },
        {
          "text": "thousands of years in the past.",
          "offset": 2903,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "48:23"
        },
        {
          "text": "for Claus Schmidt, ever living in hope",
          "offset": 2909,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "48:29"
        },
        {
          "text": "of finding a foundational cemetery site",
          "offset": 2912,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "48:32"
        },
        {
          "text": "under one of the enclosures",
          "offset": 2915,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "48:34"
        },
        {
          "text": "and partly in light of arms and hands",
          "offset": 2917,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "48:37"
        },
        {
          "text": "having been found adorning some of the",
          "offset": 2920,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "48:40"
        },
        {
          "text": "pillars. They perhaps having once",
          "offset": 2922,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "48:42"
        },
        {
          "text": "represented individuals.",
          "offset": 2925,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "48:45"
        },
        {
          "text": "The site may have been a monument to",
          "offset": 2932,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "48:51"
        },
        {
          "text": "revered ancestors.",
          "offset": 2935,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "48:55"
        },
        {
          "text": "Clearly, whatever its purpose, this was",
          "offset": 2942,
          "duration": 9,
          "formattedTime": "49:01"
        },
        {
          "text": "a place built with great skill and care.",
          "offset": 2945,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "49:05"
        },
        {
          "text": "The 7 m long threaded pillar still lying",
          "offset": 2951,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "49:11"
        },
        {
          "text": "in its quarry on the northern plateau",
          "offset": 2954,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "49:14"
        },
        {
          "text": "tells us that much",
          "offset": 2956,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "49:16"
        },
        {
          "text": "with other quarry sites found around the",
          "offset": 2959,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "49:18"
        },
        {
          "text": "hill.",
          "offset": 2961,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "49:21"
        },
        {
          "text": "Though it wasn't only construction",
          "offset": 2966,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "49:26"
        },
        {
          "text": "technologies that were in use here,",
          "offset": 2968,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "49:28"
        },
        {
          "text": "but logistical support networks just as",
          "offset": 2972,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "49:32"
        },
        {
          "text": "well-developed as the mythology and",
          "offset": 2975,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "49:35"
        },
        {
          "text": "ritual lives of this most ancient of",
          "offset": 2978,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "49:37"
        },
        {
          "text": "prehistoric societies.",
          "offset": 2980,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "49:40"
        },
        {
          "text": "Far from long-standing construction",
          "offset": 2987,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "49:46"
        },
        {
          "text": "projects put together over lengthy",
          "offset": 2989,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "49:48"
        },
        {
          "text": "periods of time, the archaeology",
          "offset": 2991,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "49:51"
        },
        {
          "text": "suggests each enclosure having been",
          "offset": 2994,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "49:54"
        },
        {
          "text": "raised in a singular weeks or monthsl",
          "offset": 2996,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "49:56"
        },
        {
          "text": "long event.",
          "offset": 2999,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "49:59"
        },
        {
          "text": "Without animal power nor metal tools,",
          "offset": 3004,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "50:03"
        },
        {
          "text": "Schmidt hypothesized that around 500",
          "offset": 3007,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "50:07"
        },
        {
          "text": "people would be required as labor.",
          "offset": 3011,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "50:10"
        },
        {
          "text": "further speculating on the existence of",
          "offset": 3015,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "50:14"
        },
        {
          "text": "some kind of a priestly class to plan,",
          "offset": 3017,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "50:17"
        },
        {
          "text": "organize, and contextualize the work.",
          "offset": 3020,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "50:20"
        },
        {
          "text": "Perhaps either intentionally or",
          "offset": 3028,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "50:28"
        },
        {
          "text": "inadvertently united in a singular",
          "offset": 3030,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "50:30"
        },
        {
          "text": "purpose, it had the effect of binding",
          "offset": 3033,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "50:33"
        },
        {
          "text": "the group together,",
          "offset": 3036,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "50:36"
        },
        {
          "text": "a form of communal worship operating as",
          "offset": 3038,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "50:38"
        },
        {
          "text": "the social glue.",
          "offset": 3042,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "50:41"
        },
        {
          "text": "Since Claus Schmidt's death, an",
          "offset": 3047,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "50:47"
        },
        {
          "text": "increasingly wide range of alternate",
          "offset": 3050,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "50:49"
        },
        {
          "text": "hypotheses have been discussed, too.",
          "offset": 3052,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "50:51"
        },
        {
          "text": "far away in the midst of the distant",
          "offset": 3062,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "51:02"
        },
        {
          "text": "Pacific Ocean. Experiments with the",
          "offset": 3065,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "51:04"
        },
        {
          "text": "megaliths of Easter Island have shown",
          "offset": 3067,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "51:07"
        },
        {
          "text": "that the moai there could in fact have",
          "offset": 3070,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "51:09"
        },
        {
          "text": "been crafted and erected by",
          "offset": 3072,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "51:12"
        },
        {
          "text": "significantly smaller groups of people",
          "offset": 3074,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "51:14"
        },
        {
          "text": "than Schmidt's hundreds.",
          "offset": 3077,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "51:16"
        },
        {
          "text": "In one experiment, just 12 men were able",
          "offset": 3080,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "51:20"
        },
        {
          "text": "to raise a 20 ton statue in just under 3",
          "offset": 3083,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "51:23"
        },
        {
          "text": "weeks.",
          "offset": 3087,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "51:26"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 3089,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "51:29"
        },
        {
          "text": "It is plausible, though by no means",
          "offset": 3091,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "51:30"
        },
        {
          "text": "definitive, that Schmidt overstated the",
          "offset": 3093,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "51:33"
        },
        {
          "text": "amount of labor needed at Quebec,",
          "offset": 3096,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "51:35"
        },
        {
          "text": "with just a few dozen individuals",
          "offset": 3101,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "51:41"
        },
        {
          "text": "potentially having quarried and erected",
          "offset": 3104,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "51:43"
        },
        {
          "text": "the monoliths there.",
          "offset": 3106,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "51:46"
        },
        {
          "text": "Given the sunken nature of the",
          "offset": 3115,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "51:54"
        },
        {
          "text": "enclosures and the particularly",
          "offset": 3117,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "51:56"
        },
        {
          "text": "impressive floors within, it is also",
          "offset": 3119,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "51:59"
        },
        {
          "text": "possible that the megaliths did indeed",
          "offset": 3122,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "52:02"
        },
        {
          "text": "once support roofs,",
          "offset": 3126,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "52:05"
        },
        {
          "text": "an artificial cave rather than temple to",
          "offset": 3129,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "52:09"
        },
        {
          "text": "the star-studded sky",
          "offset": 3133,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "52:12"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 3137,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "52:16"
        },
        {
          "text": "like at Nali Chry and Shanu.",
          "offset": 3142,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "52:22"
        },
        {
          "text": "The flooring found in the enclosures at",
          "offset": 3146,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "52:25"
        },
        {
          "text": "Gobecletepe was made in a style known as",
          "offset": 3148,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "52:27"
        },
        {
          "text": "terratzo.",
          "offset": 3151,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "52:30"
        },
        {
          "text": "The earliest such examples found",
          "offset": 3153,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "52:32"
        },
        {
          "text": "anywhere in the world. Laboriously",
          "offset": 3155,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "52:35"
        },
        {
          "text": "created by layering burned lime and clay",
          "offset": 3159,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "52:38"
        },
        {
          "text": "over and over again to create a smooth",
          "offset": 3162,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "52:41"
        },
        {
          "text": "luxurious surface.",
          "offset": 3165,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "52:44"
        },
        {
          "text": "At Navali Chry and Chanu however only",
          "offset": 3170,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "52:49"
        },
        {
          "text": "one example has been found at Gabbecepe",
          "offset": 3173,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "52:53"
        },
        {
          "text": "they appear over and over again.",
          "offset": 3177,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "52:57"
        },
        {
          "text": "In one case four Terratzo floors having",
          "offset": 3181,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "53:01"
        },
        {
          "text": "been built directly on top of one",
          "offset": 3185,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "53:04"
        },
        {
          "text": "another down the long generations.",
          "offset": 3187,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "53:06"
        },
        {
          "text": "for all the work of an army of",
          "offset": 3194,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "53:14"
        },
        {
          "text": "scientists and scholars.",
          "offset": 3197,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "53:16"
        },
        {
          "text": "It of course remains impossible to fully",
          "offset": 3199,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "53:19"
        },
        {
          "text": "reconstruct the interactions of that",
          "offset": 3202,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "53:22"
        },
        {
          "text": "longgone culture today",
          "offset": 3205,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "53:24"
        },
        {
          "text": "of how the people at Gabbecley",
          "offset": 3208,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "53:28"
        },
        {
          "text": "interacted with Chanu Navali Chryahan",
          "offset": 3210,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "53:30"
        },
        {
          "text": "and the others. Whether they borrowed",
          "offset": 3215,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "53:34"
        },
        {
          "text": "elements from each other into their own",
          "offset": 3217,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "53:37"
        },
        {
          "text": "way of life.",
          "offset": 3219,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "53:39"
        },
        {
          "text": "whether they already shared the same",
          "offset": 3221,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "53:41"
        },
        {
          "text": "culture and stories.",
          "offset": 3223,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "53:43"
        },
        {
          "text": "However, the same themes do crop up",
          "offset": 3227,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "53:47"
        },
        {
          "text": "again and again. Most obviously in the",
          "offset": 3231,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "53:51"
        },
        {
          "text": "myriad carvings and baz reliefs that",
          "offset": 3235,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "53:54"
        },
        {
          "text": "march, crawl, and fly over every visible",
          "offset": 3238,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "53:57"
        },
        {
          "text": "surface.",
          "offset": 3242,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "54:01"
        },
        {
          "text": "Almost all of the depictions are of",
          "offset": 3245,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "54:04"
        },
        {
          "text": "animals.",
          "offset": 3248,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "54:07"
        },
        {
          "text": "appearing so fully formed and so near",
          "offset": 3251,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "54:11"
        },
        {
          "text": "unfathomably old to be difficult to",
          "offset": 3255,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "54:14"
        },
        {
          "text": "comprehend.",
          "offset": 3258,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "54:17"
        },
        {
          "text": "It is these exceptionally artistic",
          "offset": 3263,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "54:22"
        },
        {
          "text": "carvings that give us the best chance of",
          "offset": 3266,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "54:25"
        },
        {
          "text": "bringing back from extinction just a",
          "offset": 3269,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "54:28"
        },
        {
          "text": "little of that clearly well-developed",
          "offset": 3271,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "54:31"
        },
        {
          "text": "ancient culture.",
          "offset": 3274,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "54:33"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 3276,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "54:36"
        },
        {
          "text": "giving us some insights into just why",
          "offset": 3278,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "54:37"
        },
        {
          "text": "this place came into being and some",
          "offset": 3280,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "54:40"
        },
        {
          "text": "inkling into the long road to our world",
          "offset": 3284,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "54:43"
        },
        {
          "text": "which may have been forged in the",
          "offset": 3287,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "54:47"
        },
        {
          "text": "process",
          "offset": 3289,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "54:49"
        },
        {
          "text": "in 1993",
          "offset": 3302,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "55:01"
        },
        {
          "text": "just before the discoveries at Gabbecepe",
          "offset": 3304,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "55:03"
        },
        {
          "text": "Construction workers digging around the",
          "offset": 3308,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "55:07"
        },
        {
          "text": "Balacagal area of the Urer city center",
          "offset": 3310,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "55:10"
        },
        {
          "text": "came across something they weren't",
          "offset": 3313,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "55:13"
        },
        {
          "text": "expecting.",
          "offset": 3316,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "55:15"
        },
        {
          "text": "A stride the ancient deep water springs",
          "offset": 3322,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "55:21"
        },
        {
          "text": "known today as the pools of Abraham.",
          "offset": 3325,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "55:24"
        },
        {
          "text": "Blank lifeless eyes stared back from the",
          "offset": 3329,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "55:28"
        },
        {
          "text": "foundation rubble.",
          "offset": 3333,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "55:32"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 3340,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "55:40"
        },
        {
          "text": "Prominently displayed today in the",
          "offset": 3342,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "55:42"
        },
        {
          "text": "cuttingedge new museum at the heart of",
          "offset": 3344,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "55:44"
        },
        {
          "text": "the city, the forer man stands at 1.8 m",
          "offset": 3347,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "55:46"
        },
        {
          "text": "tall.",
          "offset": 3352,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "55:52"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 3354,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "55:53"
        },
        {
          "text": "At around 11,000 years old, it is the",
          "offset": 3356,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "55:55"
        },
        {
          "text": "oldest life-sized naturalistic sculpture",
          "offset": 3359,
          "duration": 9,
          "formattedTime": "55:58"
        },
        {
          "text": "of a human ever discovered in the world.",
          "offset": 3362,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "56:02"
        },
        {
          "text": "and though very heavily damaged by",
          "offset": 3368,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "56:08"
        },
        {
          "text": "construction work down the long",
          "offset": 3371,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "56:10"
        },
        {
          "text": "millennia since its creation. When",
          "offset": 3372,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "56:12"
        },
        {
          "text": "briefly investigated in 1997 before",
          "offset": 3375,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "56:15"
        },
        {
          "text": "construction work was finished, the",
          "offset": 3379,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "56:18"
        },
        {
          "text": "earth around the statue turned out to be",
          "offset": 3381,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "56:20"
        },
        {
          "text": "a pre- pottery Neolithic settlement with",
          "offset": 3384,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "56:23"
        },
        {
          "text": "similarities to Quebec.",
          "offset": 3388,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "56:27"
        },
        {
          "text": "concrete evidence of the deep antiquity",
          "offset": 3392,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "56:31"
        },
        {
          "text": "of the city.",
          "offset": 3395,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "56:35"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 3397,
          "duration": 9,
          "formattedTime": "56:36"
        },
        {
          "text": "And yet the sculptures at Gbeclete are",
          "offset": 3401,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "56:41"
        },
        {
          "text": "quite different from even the pre-",
          "offset": 3405,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "56:45"
        },
        {
          "text": "pottery Neolithic world at the very",
          "offset": 3408,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "56:47"
        },
        {
          "text": "beginning of agriculture.",
          "offset": 3411,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "56:50"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 3413,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "56:53"
        },
        {
          "text": "Theirs was a symbolic landscape",
          "offset": 3416,
          "duration": 9,
          "formattedTime": "56:56"
        },
        {
          "text": "populated almost entirely by the wild.",
          "offset": 3419,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "56:58"
        },
        {
          "text": "On all of the excavated enclosures,",
          "offset": 3428,
          "duration": 13,
          "formattedTime": "57:07"
        },
        {
          "text": "particularly on A, B, C, D, E, and F.",
          "offset": 3431,
          "duration": 9,
          "formattedTime": "57:10"
        },
        {
          "text": "Powerful animal forms are displayed,",
          "offset": 3441,
          "duration": 10,
          "formattedTime": "57:20"
        },
        {
          "text": "often depicted with prominent penises.",
          "offset": 3446,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "57:25"
        },
        {
          "text": "For some reason, unlike in early near",
          "offset": 3454,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "57:33"
        },
        {
          "text": "contemporary farming societies, the",
          "offset": 3457,
          "duration": 9,
          "formattedTime": "57:36"
        },
        {
          "text": "female form is almost never depicted.",
          "offset": 3460,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "57:39"
        },
        {
          "text": "No clay so-called earth mother figurines",
          "offset": 3467,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "57:46"
        },
        {
          "text": "are to be found",
          "offset": 3470,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "57:50"
        },
        {
          "text": "here in a quite different culture to",
          "offset": 3473,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "57:53"
        },
        {
          "text": "that of the south at places like",
          "offset": 3476,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "57:56"
        },
        {
          "text": "Jericho.",
          "offset": 3479,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "57:58"
        },
        {
          "text": "The ferocious world of the hunters took",
          "offset": 3480,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "58:00"
        },
        {
          "text": "precedent",
          "offset": 3483,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "58:02"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 3484,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "58:04"
        },
        {
          "text": "in enclosure C where three concentric",
          "offset": 3488,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "58:08"
        },
        {
          "text": "rings of walls were successively built",
          "offset": 3491,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "58:11"
        },
        {
          "text": "up one after the other over the years",
          "offset": 3494,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "58:13"
        },
        {
          "text": "gradually receding the size of the",
          "offset": 3497,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "58:16"
        },
        {
          "text": "interior.",
          "offset": 3499,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "58:18"
        },
        {
          "text": "Feral pigs dominate",
          "offset": 3500,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "58:20"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 3504,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "58:23"
        },
        {
          "text": "in this so-called house of the bo.",
          "offset": 3507,
          "duration": 11,
          "formattedTime": "58:26"
        },
        {
          "text": "Wild pigs bear their teeth menacingly.",
          "offset": 3512,
          "duration": 9,
          "formattedTime": "58:31"
        },
        {
          "text": "Another lies on its back, deceased",
          "offset": 3517,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "58:37"
        },
        {
          "text": "perhaps.",
          "offset": 3521,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "58:40"
        },
        {
          "text": "Almost all of the animals are male.",
          "offset": 3527,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "58:46"
        },
        {
          "text": "Several depictions of human skulls are",
          "offset": 3539,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "58:59"
        },
        {
          "text": "found too,",
          "offset": 3542,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "59:02"
        },
        {
          "text": "ranging from the small to larger than",
          "offset": 3544,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "59:04"
        },
        {
          "text": "life.",
          "offset": 3547,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "59:07"
        },
        {
          "text": "Some also displaying prominent and erect",
          "offset": 3550,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "59:09"
        },
        {
          "text": "penises.",
          "offset": 3553,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "59:13"
        },
        {
          "text": "Unexplained holes, stepping stones, and",
          "offset": 3559,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "59:18"
        },
        {
          "text": "small cups are found, too,",
          "offset": 3562,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "59:22"
        },
        {
          "text": "with suggestions being made of stands",
          "offset": 3566,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "59:25"
        },
        {
          "text": "for small fires to light the enclosure",
          "offset": 3568,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "59:28"
        },
        {
          "text": "during the night.",
          "offset": 3572,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "59:31"
        },
        {
          "text": "Interpretations of the enclosure range",
          "offset": 3576,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "59:35"
        },
        {
          "text": "from the cultic house of a clan",
          "offset": 3578,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "59:38"
        },
        {
          "text": "utilizing the boar as a heraldic totem",
          "offset": 3581,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "59:40"
        },
        {
          "text": "to a nightmarish depiction of beasts",
          "offset": 3586,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "59:46"
        },
        {
          "text": "guarding the entrance to the underworld.",
          "offset": 3589,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "59:49"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 3593,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "59:52"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Applause]",
          "offset": 3593,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "59:53"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 3596,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "59:56"
        },
        {
          "text": "Enclosure D, which Klaus Schmidt fondly",
          "offset": 3598,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "59:58"
        },
        {
          "text": "referred to as the Stone Age Zoo, is a",
          "offset": 3602,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "60:02"
        },
        {
          "text": "much more varied affair.",
          "offset": 3606,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "60:05"
        },
        {
          "text": "A veritable smores board of fauna on",
          "offset": 3609,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "60:08"
        },
        {
          "text": "display.",
          "offset": 3611,
          "duration": 9,
          "formattedTime": "60:11"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 3614,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "60:14"
        },
        {
          "text": "Like enclosure C, a fox can be seen",
          "offset": 3622,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "60:21"
        },
        {
          "text": "darting around the other creatures.",
          "offset": 3625,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "60:25"
        },
        {
          "text": "though this one has snakes coming out",
          "offset": 3629,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "60:29"
        },
        {
          "text": "where his penis should be.",
          "offset": 3632,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "60:31"
        },
        {
          "text": "Long seen as particularly wise animals",
          "offset": 3637,
          "duration": 9,
          "formattedTime": "60:37"
        },
        {
          "text": "in later Mesopotamian myth and beyond",
          "offset": 3641,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "60:41"
        },
        {
          "text": "and with links to potentially even",
          "offset": 3646,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "60:45"
        },
        {
          "text": "earlier shamanic beliefs",
          "offset": 3648,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "60:48"
        },
        {
          "text": "from all over the world.",
          "offset": 3653,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "60:52"
        },
        {
          "text": "Suggestions are often made of illusions",
          "offset": 3656,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "60:55"
        },
        {
          "text": "to shape-shifting rituals and transes",
          "offset": 3659,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "60:59"
        },
        {
          "text": "with the fox representing the figure of",
          "offset": 3663,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "61:03"
        },
        {
          "text": "the shaman.",
          "offset": 3666,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "61:05"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 3668,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "61:07"
        },
        {
          "text": "Elsewhere, gazelle gallop across the",
          "offset": 3672,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "61:11"
        },
        {
          "text": "stones.",
          "offset": 3675,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "61:15"
        },
        {
          "text": "Judging by their frequency on the",
          "offset": 3679,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "61:19"
        },
        {
          "text": "pillars in many of the enclosures",
          "offset": 3681,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "61:21"
        },
        {
          "text": "and in the skeletal remains, they seem",
          "offset": 3684,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "61:24"
        },
        {
          "text": "to be of particular importance.",
          "offset": 3688,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "61:27"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 3690,
          "duration": 10,
          "formattedTime": "61:30"
        },
        {
          "text": "Vultures are seen, too. creatures long",
          "offset": 3696,
          "duration": 9,
          "formattedTime": "61:35"
        },
        {
          "text": "associated with the realm of the dead.",
          "offset": 3700,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "61:39"
        },
        {
          "text": "But other birds proliferate, too.",
          "offset": 3708,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "61:47"
        },
        {
          "text": "Cranes, a type of migratory water bird,",
          "offset": 3712,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "61:52"
        },
        {
          "text": "are common, perhaps suggesting some",
          "offset": 3716,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "61:55"
        },
        {
          "text": "appreciation for the particularly",
          "offset": 3718,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "61:58"
        },
        {
          "text": "striking dance periodically undertaken",
          "offset": 3720,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "62:00"
        },
        {
          "text": "by these animals.",
          "offset": 3723,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "62:02"
        },
        {
          "text": "Among",
          "offset": 3726,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "62:05"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 3728,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "62:08"
        },
        {
          "text": "the more frequent motifs depicted at",
          "offset": 3730,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "62:10"
        },
        {
          "text": "Gobeclete",
          "offset": 3733,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "62:13"
        },
        {
          "text": "is the snake",
          "offset": 3735,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "62:14"
        },
        {
          "text": "in cultures all over the world. Often",
          "offset": 3739,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "62:19"
        },
        {
          "text": "associated with the underworld.",
          "offset": 3743,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "62:22"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 3747,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "62:27"
        },
        {
          "text": "In the late 1980s, one of the most",
          "offset": 3751,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "62:31"
        },
        {
          "text": "striking finds made at Navali Chry was",
          "offset": 3754,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "62:33"
        },
        {
          "text": "the so-called snake bearer.",
          "offset": 3758,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "62:37"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 3761,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "62:40"
        },
        {
          "text": "A larger than life statue with a",
          "offset": 3765,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "62:44"
        },
        {
          "text": "poisonous viper bursting forth from the",
          "offset": 3767,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "62:46"
        },
        {
          "text": "back of his bald head,",
          "offset": 3770,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "62:49"
        },
        {
          "text": "though the face had unfortunately been",
          "offset": 3775,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "62:55"
        },
        {
          "text": "broken off long ago.",
          "offset": 3777,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "62:57"
        },
        {
          "text": "At nearby Cortic Teepe, many such",
          "offset": 3782,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "63:02"
        },
        {
          "text": "serpentine images are found too",
          "offset": 3786,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "63:05"
        },
        {
          "text": "scratched on stone vessels",
          "offset": 3789,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "63:08"
        },
        {
          "text": "as well as scorpions.",
          "offset": 3792,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "63:11"
        },
        {
          "text": "Another animal associated with the realm",
          "offset": 3795,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "63:14"
        },
        {
          "text": "of the dead",
          "offset": 3797,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "63:16"
        },
        {
          "text": "found also at Gabbecepe.",
          "offset": 3800,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "63:20"
        },
        {
          "text": "Similarly on the middle Euphrates at the",
          "offset": 3806,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "63:26"
        },
        {
          "text": "important site of Jer El Akmar",
          "offset": 3809,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "63:28"
        },
        {
          "text": "pictograms are also seen.",
          "offset": 3812,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "63:32"
        },
        {
          "text": "They are also found even as far away as",
          "offset": 3817,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "63:37"
        },
        {
          "text": "Tel Caramel to the south in Mesopotamia",
          "offset": 3820,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "63:40"
        },
        {
          "text": "proper",
          "offset": 3824,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "63:43"
        },
        {
          "text": "where mighty prehistoric towers like",
          "offset": 3826,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "63:45"
        },
        {
          "text": "those of Jericho are found too.",
          "offset": 3828,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "63:48"
        },
        {
          "text": "The lands between Gobbecepe and the",
          "offset": 3834,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "63:54"
        },
        {
          "text": "plains to the south seem to have been a",
          "offset": 3837,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "63:56"
        },
        {
          "text": "borderland of converging cultures and",
          "offset": 3840,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "63:59"
        },
        {
          "text": "ideas.",
          "offset": 3842,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "64:02"
        },
        {
          "text": "A melting pot of different yet not",
          "offset": 3845,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "64:04"
        },
        {
          "text": "isolated cultural trajectories and",
          "offset": 3848,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "64:07"
        },
        {
          "text": "ideas.",
          "offset": 3851,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "64:10"
        },
        {
          "text": "The more we learn about the world around",
          "offset": 3854,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "64:13"
        },
        {
          "text": "Quebec,",
          "offset": 3857,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "64:16"
        },
        {
          "text": "filling in the vacuum that existed in",
          "offset": 3858,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "64:18"
        },
        {
          "text": "the early '90s,",
          "offset": 3861,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "64:20"
        },
        {
          "text": "the more incredible the tale becomes,",
          "offset": 3863,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "64:22"
        },
        {
          "text": "however tempting it may be to speak of",
          "offset": 3871,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "64:30"
        },
        {
          "text": "the serpent tempting Adam and Eve in the",
          "offset": 3874,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "64:33"
        },
        {
          "text": "Garden of Eden,",
          "offset": 3877,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "64:36"
        },
        {
          "text": "any such illusions to far later stories",
          "offset": 3880,
          "duration": 9,
          "formattedTime": "64:39"
        },
        {
          "text": "may well be entirely illusory.",
          "offset": 3884,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "64:43"
        },
        {
          "text": "Quite simply, though many would beg to",
          "offset": 3891,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "64:50"
        },
        {
          "text": "differ with elaborate intellectual",
          "offset": 3893,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "64:53"
        },
        {
          "text": "journeys of shamanic rituals and toemic",
          "offset": 3896,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "64:56"
        },
        {
          "text": "creatures.",
          "offset": 3899,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "64:58"
        },
        {
          "text": "For the most part, the images at",
          "offset": 3901,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "65:00"
        },
        {
          "text": "Gabbecepe have lost their meaning.",
          "offset": 3903,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "65:03"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 3909,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "65:09"
        },
        {
          "text": "The intricate, often crowded gatherings",
          "offset": 3912,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "65:11"
        },
        {
          "text": "of creatures, be they guardians, culture",
          "offset": 3914,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "65:14"
        },
        {
          "text": "heroes, or symbolic representations to",
          "offset": 3918,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "65:18"
        },
        {
          "text": "ensure hunting success, may well also be",
          "offset": 3921,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "65:21"
        },
        {
          "text": "illustrated storytelling aids for fables",
          "offset": 3926,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "65:25"
        },
        {
          "text": "once as famous as those we all know",
          "offset": 3929,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "65:29"
        },
        {
          "text": "today,",
          "offset": 3932,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "65:32"
        },
        {
          "text": "long before Adam and Eve.",
          "offset": 3934,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "65:34"
        },
        {
          "text": "Who's to say that to the ancestors they",
          "offset": 3947,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "65:47"
        },
        {
          "text": "wouldn't have made total sense?",
          "offset": 3950,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "65:50"
        },
        {
          "text": "No explanation needed",
          "offset": 3954,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "65:53"
        },
        {
          "text": "like the butter, Jesus or McDonald's",
          "offset": 3956,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "65:56"
        },
        {
          "text": "today.",
          "offset": 3960,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "66:00"
        },
        {
          "text": "Today, visitors to the site still tie",
          "offset": 3966,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "66:05"
        },
        {
          "text": "strips of cloth to a mulbury wishing",
          "offset": 3969,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "66:09"
        },
        {
          "text": "tree.",
          "offset": 3972,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "66:11"
        },
        {
          "text": "Perhaps a remainder of a custom from",
          "offset": 3977,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "66:16"
        },
        {
          "text": "long ago when visitors arrived to pay",
          "offset": 3979,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "66:19"
        },
        {
          "text": "their respects and beseech the divine",
          "offset": 3983,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "66:22"
        },
        {
          "text": "for terrestrial favor.",
          "offset": 3986,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "66:25"
        },
        {
          "text": "Though we can't say for certain what the",
          "offset": 3993,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "66:32"
        },
        {
          "text": "purpose of the stone carvings was, they",
          "offset": 3995,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "66:35"
        },
        {
          "text": "remain powerful representations of a",
          "offset": 3999,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "66:38"
        },
        {
          "text": "clearly elaborate mythology.",
          "offset": 4002,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "66:41"
        },
        {
          "text": "The most astonishing example, in fact,",
          "offset": 4006,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "66:46"
        },
        {
          "text": "of a spectacularly profound creative",
          "offset": 4009,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "66:49"
        },
        {
          "text": "explosion that took place here at the",
          "offset": 4012,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "66:51"
        },
        {
          "text": "headarters of the Balac Valley some",
          "offset": 4014,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "66:54"
        },
        {
          "text": "12,000 years ago.",
          "offset": 4017,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "66:56"
        },
        {
          "text": "For Schmidt, one sculptured high relief",
          "offset": 4022,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "67:01"
        },
        {
          "text": "carving in particular totally outclassed",
          "offset": 4025,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "67:04"
        },
        {
          "text": "the rest.",
          "offset": 4028,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "67:07"
        },
        {
          "text": "The masterpiece of a stone age",
          "offset": 4031,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "67:10"
        },
        {
          "text": "Michelangelo.",
          "offset": 4033,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "67:13"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 4039,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "67:18"
        },
        {
          "text": "And just like the earth for man, there",
          "offset": 4042,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "67:21"
        },
        {
          "text": "is freestanding sculpture too.",
          "offset": 4045,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "67:24"
        },
        {
          "text": "Though much remains in a very poor state",
          "offset": 4051,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "67:31"
        },
        {
          "text": "of preservation,",
          "offset": 4054,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "67:34"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 4057,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "67:36"
        },
        {
          "text": "one colossal stone head may well have",
          "offset": 4061,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "67:40"
        },
        {
          "text": "originally been part of a totem polelike",
          "offset": 4064,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "67:44"
        },
        {
          "text": "composite found also at Navali Chry and",
          "offset": 4067,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "67:46"
        },
        {
          "text": "Carahanepe,",
          "offset": 4070,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "67:50"
        },
        {
          "text": "but of course, most famously in the",
          "offset": 4073,
          "duration": 9,
          "formattedTime": "67:52"
        },
        {
          "text": "Pacific Northwest of the United States.",
          "offset": 4076,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "67:55"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 4084,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "68:03"
        },
        {
          "text": "But out there on the remote Pacific",
          "offset": 4087,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "68:06"
        },
        {
          "text": "edge, such toemic creations lined the",
          "offset": 4089,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "68:08"
        },
        {
          "text": "thresholds of domestic homes as much as",
          "offset": 4092,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "68:12"
        },
        {
          "text": "houses of the gods.",
          "offset": 4096,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "68:16"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 4101,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "68:20"
        },
        {
          "text": "Since Klaus Schmidt's death in 2014,",
          "offset": 4102,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "68:21"
        },
        {
          "text": "another academic idea that has gained in",
          "offset": 4106,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "68:25"
        },
        {
          "text": "prominence is the suggestion that the",
          "offset": 4108,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "68:28"
        },
        {
          "text": "enclosures at Gabbecepe may not only",
          "offset": 4111,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "68:30"
        },
        {
          "text": "have been roofed after all, but could in",
          "offset": 4114,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "68:33"
        },
        {
          "text": "fact have acted as sleeping quarters as",
          "offset": 4117,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "68:37"
        },
        {
          "text": "much as temples.",
          "offset": 4120,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "68:40"
        },
        {
          "text": "Whilst completely true that the",
          "offset": 4126,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "68:45"
        },
        {
          "text": "structures at Gbeckete look nothing like",
          "offset": 4127,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "68:47"
        },
        {
          "text": "previously documented houses from the",
          "offset": 4130,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "68:50"
        },
        {
          "text": "pre- pottery Neolithic.",
          "offset": 4132,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "68:52"
        },
        {
          "text": "It could be that they are simply a",
          "offset": 4137,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "68:56"
        },
        {
          "text": "previously unknown example with no",
          "offset": 4139,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "68:59"
        },
        {
          "text": "precedent discovered anywhere before.",
          "offset": 4142,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "69:02"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 4146,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "69:06"
        },
        {
          "text": "Pre- pottery Neolithic buildings were",
          "offset": 4149,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "69:08"
        },
        {
          "text": "often built with the apparent intention",
          "offset": 4152,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "69:11"
        },
        {
          "text": "for them to act as focal points for",
          "offset": 4154,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "69:13"
        },
        {
          "text": "rituals, feasts, initiation ceremonies,",
          "offset": 4156,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "69:16"
        },
        {
          "text": "and the deaths and burials of members of",
          "offset": 4160,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "69:19"
        },
        {
          "text": "the community.",
          "offset": 4162,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "69:22"
        },
        {
          "text": "It's not impossible to suggest that they",
          "offset": 4165,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "69:25"
        },
        {
          "text": "could have acted as houses in other",
          "offset": 4168,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "69:27"
        },
        {
          "text": "times too",
          "offset": 4170,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "69:30"
        },
        {
          "text": "or maybe at all times.",
          "offset": 4172,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "69:32"
        },
        {
          "text": "like Irakcoy long houses or the mead",
          "offset": 4179,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "69:38"
        },
        {
          "text": "halls of an early medieval chief.",
          "offset": 4182,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "69:41"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 4185,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "69:44"
        },
        {
          "text": "But did the people of Gbeclete",
          "offset": 4188,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "69:48"
        },
        {
          "text": "actually live there permanently?",
          "offset": 4191,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "69:51"
        },
        {
          "text": "In recent years, Claus Schmidt's",
          "offset": 4196,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "69:55"
        },
        {
          "text": "assertions of no domestic activity at",
          "offset": 4198,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "69:58"
        },
        {
          "text": "all being carried out at the site have",
          "offset": 4201,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "70:00"
        },
        {
          "text": "been challenged.",
          "offset": 4203,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "70:03"
        },
        {
          "text": "After all, there are significant amounts",
          "offset": 4208,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "70:07"
        },
        {
          "text": "of tools related to domestic activity",
          "offset": 4210,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "70:10"
        },
        {
          "text": "present at the site as well as",
          "offset": 4213,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "70:13"
        },
        {
          "text": "ostentatious animal remains.",
          "offset": 4216,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "70:15"
        },
        {
          "text": "As for drinking water, rock cut sistns",
          "offset": 4220,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "70:19"
        },
        {
          "text": "and pools are found all over the hill.",
          "offset": 4223,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "70:22"
        },
        {
          "text": "And in the more humid boreal period of",
          "offset": 4227,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "70:26"
        },
        {
          "text": "some 12,000 years ago, the water table",
          "offset": 4229,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "70:29"
        },
        {
          "text": "may well have been considerably higher",
          "offset": 4232,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "70:32"
        },
        {
          "text": "with the possibility of other water",
          "offset": 4236,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "70:36"
        },
        {
          "text": "sources located nearby.",
          "offset": 4238,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "70:38"
        },
        {
          "text": "All in all, it's not completely",
          "offset": 4245,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "70:44"
        },
        {
          "text": "outlandish to suggest that a small",
          "offset": 4247,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "70:46"
        },
        {
          "text": "permanent staff could have lived on the",
          "offset": 4249,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "70:49"
        },
        {
          "text": "site all year round, swelling to a much",
          "offset": 4252,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "70:51"
        },
        {
          "text": "larger population at certain times of",
          "offset": 4255,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "70:55"
        },
        {
          "text": "the year for festival activities,",
          "offset": 4258,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "70:57"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 4261,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "71:00"
        },
        {
          "text": "perhaps including the raising of",
          "offset": 4264,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "71:03"
        },
        {
          "text": "monoliths.",
          "offset": 4266,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "71:05"
        },
        {
          "text": "In ancient Egypt, for example, the very",
          "offset": 4272,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "71:12"
        },
        {
          "text": "act itself being sacred.",
          "offset": 4274,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "71:14"
        },
        {
          "text": "But what of those people who lived and",
          "offset": 4281,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "71:21"
        },
        {
          "text": "worked at Gabbecepe?",
          "offset": 4284,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "71:24"
        },
        {
          "text": "Human skeletal evidence remains",
          "offset": 4290,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "71:29"
        },
        {
          "text": "extremely rare. Just a few hundred",
          "offset": 4293,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "71:32"
        },
        {
          "text": "scraps of bones having been recovered.",
          "offset": 4296,
          "duration": 10,
          "formattedTime": "71:35"
        },
        {
          "text": "twothirds of which are skull fragments.",
          "offset": 4300,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "71:40"
        },
        {
          "text": "A few of them show evidence of",
          "offset": 4307,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "71:46"
        },
        {
          "text": "decapitation and deflesing.",
          "offset": 4309,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "71:49"
        },
        {
          "text": "Ominously, three have holes drilled into",
          "offset": 4316,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "71:56"
        },
        {
          "text": "them, perhaps to be hung up or mounted",
          "offset": 4320,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "72:00"
        },
        {
          "text": "on a pole.",
          "offset": 4324,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "72:04"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 4328,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "72:07"
        },
        {
          "text": "It's a tiny, potentially nightmarish",
          "offset": 4330,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "72:10"
        },
        {
          "text": "window into those ancient days.",
          "offset": 4333,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "72:13"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 4336,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "72:16"
        },
        {
          "text": "Though equally the finds may well",
          "offset": 4339,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "72:18"
        },
        {
          "text": "represent the venerated remains of",
          "offset": 4341,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "72:21"
        },
        {
          "text": "dearly loved ancestors",
          "offset": 4344,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "72:24"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 4349,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "72:28"
        },
        {
          "text": "perhaps relating to the so-called cult",
          "offset": 4353,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "72:33"
        },
        {
          "text": "of the skull which continued on in the",
          "offset": 4356,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "72:36"
        },
        {
          "text": "Levant for thousands of years and even",
          "offset": 4359,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "72:38"
        },
        {
          "text": "predates Gbeclete at Nufian sites to the",
          "offset": 4362,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "72:42"
        },
        {
          "text": "south.",
          "offset": 4366,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "72:45"
        },
        {
          "text": "However, equally probable evidence at",
          "offset": 4369,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "72:49"
        },
        {
          "text": "nearby Chanu cannot be overlooked.",
          "offset": 4372,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "72:52"
        },
        {
          "text": "There on a blood encrusted altar,",
          "offset": 4377,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "72:57"
        },
        {
          "text": "ritualistic human sacrifices may well",
          "offset": 4380,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "73:00"
        },
        {
          "text": "have been carried out,",
          "offset": 4384,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "73:03"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 4386,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "73:06"
        },
        {
          "text": "perhaps shedding light on a darker side",
          "offset": 4389,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "73:08"
        },
        {
          "text": "of the Gecklitee phenomenon.",
          "offset": 4392,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "73:11"
        },
        {
          "text": "Though no direct irrefutable evidence",
          "offset": 4397,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "73:16"
        },
        {
          "text": "has yet come to light and the Chia new",
          "offset": 4399,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "73:19"
        },
        {
          "text": "finds are ever open to revised",
          "offset": 4403,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "73:22"
        },
        {
          "text": "interpretation",
          "offset": 4405,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "73:25"
        },
        {
          "text": "by around 8,200 BC whether a community",
          "offset": 4415,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "73:35"
        },
        {
          "text": "of complex hunter gatherers had indeed",
          "offset": 4420,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "73:40"
        },
        {
          "text": "lived at Gabbecepe permanently or Not",
          "offset": 4423,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "73:42"
        },
        {
          "text": "life at the site came to an end",
          "offset": 4427,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "73:47"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 4431,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "73:50"
        },
        {
          "text": "in a scene reminiscent of the so-called",
          "offset": 4434,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "73:53"
        },
        {
          "text": "house closing rituals of later Neolithic",
          "offset": 4436,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "73:56"
        },
        {
          "text": "sites like Chatal Hoyok",
          "offset": 4439,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "73:58"
        },
        {
          "text": "and admire cities alike. The very last",
          "offset": 4443,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "74:03"
        },
        {
          "text": "stone circle made up of human-shaped",
          "offset": 4447,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "74:07"
        },
        {
          "text": "pillars much smaller than its",
          "offset": 4450,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "74:09"
        },
        {
          "text": "predecessors",
          "offset": 4452,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "74:11"
        },
        {
          "text": "was just like the previous circles had",
          "offset": 4454,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "74:13"
        },
        {
          "text": "been intentionally buried under up to 3",
          "offset": 4457,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "74:16"
        },
        {
          "text": "m of earth.",
          "offset": 4460,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "74:20"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 4464,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "74:23"
        },
        {
          "text": "Though it's possible people continued to",
          "offset": 4468,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "74:28"
        },
        {
          "text": "come to the place in the years after,",
          "offset": 4471,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "74:30"
        },
        {
          "text": "very little could now be seen above",
          "offset": 4474,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "74:34"
        },
        {
          "text": "ground.",
          "offset": 4477,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "74:36"
        },
        {
          "text": "It's likely that symbolically the place",
          "offset": 4479,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "74:38"
        },
        {
          "text": "was dead.",
          "offset": 4483,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "74:42"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 4489,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "74:48"
        },
        {
          "text": "Many conclusions have been drawn as to",
          "offset": 4492,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "74:52"
        },
        {
          "text": "the end of Quebec,",
          "offset": 4494,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "74:54"
        },
        {
          "text": "ranging from violent conflict, drought,",
          "offset": 4497,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "74:56"
        },
        {
          "text": "starvation, and zunotic disease",
          "offset": 4500,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "75:00"
        },
        {
          "text": "to new conditions of sedentism making",
          "offset": 4504,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "75:03"
        },
        {
          "text": "the old ritual places of the hunters",
          "offset": 4507,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "75:06"
        },
        {
          "text": "irrelevant.",
          "offset": 4509,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "75:09"
        },
        {
          "text": "The reality remains a total mystery.",
          "offset": 4514,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "75:14"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 4518,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "75:17"
        },
        {
          "text": "But in examining the context of the",
          "offset": 4522,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "75:21"
        },
        {
          "text": "birth of the Neolithic and how Gabbec",
          "offset": 4525,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "75:24"
        },
        {
          "text": "came into being in the first place, we",
          "offset": 4528,
          "duration": 9,
          "formattedTime": "75:28"
        },
        {
          "text": "can uncover yet more clues.",
          "offset": 4531,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "75:31"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 4544,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "75:44"
        },
        {
          "text": "As the colossal ice sheets that had held",
          "offset": 4551,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "75:51"
        },
        {
          "text": "Europe in thr for tens of thousands of",
          "offset": 4554,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "75:54"
        },
        {
          "text": "years",
          "offset": 4557,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "75:57"
        },
        {
          "text": "finally began their long retreat back to",
          "offset": 4559,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "75:59"
        },
        {
          "text": "the frigid Arctic wastess.",
          "offset": 4562,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "76:01"
        },
        {
          "text": "By around 12,000 BC, the foothills of",
          "offset": 4565,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "76:04"
        },
        {
          "text": "the southern Taurus mountains were a",
          "offset": 4569,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "76:08"
        },
        {
          "text": "wash with green.",
          "offset": 4571,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "76:11"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 4575,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "76:15"
        },
        {
          "text": "Lush river valleys ran tracks past",
          "offset": 4578,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "76:17"
        },
        {
          "text": "verdant prairies.",
          "offset": 4581,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "76:20"
        },
        {
          "text": "Everex expanding forests of pistachio",
          "offset": 4583,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "76:23"
        },
        {
          "text": "and oak,",
          "offset": 4586,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "76:26"
        },
        {
          "text": "spreading along the open frontier to",
          "offset": 4590,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "76:30"
        },
        {
          "text": "previously barren plateaus and patches",
          "offset": 4592,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "76:32"
        },
        {
          "text": "of scrubstudded desert.",
          "offset": 4595,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "76:34"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 4598,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "76:37"
        },
        {
          "text": "And into this new Eden came vast herds",
          "offset": 4604,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "76:44"
        },
        {
          "text": "of gazelle",
          "offset": 4608,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "76:47"
        },
        {
          "text": "along with wild boar making their homes",
          "offset": 4610,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "76:50"
        },
        {
          "text": "in the woodland.",
          "offset": 4613,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "76:53"
        },
        {
          "text": "All manner of goat, orok and bird",
          "offset": 4618,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "76:58"
        },
        {
          "text": "wandering the hills and riversides.",
          "offset": 4622,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "77:01"
        },
        {
          "text": "It was a landscape teeming with life.",
          "offset": 4625,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "77:05"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 4629,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "77:09"
        },
        {
          "text": "And for the previously isolated",
          "offset": 4634,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "77:13"
        },
        {
          "text": "communities of late Paleolithic humans,",
          "offset": 4636,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "77:15"
        },
        {
          "text": "often restricted to sheltered refuges in",
          "offset": 4639,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "77:19"
        },
        {
          "text": "the wake of harsh climatic conditions,",
          "offset": 4642,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "77:22"
        },
        {
          "text": "it must have seemed like paradise.",
          "offset": 4647,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "77:26"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 4650,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "77:30"
        },
        {
          "text": "Climate models built up from prehistoric",
          "offset": 4658,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "77:37"
        },
        {
          "text": "ice cores over the last 80 years or so",
          "offset": 4661,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "77:40"
        },
        {
          "text": "suggest a significant increase in both",
          "offset": 4664,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "77:44"
        },
        {
          "text": "rainfall and temperature following the",
          "offset": 4667,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "77:46"
        },
        {
          "text": "last glacial maximum of around 13,000",
          "offset": 4670,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "77:49"
        },
        {
          "text": "BC.",
          "offset": 4672,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "77:52"
        },
        {
          "text": "Thus paving the way for the emergence of",
          "offset": 4676,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "77:55"
        },
        {
          "text": "a new way of life.",
          "offset": 4678,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "77:58"
        },
        {
          "text": "Though still wide roaming, people were",
          "offset": 4688,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "78:08"
        },
        {
          "text": "beginning to settle down into",
          "offset": 4692,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "78:11"
        },
        {
          "text": "territories.",
          "offset": 4694,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "78:13"
        },
        {
          "text": "Landscapes they knew extremely well,",
          "offset": 4696,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "78:15"
        },
        {
          "text": "more so than ever before.",
          "offset": 4699,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "78:19"
        },
        {
          "text": "landscapes of dangerous carnivores and",
          "offset": 4704,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "78:23"
        },
        {
          "text": "poisonous reptiles, of swift running",
          "offset": 4707,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "78:26"
        },
        {
          "text": "game, water fowl and furry scavengers.",
          "offset": 4710,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "78:29"
        },
        {
          "text": "This was the world inhabited by the",
          "offset": 4715,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "78:34"
        },
        {
          "text": "builders of Gbeclete.",
          "offset": 4717,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "78:37"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 4720,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "78:39"
        },
        {
          "text": "To the west and north, the snowcapped",
          "offset": 4724,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "78:44"
        },
        {
          "text": "peaks of the Taurus range loom.",
          "offset": 4727,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "78:47"
        },
        {
          "text": "To the south, the Haran plane stretches",
          "offset": 4731,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "78:51"
        },
        {
          "text": "all the way to what is now Syria and",
          "offset": 4734,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "78:54"
        },
        {
          "text": "Iraq beyond.",
          "offset": 4737,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "78:56"
        },
        {
          "text": "To the northeast, the great mountain of",
          "offset": 4742,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "79:01"
        },
        {
          "text": "Karacadog sprawls.",
          "offset": 4745,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "79:04"
        },
        {
          "text": "Always prominent extinct volcano from",
          "offset": 4747,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "79:07"
        },
        {
          "text": "where some of the earliest evidence of",
          "offset": 4750,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "79:10"
        },
        {
          "text": "cultivated eorn wheat has been found.",
          "offset": 4753,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "79:12"
        },
        {
          "text": "Perhaps it is no coincidence that in a",
          "offset": 4758,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "79:18"
        },
        {
          "text": "great ark around Gabbecepe, some of the",
          "offset": 4761,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "79:20"
        },
        {
          "text": "most important early Neolithic sites",
          "offset": 4764,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "79:24"
        },
        {
          "text": "found anywhere have been discovered.",
          "offset": 4767,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "79:26"
        },
        {
          "text": "At Tel Caramel, Jer El Akmar and Chanu",
          "offset": 4773,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "79:32"
        },
        {
          "text": "to mention a few.",
          "offset": 4777,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "79:37"
        },
        {
          "text": "The evidence speaks of a world on the",
          "offset": 4781,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "79:41"
        },
        {
          "text": "verge of agriculture.",
          "offset": 4784,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "79:44"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 4787,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "79:46"
        },
        {
          "text": "It's evidence that the great early 20th",
          "offset": 4791,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "79:50"
        },
        {
          "text": "century prehistorian V. Gordon Child",
          "offset": 4794,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "79:53"
        },
        {
          "text": "could only have dreamed of when he first",
          "offset": 4797,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "79:57"
        },
        {
          "text": "coined the term Neolithic Revolution",
          "offset": 4799,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "79:59"
        },
        {
          "text": "in the 1930s.",
          "offset": 4805,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "80:05"
        },
        {
          "text": "And yet, far from being a simple",
          "offset": 4808,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "80:08"
        },
        {
          "text": "picture, the story only becomes more and",
          "offset": 4811,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "80:10"
        },
        {
          "text": "more complex.",
          "offset": 4814,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "80:14"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 4816,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "80:16"
        },
        {
          "text": "By around 10,800",
          "offset": 4820,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "80:20"
        },
        {
          "text": "BC, a relatively brief yet still",
          "offset": 4823,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "80:22"
        },
        {
          "text": "centuries long return to cold, dry",
          "offset": 4826,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "80:26"
        },
        {
          "text": "conditions of the last plea scene was",
          "offset": 4829,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "80:29"
        },
        {
          "text": "ushered in,",
          "offset": 4832,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "80:31"
        },
        {
          "text": "potentially lasting for a thousand",
          "offset": 4835,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "80:35"
        },
        {
          "text": "years.",
          "offset": 4838,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "80:37"
        },
        {
          "text": "Since its initial discovery well over a",
          "offset": 4840,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "80:40"
        },
        {
          "text": "century ago, the younger dryass period",
          "offset": 4843,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "80:42"
        },
        {
          "text": "has loomed large in accounts of the",
          "offset": 4847,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "80:46"
        },
        {
          "text": "origins of agriculture",
          "offset": 4849,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "80:49"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 4852,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "80:52"
        },
        {
          "text": "with the suspicion that many newly",
          "offset": 4856,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "80:55"
        },
        {
          "text": "swelled communities would have had to",
          "offset": 4858,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "80:58"
        },
        {
          "text": "change their lifestyles yet again,",
          "offset": 4861,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "81:00"
        },
        {
          "text": "congregating around water supplies.",
          "offset": 4867,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "81:07"
        },
        {
          "text": "and possibly intensifying their food",
          "offset": 4870,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "81:09"
        },
        {
          "text": "production strategies.",
          "offset": 4873,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "81:12"
        },
        {
          "text": "According to some theorists, beginning",
          "offset": 4877,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "81:16"
        },
        {
          "text": "to experiment with sewing and tending",
          "offset": 4879,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "81:19"
        },
        {
          "text": "crops and cereals",
          "offset": 4882,
          "duration": 10,
          "formattedTime": "81:22"
        },
        {
          "text": "and eventually to trap and keep animals.",
          "offset": 4886,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "81:26"
        },
        {
          "text": "In recent years, the picture has changed",
          "offset": 4897,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "81:37"
        },
        {
          "text": "yet again",
          "offset": 4901,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "81:40"
        },
        {
          "text": "with the recognition that early",
          "offset": 4904,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "81:43"
        },
        {
          "text": "theorists like Child succeeded in",
          "offset": 4906,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "81:45"
        },
        {
          "text": "explaining the how, but not the why,",
          "offset": 4909,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "81:48"
        },
        {
          "text": "or perhaps most importantly,",
          "offset": 4913,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "81:53"
        },
        {
          "text": "the when.",
          "offset": 4916,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "81:55"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 4919,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "81:58"
        },
        {
          "text": "Just in the last decade, vast amounts of",
          "offset": 4920,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "81:59"
        },
        {
          "text": "new empirical data has continued to",
          "offset": 4923,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "82:03"
        },
        {
          "text": "stack up,",
          "offset": 4926,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "82:05"
        },
        {
          "text": "creating an increasingly finetuned",
          "offset": 4928,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "82:08"
        },
        {
          "text": "account of the transition from foraging",
          "offset": 4931,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "82:11"
        },
        {
          "text": "to farming.",
          "offset": 4934,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "82:13"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 4937,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "82:16"
        },
        {
          "text": "The evidence overwhelmingly suggesting",
          "offset": 4939,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "82:18"
        },
        {
          "text": "not one origin, but many places",
          "offset": 4942,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "82:22"
        },
        {
          "text": "and many times.",
          "offset": 4947,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "82:26"
        },
        {
          "text": "Some ultimately unsuccessful attempts",
          "offset": 4951,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "82:30"
        },
        {
          "text": "taking place long before Quebec.",
          "offset": 4954,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "82:33"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 4959,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "82:39"
        },
        {
          "text": "Rather than a revolution, per se,",
          "offset": 4961,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "82:41"
        },
        {
          "text": "eliciting the idea of some kind of an",
          "offset": 4964,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "82:44"
        },
        {
          "text": "overnight transformation,",
          "offset": 4966,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "82:46"
        },
        {
          "text": "the initial shift from hunter gathering",
          "offset": 4969,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "82:49"
        },
        {
          "text": "to farming took place at its very",
          "offset": 4972,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "82:51"
        },
        {
          "text": "quickest over multiple generations.",
          "offset": 4975,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "82:55"
        },
        {
          "text": "with myriad experiments, tipping points,",
          "offset": 4979,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "82:58"
        },
        {
          "text": "failures, and even regressions along the",
          "offset": 4982,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "83:02"
        },
        {
          "text": "way.",
          "offset": 4985,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "83:05"
        },
        {
          "text": "One particularly early example of",
          "offset": 4989,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "83:09"
        },
        {
          "text": "attempted plant domestication was found",
          "offset": 4992,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "83:11"
        },
        {
          "text": "on the shores of the Sea of Galilee.",
          "offset": 4995,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "83:14"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 5000,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "83:19"
        },
        {
          "text": "At O'Haro 2, the remarkable remains of a",
          "offset": 5002,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "83:22"
        },
        {
          "text": "Paleolithic settlement yielded an",
          "offset": 5006,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "83:25"
        },
        {
          "text": "impressive array of seed grasses and",
          "offset": 5008,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "83:28"
        },
        {
          "text": "legumes",
          "offset": 5011,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "83:31"
        },
        {
          "text": "along with the tools needed to thresh",
          "offset": 5013,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "83:32"
        },
        {
          "text": "and cultivate them.",
          "offset": 5015,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "83:35"
        },
        {
          "text": "Thus, by the time the first monoliths",
          "offset": 5020,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "83:39"
        },
        {
          "text": "were erected in the southern foothills",
          "offset": 5023,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "83:42"
        },
        {
          "text": "of the Taurus Mountains, humans had",
          "offset": 5025,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "83:44"
        },
        {
          "text": "already been experimenting with farming",
          "offset": 5028,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "83:47"
        },
        {
          "text": "for over 10,000 years.",
          "offset": 5031,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "83:50"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 5034,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "83:54"
        },
        {
          "text": "The evidence from this one very small",
          "offset": 5038,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "83:57"
        },
        {
          "text": "community",
          "offset": 5041,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "84:00"
        },
        {
          "text": "continues to detract from the hypothesis",
          "offset": 5042,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "84:02"
        },
        {
          "text": "of population pressure being the primary",
          "offset": 5045,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "84:05"
        },
        {
          "text": "driver of sedentism and agriculture.",
          "offset": 5048,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "84:07"
        },
        {
          "text": "Animal husbandry was different",
          "offset": 5055,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "84:15"
        },
        {
          "text": "as we have seen. No domesticated animals",
          "offset": 5059,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "84:18"
        },
        {
          "text": "at all have been found at Quebec",
          "offset": 5062,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "84:22"
        },
        {
          "text": "and very few before that time anywhere",
          "offset": 5066,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "84:26"
        },
        {
          "text": "else in the world.",
          "offset": 5070,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "84:29"
        },
        {
          "text": "The process of domestication which",
          "offset": 5073,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "84:32"
        },
        {
          "text": "actually changes the physiology of the",
          "offset": 5075,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "84:35"
        },
        {
          "text": "animal in question is only even possible",
          "offset": 5077,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "84:37"
        },
        {
          "text": "with a very small number of animals.",
          "offset": 5080,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "84:40"
        },
        {
          "text": "And even then, the shock and trauma of",
          "offset": 5084,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "84:43"
        },
        {
          "text": "captivity very often creates infertile",
          "offset": 5087,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "84:46"
        },
        {
          "text": "or deformed offspring, if procreation is",
          "offset": 5090,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "84:49"
        },
        {
          "text": "even possible at all.",
          "offset": 5093,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "84:53"
        },
        {
          "text": "In short, animal domestication requires",
          "offset": 5099,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "84:59"
        },
        {
          "text": "a great deal of effort with very little",
          "offset": 5102,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "85:02"
        },
        {
          "text": "return in the short term.",
          "offset": 5106,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "85:05"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 5110,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "85:10"
        },
        {
          "text": "There are some indications that",
          "offset": 5116,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "85:15"
        },
        {
          "text": "Gbeckley's neighboring site of Chanu was",
          "offset": 5118,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "85:17"
        },
        {
          "text": "somewhat successful with the",
          "offset": 5121,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "85:21"
        },
        {
          "text": "domestication of wild boar",
          "offset": 5123,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "85:22"
        },
        {
          "text": "with remains having multiple indicators",
          "offset": 5128,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "85:28"
        },
        {
          "text": "of domesticity by around 8 or 9,000 BC",
          "offset": 5131,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "85:30"
        },
        {
          "text": "by which time the place had been a",
          "offset": 5136,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "85:36"
        },
        {
          "text": "permanent settlement for quite Some time",
          "offset": 5138,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "85:38"
        },
        {
          "text": "the evidence for farming being the main",
          "offset": 5145,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "85:45"
        },
        {
          "text": "cause of sedentism",
          "offset": 5148,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "85:47"
        },
        {
          "text": "keeps getting smaller and smaller.",
          "offset": 5150,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "85:49"
        },
        {
          "text": "Even at Chatal Hoyuk, a vast Neolithic",
          "offset": 5154,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "85:54"
        },
        {
          "text": "proto city of at least 5,000 people that",
          "offset": 5158,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "85:57"
        },
        {
          "text": "developed much later than Quebec.",
          "offset": 5162,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "86:01"
        },
        {
          "text": "There is almost no evidence of",
          "offset": 5166,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "86:05"
        },
        {
          "text": "domesticated animals.",
          "offset": 5168,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "86:08"
        },
        {
          "text": "Hunting still playing a huge role in the",
          "offset": 5171,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "86:10"
        },
        {
          "text": "ritual and domestic life of the",
          "offset": 5174,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "86:13"
        },
        {
          "text": "community.",
          "offset": 5176,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "86:16"
        },
        {
          "text": "To the south of Gabbecepe",
          "offset": 5181,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "86:20"
        },
        {
          "text": "along the Levventine shore, not far from",
          "offset": 5184,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "86:23"
        },
        {
          "text": "Oh,",
          "offset": 5187,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "86:26"
        },
        {
          "text": "can be found some of the best evidence",
          "offset": 5189,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "86:28"
        },
        {
          "text": "for the origins of so-called",
          "offset": 5191,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "86:31"
        },
        {
          "text": "neolithsization.",
          "offset": 5193,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "86:33"
        },
        {
          "text": "For here, in a surprisingly wellstudied",
          "offset": 5197,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "86:37"
        },
        {
          "text": "region, people seem to have begun to",
          "offset": 5200,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "86:39"
        },
        {
          "text": "truly settle down towards the end of the",
          "offset": 5203,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "86:42"
        },
        {
          "text": "last ice age.",
          "offset": 5206,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "86:45"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 5209,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "86:48"
        },
        {
          "text": "This was the time of the Nufians.",
          "offset": 5211,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "86:51"
        },
        {
          "text": "And incredibly, there is good evidence",
          "offset": 5215,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "86:55"
        },
        {
          "text": "here for a revolution not in farming",
          "offset": 5218,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "86:57"
        },
        {
          "text": "technologies,",
          "offset": 5221,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "87:01"
        },
        {
          "text": "but in the mind.",
          "offset": 5223,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "87:03"
        },
        {
          "text": "First discovered by pioneering",
          "offset": 5229,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "87:09"
        },
        {
          "text": "archaeologist Dorothy Gared in the early",
          "offset": 5232,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "87:11"
        },
        {
          "text": "20th century and named after the type",
          "offset": 5235,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "87:14"
        },
        {
          "text": "site of Wadi al-Natu in what is now",
          "offset": 5238,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "87:18"
        },
        {
          "text": "Palestine.",
          "offset": 5241,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "87:21"
        },
        {
          "text": "Like Gbeclete, the astonishing culture",
          "offset": 5244,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "87:23"
        },
        {
          "text": "of the Nufians made headlines all over",
          "offset": 5247,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "87:26"
        },
        {
          "text": "the world.",
          "offset": 5250,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "87:30"
        },
        {
          "text": "The Nufians still lived a largely hunter",
          "offset": 5253,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "87:33"
        },
        {
          "text": "gatherer existence,",
          "offset": 5257,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "87:37"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 5259,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "87:39"
        },
        {
          "text": "but seemed much more of a complex state",
          "offset": 5260,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "87:40"
        },
        {
          "text": "than groups before.",
          "offset": 5264,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "87:43"
        },
        {
          "text": "They lived in set areas in settled",
          "offset": 5267,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "87:46"
        },
        {
          "text": "villages where they returned to bury",
          "offset": 5270,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "87:49"
        },
        {
          "text": "their dead,",
          "offset": 5272,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "87:52"
        },
        {
          "text": "engage in elaborate burial rituals,",
          "offset": 5275,
          "duration": 9,
          "formattedTime": "87:54"
        },
        {
          "text": "and create impressive works of art,",
          "offset": 5278,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "87:58"
        },
        {
          "text": "traits which probably reinforced",
          "offset": 5283,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "88:03"
        },
        {
          "text": "cultural identities and links to the",
          "offset": 5286,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "88:05"
        },
        {
          "text": "land.",
          "offset": 5288,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "88:08"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 5291,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "88:10"
        },
        {
          "text": "perhaps one of the first complex",
          "offset": 5293,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "88:12"
        },
        {
          "text": "societies found anywhere.",
          "offset": 5295,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "88:15"
        },
        {
          "text": "So then was it culture, human creativity",
          "offset": 5302,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "88:22"
        },
        {
          "text": "rather than economics that spurred on",
          "offset": 5307,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "88:26"
        },
        {
          "text": "the adoption of agriculture?",
          "offset": 5309,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "88:28"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 5311,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "88:30"
        },
        {
          "text": "And just how far back does the evidence",
          "offset": 5312,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "88:32"
        },
        {
          "text": "go?",
          "offset": 5315,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "88:35"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 5321,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "88:41"
        },
        {
          "text": "The first visible glimmerings of human",
          "offset": 5327,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "88:47"
        },
        {
          "text": "creativity in the archaeological record",
          "offset": 5330,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "88:50"
        },
        {
          "text": "appear on the southern tip of Africa as",
          "offset": 5334,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "88:53"
        },
        {
          "text": "much as a 100,000 years ago in the form",
          "offset": 5337,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "88:56"
        },
        {
          "text": "of ochre pigments and later in crafted",
          "offset": 5341,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "89:00"
        },
        {
          "text": "shell decorations.",
          "offset": 5344,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "89:04"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 5347,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "89:07"
        },
        {
          "text": "As much as a 100,000 years after the",
          "offset": 5350,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "89:09"
        },
        {
          "text": "first evidence of anatomically modern",
          "offset": 5353,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "89:13"
        },
        {
          "text": "humans identical to us today capable of",
          "offset": 5356,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "89:15"
        },
        {
          "text": "complex forms of communication for the",
          "offset": 5360,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "89:19"
        },
        {
          "text": "first time.",
          "offset": 5362,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "89:22"
        },
        {
          "text": "However, it is only after around 45,000",
          "offset": 5366,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "89:26"
        },
        {
          "text": "years ago that evidence for creative",
          "offset": 5370,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "89:30"
        },
        {
          "text": "complexity really begins to be found.",
          "offset": 5373,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "89:33"
        },
        {
          "text": "in isolated pieces like the lion man of",
          "offset": 5377,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "89:37"
        },
        {
          "text": "Holenstein stad",
          "offset": 5381,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "89:40"
        },
        {
          "text": "scattered Venus figurines and ultimately",
          "offset": 5384,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "89:43"
        },
        {
          "text": "in the cave paintings of the upper",
          "offset": 5387,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "89:47"
        },
        {
          "text": "Paleolithic.",
          "offset": 5389,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "89:49"
        },
        {
          "text": "Arguably, it is only with the likes of",
          "offset": 5394,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "89:53"
        },
        {
          "text": "the Nufian some 15,000 years ago and",
          "offset": 5397,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "89:56"
        },
        {
          "text": "perhaps the Cabaran before it that",
          "offset": 5401,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "90:00"
        },
        {
          "text": "evidence of societal formation really",
          "offset": 5404,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "90:03"
        },
        {
          "text": "begins",
          "offset": 5407,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "90:06"
        },
        {
          "text": "of larger groups of a hundred or more",
          "offset": 5410,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "90:10"
        },
        {
          "text": "living permanently together in close",
          "offset": 5413,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "90:13"
        },
        {
          "text": "proximity all year round.",
          "offset": 5416,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "90:15"
        },
        {
          "text": "The question of why it took so long for",
          "offset": 5421,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "90:20"
        },
        {
          "text": "anatomically modern humans to develop",
          "offset": 5424,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "90:24"
        },
        {
          "text": "such artistic and cultural ideas and",
          "offset": 5427,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "90:26"
        },
        {
          "text": "objects has been defined by British",
          "offset": 5429,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "90:29"
        },
        {
          "text": "archaeologist Colin Renfruit as the",
          "offset": 5432,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "90:32"
        },
        {
          "text": "sapient paradox.",
          "offset": 5435,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "90:35"
        },
        {
          "text": "Anthropologist Robin Dunar has argued",
          "offset": 5439,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "90:39"
        },
        {
          "text": "for a certain numerical threshold in",
          "offset": 5442,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "90:42"
        },
        {
          "text": "population tending to occur in human",
          "offset": 5445,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "90:45"
        },
        {
          "text": "groups all over the world.",
          "offset": 5448,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "90:47"
        },
        {
          "text": "at which point groups naturally tend to",
          "offset": 5451,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "90:50"
        },
        {
          "text": "splinter away from one another.",
          "offset": 5454,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "90:54"
        },
        {
          "text": "It may be that in order to get past",
          "offset": 5457,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "90:57"
        },
        {
          "text": "Dunar's number of around 150",
          "offset": 5460,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "90:59"
        },
        {
          "text": "individuals, a great leap forwards in",
          "offset": 5463,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "91:02"
        },
        {
          "text": "the psyche was necessary",
          "offset": 5466,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "91:05"
        },
        {
          "text": "for late Paleolithic huntergatherer",
          "offset": 5469,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "91:08"
        },
        {
          "text": "groups.",
          "offset": 5471,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "91:11"
        },
        {
          "text": "a shared story or collective idea",
          "offset": 5474,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "91:13"
        },
        {
          "text": "spurred on not by biological evolution,",
          "offset": 5477,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "91:17"
        },
        {
          "text": "but by culture.",
          "offset": 5481,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "91:21"
        },
        {
          "text": "A hypothetical revolution in shared",
          "offset": 5486,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "91:26"
        },
        {
          "text": "symbolism, which would eventually spur",
          "offset": 5489,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "91:28"
        },
        {
          "text": "on mastery over nature,",
          "offset": 5492,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "91:31"
        },
        {
          "text": "division of labor, increasingly",
          "offset": 5495,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "91:35"
        },
        {
          "text": "impressive artistic achievements,",
          "offset": 5498,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "91:38"
        },
        {
          "text": "and population growth.",
          "offset": 5501,
          "duration": 10,
          "formattedTime": "91:40"
        },
        {
          "text": "A revolution which began in the mind.",
          "offset": 5504,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "91:43"
        },
        {
          "text": "The creative explosion of the upper",
          "offset": 5511,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "91:51"
        },
        {
          "text": "paleolithic",
          "offset": 5513,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "91:53"
        },
        {
          "text": "most commonly represented by cave art",
          "offset": 5515,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "91:55"
        },
        {
          "text": "and the famous Venus figurines",
          "offset": 5518,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "91:58"
        },
        {
          "text": "is well known in popular culture.",
          "offset": 5522,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "92:02"
        },
        {
          "text": "Less wellknown are the vast amounts of",
          "offset": 5526,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "92:05"
        },
        {
          "text": "worked items that went alongside them,",
          "offset": 5528,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "92:08"
        },
        {
          "text": "signaling the apparent new found",
          "offset": 5532,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "92:12"
        },
        {
          "text": "harnessing of a vast amount of raw",
          "offset": 5534,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "92:14"
        },
        {
          "text": "materials such as bone, antler, ivory,",
          "offset": 5537,
          "duration": 9,
          "formattedTime": "92:17"
        },
        {
          "text": "shells, and minerals.",
          "offset": 5542,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "92:21"
        },
        {
          "text": "The latter being especially common in",
          "offset": 5546,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "92:25"
        },
        {
          "text": "Nufian settlements.",
          "offset": 5548,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "92:28"
        },
        {
          "text": "still considered hunter gatherers who",
          "offset": 5552,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "92:31"
        },
        {
          "text": "invested significant amounts of time",
          "offset": 5554,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "92:34"
        },
        {
          "text": "into creating such artistic pieces.",
          "offset": 5557,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "92:36"
        },
        {
          "text": "Given the sheer amount of time and",
          "offset": 5563,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "92:43"
        },
        {
          "text": "effort invested, such pieces must have",
          "offset": 5565,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "92:45"
        },
        {
          "text": "been immensely important.",
          "offset": 5569,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "92:48"
        },
        {
          "text": "Just maybe early indicators of a shared",
          "offset": 5574,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "92:53"
        },
        {
          "text": "culture to unite a people together.",
          "offset": 5577,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "92:57"
        },
        {
          "text": "such as that so clearly and strikingly",
          "offset": 5581,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "93:01"
        },
        {
          "text": "depicted at Gabbec.",
          "offset": 5585,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "93:04"
        },
        {
          "text": "The organizational abilities required to",
          "offset": 5590,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "93:10"
        },
        {
          "text": "deal with ever more seasonal and",
          "offset": 5593,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "93:13"
        },
        {
          "text": "changing environments in the past has",
          "offset": 5596,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "93:15"
        },
        {
          "text": "long been identified as a key factor in",
          "offset": 5598,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "93:18"
        },
        {
          "text": "human advancement.",
          "offset": 5602,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "93:21"
        },
        {
          "text": "The work of Robert Braidwood went",
          "offset": 5605,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "93:25"
        },
        {
          "text": "further, seeing agricultural emergence",
          "offset": 5608,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "93:27"
        },
        {
          "text": "as a manifestation of human ingenuity.",
          "offset": 5611,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "93:31"
        },
        {
          "text": "Our ability to make life better through",
          "offset": 5616,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "93:35"
        },
        {
          "text": "technology",
          "offset": 5618,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "93:38"
        },
        {
          "text": "by creating a surplus",
          "offset": 5620,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "93:40"
        },
        {
          "text": "such as can be seen with the Nufians and",
          "offset": 5624,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "93:44"
        },
        {
          "text": "at Gobeclete.",
          "offset": 5628,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "93:47"
        },
        {
          "text": "surpluses which could eventually be",
          "offset": 5633,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "93:52"
        },
        {
          "text": "appropriated by people in positions of",
          "offset": 5635,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "93:55"
        },
        {
          "text": "authority",
          "offset": 5638,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "93:57"
        },
        {
          "text": "for individual rather than collective",
          "offset": 5639,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "93:59"
        },
        {
          "text": "gain",
          "offset": 5642,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "94:01"
        },
        {
          "text": "leading to the hierarchical societies",
          "offset": 5643,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "94:03"
        },
        {
          "text": "usually favored by farmers.",
          "offset": 5646,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "94:06"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 5652,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "94:11"
        },
        {
          "text": "For Robert Braidwood, then this settling",
          "offset": 5655,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "94:14"
        },
        {
          "text": "in process allowed for a deeper",
          "offset": 5658,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "94:17"
        },
        {
          "text": "understanding of the environment than",
          "offset": 5661,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "94:20"
        },
        {
          "text": "ever before",
          "offset": 5663,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "94:22"
        },
        {
          "text": "and the development of requisite",
          "offset": 5665,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "94:24"
        },
        {
          "text": "technologies to manipulate it,",
          "offset": 5667,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "94:26"
        },
        {
          "text": "allowing humans to bring plants and",
          "offset": 5672,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "94:31"
        },
        {
          "text": "animals under their control.",
          "offset": 5674,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "94:34"
        },
        {
          "text": "And yet, despite the mounting evidence",
          "offset": 5680,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "94:39"
        },
        {
          "text": "gathered over the last 200 years and",
          "offset": 5683,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "94:42"
        },
        {
          "text": "more,",
          "offset": 5685,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "94:45"
        },
        {
          "text": "the enlightenment vision of the noble",
          "offset": 5687,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "94:46"
        },
        {
          "text": "savage first conjured up by French",
          "offset": 5689,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "94:49"
        },
        {
          "text": "philosopher Jeanjac Rouso is still the",
          "offset": 5692,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "94:51"
        },
        {
          "text": "prevailing view of huntergatherer",
          "offset": 5696,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "94:55"
        },
        {
          "text": "societies in popular culture,",
          "offset": 5698,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "94:57"
        },
        {
          "text": "of simple people living simple lives",
          "offset": 5703,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "95:02"
        },
        {
          "text": "with very little culture. to speak of.",
          "offset": 5706,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "95:06"
        },
        {
          "text": "Ethnological studies of very unique",
          "offset": 5713,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "95:13"
        },
        {
          "text": "groups such as the Kalahari and Mabbouti",
          "offset": 5716,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "95:15"
        },
        {
          "text": "pygmies in the 1960s further complicated",
          "offset": 5719,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "95:18"
        },
        {
          "text": "the picture as seeming to somehow",
          "offset": 5722,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "95:21"
        },
        {
          "text": "represent all huntergatherer groups that",
          "offset": 5725,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "95:24"
        },
        {
          "text": "have ever existed.",
          "offset": 5728,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "95:28"
        },
        {
          "text": "The reality as we have seen is very",
          "offset": 5734,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "95:33"
        },
        {
          "text": "different and much more varied and",
          "offset": 5737,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "95:37"
        },
        {
          "text": "complex.",
          "offset": 5741,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "95:40"
        },
        {
          "text": "Far away in the dense heart of the",
          "offset": 5748,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "95:47"
        },
        {
          "text": "Amazon rainforest,",
          "offset": 5750,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "95:50"
        },
        {
          "text": "anthropologists began studying another",
          "offset": 5754,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "95:53"
        },
        {
          "text": "hunter gatherer group to survive into",
          "offset": 5756,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "95:56"
        },
        {
          "text": "the 20th century.",
          "offset": 5759,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "95:59"
        },
        {
          "text": "Making their home deep in the Brazilian",
          "offset": 5763,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "96:02"
        },
        {
          "text": "wilderness,",
          "offset": 5765,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "96:05"
        },
        {
          "text": "the Nambikawara",
          "offset": 5770,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "96:10"
        },
        {
          "text": "still regularly alternate between",
          "offset": 5772,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "96:11"
        },
        {
          "text": "densely settled villages in the wet",
          "offset": 5774,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "96:13"
        },
        {
          "text": "season and wandering bands in the dry.",
          "offset": 5776,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "96:16"
        },
        {
          "text": "between strict hierarchies and loose",
          "offset": 5784,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "96:23"
        },
        {
          "text": "egalitarianism",
          "offset": 5787,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "96:26"
        },
        {
          "text": "depending on which particular mode suits",
          "offset": 5789,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "96:28"
        },
        {
          "text": "the current situation best.",
          "offset": 5792,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "96:31"
        },
        {
          "text": "The reality is that human culture is",
          "offset": 5796,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "96:36"
        },
        {
          "text": "exceptionally malleable",
          "offset": 5800,
          "duration": 9,
          "formattedTime": "96:39"
        },
        {
          "text": "and human beings never simple.",
          "offset": 5803,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "96:43"
        },
        {
          "text": "Let us now consider even earlier",
          "offset": 5811,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "96:50"
        },
        {
          "text": "examples of organized communal sites and",
          "offset": 5813,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "96:53"
        },
        {
          "text": "markers of complexity.",
          "offset": 5817,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "96:56"
        },
        {
          "text": "For this, we must go back even further,",
          "offset": 5820,
          "duration": 11,
          "formattedTime": "97:00"
        },
        {
          "text": "deep into the midst of the last ice age.",
          "offset": 5825,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "97:05"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 5834,
          "duration": 14,
          "formattedTime": "97:14"
        },
        {
          "text": "Around 25,000",
          "offset": 5846,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "97:25"
        },
        {
          "text": "years ago, in a wide ark from what is",
          "offset": 5848,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "97:27"
        },
        {
          "text": "now Spain to the open stepland of",
          "offset": 5851,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "97:31"
        },
        {
          "text": "Siberia,",
          "offset": 5854,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "97:33"
        },
        {
          "text": "an extraordinary flourishing of human",
          "offset": 5856,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "97:35"
        },
        {
          "text": "culture took place.",
          "offset": 5859,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "97:38"
        },
        {
          "text": "In those millennia, just before the last",
          "offset": 5866,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "97:45"
        },
        {
          "text": "glacial maximum,",
          "offset": 5869,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "97:48"
        },
        {
          "text": "at the very height of the last cold",
          "offset": 5873,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "97:52"
        },
        {
          "text": "period of the ice age,",
          "offset": 5875,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "97:54"
        },
        {
          "text": "it was a world utterly unrecognizable to",
          "offset": 5878,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "97:57"
        },
        {
          "text": "today.",
          "offset": 5882,
          "duration": 9,
          "formattedTime": "98:01"
        },
        {
          "text": "A world surprisingly full of life.",
          "offset": 5884,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "98:04"
        },
        {
          "text": "In the summer months in particular, near",
          "offset": 5898,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "98:18"
        },
        {
          "text": "never ending seasonal parklands would",
          "offset": 5901,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "98:21"
        },
        {
          "text": "open up along the river valleys and",
          "offset": 5904,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "98:23"
        },
        {
          "text": "ahead of glacias,",
          "offset": 5906,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "98:26"
        },
        {
          "text": "populated by vast herds of migrating",
          "offset": 5912,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "98:32"
        },
        {
          "text": "bison, deer, and a wide variety of mega",
          "offset": 5915,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "98:35"
        },
        {
          "text": "fauna.",
          "offset": 5920,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "98:39"
        },
        {
          "text": "much of which is now extinct.",
          "offset": 5921,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "98:41"
        },
        {
          "text": "Moments of calm amidst the brutal,",
          "offset": 5927,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "98:47"
        },
        {
          "text": "unforgiving cold.",
          "offset": 5931,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "98:50"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 5933,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "98:53"
        },
        {
          "text": "Of course, one of those creatures is",
          "offset": 5936,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "98:56"
        },
        {
          "text": "much more famous than the rest.",
          "offset": 5939,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "98:58"
        },
        {
          "text": "the largest of all and absolutely vital",
          "offset": 5944,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "99:03"
        },
        {
          "text": "to the survival of humanity in that",
          "offset": 5948,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "99:07"
        },
        {
          "text": "harsh environment.",
          "offset": 5951,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "99:10"
        },
        {
          "text": "For this was the land of the mammoth",
          "offset": 5956,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "99:15"
        },
        {
          "text": "step.",
          "offset": 5958,
          "duration": 13,
          "formattedTime": "99:18"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 5960,
          "duration": 15,
          "formattedTime": "99:19"
        },
        {
          "text": "And in this often surprisingly lush",
          "offset": 5972,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "99:31"
        },
        {
          "text": "world of vast river valleys and colossal",
          "offset": 5975,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "99:34"
        },
        {
          "text": "herds,",
          "offset": 5978,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "99:38"
        },
        {
          "text": "some of the earliest evidence of human",
          "offset": 5981,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "99:40"
        },
        {
          "text": "sedentism and even very early tenets of",
          "offset": 5984,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "99:43"
        },
        {
          "text": "so-called neolithicization",
          "offset": 5987,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "99:47"
        },
        {
          "text": "have been found.",
          "offset": 5990,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "99:50"
        },
        {
          "text": "Modest clans and tribes sheltered in the",
          "offset": 5996,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "99:55"
        },
        {
          "text": "life-filled pockets between tundra and",
          "offset": 5999,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "99:59"
        },
        {
          "text": "forest zones.",
          "offset": 6002,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "100:02"
        },
        {
          "text": "First defined by Dorothy Garrett in the",
          "offset": 6007,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "100:07"
        },
        {
          "text": "1930s,",
          "offset": 6010,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "100:10"
        },
        {
          "text": "the archaeological culture we know today",
          "offset": 6012,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "100:11"
        },
        {
          "text": "as Gravettian lasted for over 10,000",
          "offset": 6015,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "100:14"
        },
        {
          "text": "years in that bitterly harsh",
          "offset": 6018,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "100:18"
        },
        {
          "text": "environment.",
          "offset": 6021,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "100:20"
        },
        {
          "text": "almost as much time from Gabbecepe to",
          "offset": 6024,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "100:23"
        },
        {
          "text": "today.",
          "offset": 6027,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "100:26"
        },
        {
          "text": "And yet, though today the image of a",
          "offset": 6031,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "100:30"
        },
        {
          "text": "perennial struggle to survive for our",
          "offset": 6034,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "100:33"
        },
        {
          "text": "ice age ancestors is fixed in the public",
          "offset": 6036,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "100:36"
        },
        {
          "text": "imagination,",
          "offset": 6039,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "100:39"
        },
        {
          "text": "this was clearly not always the case.",
          "offset": 6042,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "100:41"
        },
        {
          "text": "The Gravettians spent significant",
          "offset": 6047,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "100:46"
        },
        {
          "text": "amounts of energy in creating art,",
          "offset": 6050,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "100:49"
        },
        {
          "text": "almost all of which is lost.",
          "offset": 6058,
          "duration": 10,
          "formattedTime": "100:57"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 6062,
          "duration": 9,
          "formattedTime": "101:02"
        },
        {
          "text": "Though the famous Venus figurines, over",
          "offset": 6068,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "101:07"
        },
        {
          "text": "a hundred of which are known, give some",
          "offset": 6071,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "101:11"
        },
        {
          "text": "small hint of the lives of these people.",
          "offset": 6074,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "101:13"
        },
        {
          "text": "Arguably for the very first time,",
          "offset": 6082,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "101:22"
        },
        {
          "text": "beginning to live in settled,",
          "offset": 6085,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "101:24"
        },
        {
          "text": "longlasting communities.",
          "offset": 6087,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "101:26"
        },
        {
          "text": "The eastern variant of the Gravettian,",
          "offset": 6093,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "101:32"
        },
        {
          "text": "nestled in the Pavlovian hills of",
          "offset": 6096,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "101:36"
        },
        {
          "text": "southern Moravia,",
          "offset": 6099,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "101:38"
        },
        {
          "text": "also lived settled lives.",
          "offset": 6101,
          "duration": 9,
          "formattedTime": "101:40"
        },
        {
          "text": "But here they did so in vast openair",
          "offset": 6106,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "101:45"
        },
        {
          "text": "settlements,",
          "offset": 6110,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "101:49"
        },
        {
          "text": "the remains of which have survived to",
          "offset": 6113,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "101:53"
        },
        {
          "text": "the present.",
          "offset": 6116,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "101:56"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 6119,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "101:58"
        },
        {
          "text": "Though multitudes exist in a rich",
          "offset": 6123,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "102:03"
        },
        {
          "text": "archaeological landscape stretching far",
          "offset": 6126,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "102:05"
        },
        {
          "text": "out into what is now the plains of",
          "offset": 6129,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "102:08"
        },
        {
          "text": "Russia.",
          "offset": 6131,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "102:11"
        },
        {
          "text": "One of the most famous and important is",
          "offset": 6134,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "102:14"
        },
        {
          "text": "in the modern-day Czech Republic.",
          "offset": 6137,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "102:16"
        },
        {
          "text": "Its name is Doli Vestiche",
          "offset": 6140,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "102:20"
        },
        {
          "text": "and it is in this region that we get not",
          "offset": 6144,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "102:24"
        },
        {
          "text": "just some of the first evidence for",
          "offset": 6147,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "102:27"
        },
        {
          "text": "large settlements in the world",
          "offset": 6149,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "102:29"
        },
        {
          "text": "but of burials too.",
          "offset": 6153,
          "duration": 9,
          "formattedTime": "102:33"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 6157,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "102:37"
        },
        {
          "text": "Dolve Vestoniche is an impressive site.",
          "offset": 6164,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "102:43"
        },
        {
          "text": "In the midst of a mighty perimeter fence",
          "offset": 6169,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "102:49"
        },
        {
          "text": "of mammoth bone, a massive bonfire",
          "offset": 6172,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "102:52"
        },
        {
          "text": "burned,",
          "offset": 6175,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "102:55"
        },
        {
          "text": "surrounded by elaborately built circular",
          "offset": 6180,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "102:59"
        },
        {
          "text": "structures,",
          "offset": 6183,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "103:02"
        },
        {
          "text": "also made of mammoth bone,",
          "offset": 6184,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "103:04"
        },
        {
          "text": "likely covered in skins and hide",
          "offset": 6190,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "103:10"
        },
        {
          "text": "rendering",
          "offset": 6193,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "103:12"
        },
        {
          "text": "within the perimeter fence.",
          "offset": 6196,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "103:16"
        },
        {
          "text": "An abundance of artistic depictions of",
          "offset": 6198,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "103:18"
        },
        {
          "text": "humans and animals have been found",
          "offset": 6201,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "103:21"
        },
        {
          "text": "alongside significant evidence of",
          "offset": 6204,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "103:24"
        },
        {
          "text": "vegetital remains too and all manner of",
          "offset": 6207,
          "duration": 9,
          "formattedTime": "103:27"
        },
        {
          "text": "smaller animals caught in nets.",
          "offset": 6211,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "103:31"
        },
        {
          "text": "Also inside the enclosure, alongside an",
          "offset": 6216,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "103:36"
        },
        {
          "text": "abundance of art and symbolism, is found",
          "offset": 6219,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "103:39"
        },
        {
          "text": "not only the earliest evidence of",
          "offset": 6223,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "103:42"
        },
        {
          "text": "weaving found anywhere, but shells",
          "offset": 6225,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "103:45"
        },
        {
          "text": "originating in the distant",
          "offset": 6229,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "103:48"
        },
        {
          "text": "Mediterranean,",
          "offset": 6231,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "103:50"
        },
        {
          "text": "evidence of farreaching contacts,",
          "offset": 6234,
          "duration": 9,
          "formattedTime": "103:53"
        },
        {
          "text": "or actual wide roaming journeys.",
          "offset": 6238,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "103:57"
        },
        {
          "text": "Outside of the perimeter fence, slightly",
          "offset": 6247,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "104:06"
        },
        {
          "text": "up river, was a sunken structure",
          "offset": 6250,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "104:09"
        },
        {
          "text": "containing a hearth and the remains of",
          "offset": 6253,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "104:12"
        },
        {
          "text": "some 2,300",
          "offset": 6257,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "104:16"
        },
        {
          "text": "clay figurines.",
          "offset": 6259,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "104:19"
        },
        {
          "text": "Perhaps evidence of a separation between",
          "offset": 6265,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "104:24"
        },
        {
          "text": "domesticity",
          "offset": 6268,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "104:28"
        },
        {
          "text": "and ritual life.",
          "offset": 6270,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "104:29"
        },
        {
          "text": "Further to the east, in an isolated",
          "offset": 6276,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "104:35"
        },
        {
          "text": "enclave in the depths of Siberia,",
          "offset": 6279,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "104:38"
        },
        {
          "text": "the similar Malta boret culture went",
          "offset": 6282,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "104:42"
        },
        {
          "text": "about their lives,",
          "offset": 6286,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "104:46"
        },
        {
          "text": "also living in massive mammoth bone",
          "offset": 6289,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "104:49"
        },
        {
          "text": "structures in the open air.",
          "offset": 6292,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "104:52"
        },
        {
          "text": "and also spending significant energy in",
          "offset": 6295,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "104:55"
        },
        {
          "text": "the creation of artistic works.",
          "offset": 6298,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "104:58"
        },
        {
          "text": "It is at sites like this from as early",
          "offset": 6303,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "105:03"
        },
        {
          "text": "as around 25,000 years ago that several",
          "offset": 6306,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "105:06"
        },
        {
          "text": "innovations appear to suggest burgeoning",
          "offset": 6311,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "105:10"
        },
        {
          "text": "movements toward the harnessing of",
          "offset": 6314,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "105:13"
        },
        {
          "text": "agriculture.",
          "offset": 6317,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "105:16"
        },
        {
          "text": "The great human experiment in full",
          "offset": 6319,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "105:19"
        },
        {
          "text": "force.",
          "offset": 6322,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "105:22"
        },
        {
          "text": "Though, as we know now, perched in an",
          "offset": 6329,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "105:28"
        },
        {
          "text": "environment particularly susceptible to",
          "offset": 6332,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "105:32"
        },
        {
          "text": "environmental change, the odds were",
          "offset": 6335,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "105:34"
        },
        {
          "text": "stacked up against them.",
          "offset": 6338,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "105:38"
        },
        {
          "text": "And those mammoth structures themselves,",
          "offset": 6345,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "105:44"
        },
        {
          "text": "as we shall see, could often be much",
          "offset": 6348,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "105:48"
        },
        {
          "text": "larger,",
          "offset": 6352,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "105:51"
        },
        {
          "text": "sometimes being referred to as",
          "offset": 6355,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "105:54"
        },
        {
          "text": "monumental.",
          "offset": 6358,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "105:57"
        },
        {
          "text": "At Costeni in Russia, a recently",
          "offset": 6364,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "106:04"
        },
        {
          "text": "discovered example of megalithic mammoth",
          "offset": 6368,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "106:07"
        },
        {
          "text": "bone architecture has been uncovered.",
          "offset": 6370,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "106:10"
        },
        {
          "text": "Originating",
          "offset": 6374,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "106:13"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 6376,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "106:16"
        },
        {
          "text": "in the Orignian period of around 40,000",
          "offset": 6380,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "106:19"
        },
        {
          "text": "years ago, this site shows signs of an",
          "offset": 6384,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "106:23"
        },
        {
          "text": "impressively lengthy series of",
          "offset": 6387,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "106:27"
        },
        {
          "text": "habitations from then onwards.",
          "offset": 6389,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "106:29"
        },
        {
          "text": "In just one find within an astonishing",
          "offset": 6396,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "106:36"
        },
        {
          "text": "archaeological landscape in around",
          "offset": 6399,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "106:39"
        },
        {
          "text": "23,000 BC, the remains of at least 60",
          "offset": 6402,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "106:42"
        },
        {
          "text": "mammoths had been arrayed into a massive",
          "offset": 6407,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "106:46"
        },
        {
          "text": "circular structure over 12 m in",
          "offset": 6409,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "106:49"
        },
        {
          "text": "diameter.",
          "offset": 6413,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "106:52"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 6414,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "106:54"
        },
        {
          "text": "It is quite simply one of the most",
          "offset": 6420,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "107:00"
        },
        {
          "text": "impressive Paleolithic finds ever made.",
          "offset": 6423,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "107:02"
        },
        {
          "text": "Research at another Russian site,",
          "offset": 6430,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "107:10"
        },
        {
          "text": "Udenovo, suggests that these so-called",
          "offset": 6432,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "107:12"
        },
        {
          "text": "mammoth houses may not in fact have been",
          "offset": 6436,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "107:15"
        },
        {
          "text": "dwellings at all in the conventional",
          "offset": 6439,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "107:18"
        },
        {
          "text": "sense,",
          "offset": 6441,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "107:21"
        },
        {
          "text": "but carefully planned and built to",
          "offset": 6444,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "107:23"
        },
        {
          "text": "commemorate a great mammoth hunt.",
          "offset": 6447,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "107:26"
        },
        {
          "text": "The meat, hides, and bones of which must",
          "offset": 6451,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "107:30"
        },
        {
          "text": "have created a sizable surplus for the",
          "offset": 6454,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "107:34"
        },
        {
          "text": "community,",
          "offset": 6457,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "107:37"
        },
        {
          "text": "which also undertook artistic endeavors",
          "offset": 6462,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "107:41"
        },
        {
          "text": "and exchanged animal pelts, amber, and",
          "offset": 6465,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "107:45"
        },
        {
          "text": "seashells over great distances.",
          "offset": 6469,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "107:48"
        },
        {
          "text": "It all begs the question, could sites",
          "offset": 6474,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "107:53"
        },
        {
          "text": "like Dolni Vestiniche, Casteni, and",
          "offset": 6478,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "107:57"
        },
        {
          "text": "Udenovo have been seasonal congregation",
          "offset": 6481,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "108:01"
        },
        {
          "text": "places where people came together",
          "offset": 6485,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "108:04"
        },
        {
          "text": "annually to trade, to swap stories, to",
          "offset": 6487,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "108:07"
        },
        {
          "text": "feast in the safety of a winter",
          "offset": 6491,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "108:11"
        },
        {
          "text": "sanctuary,",
          "offset": 6494,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "108:13"
        },
        {
          "text": "and perhaps even create elaborate",
          "offset": 6498,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "108:17"
        },
        {
          "text": "monuments. and artistic works.",
          "offset": 6501,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "108:20"
        },
        {
          "text": "Just maybe an early form of Gbeclete.",
          "offset": 6507,
          "duration": 13,
          "formattedTime": "108:26"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 6511,
          "duration": 12,
          "formattedTime": "108:30"
        },
        {
          "text": "The only constant in those days was",
          "offset": 6519,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "108:39"
        },
        {
          "text": "change.",
          "offset": 6522,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "108:42"
        },
        {
          "text": "And before it could fully develop into",
          "offset": 6525,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "108:44"
        },
        {
          "text": "fruition,",
          "offset": 6527,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "108:46"
        },
        {
          "text": "the lifestyle of the mammoth hunters was",
          "offset": 6528,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "108:48"
        },
        {
          "text": "extinguished.",
          "offset": 6532,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "108:51"
        },
        {
          "text": "In the wake of advancing ice sheets",
          "offset": 6537,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "108:56"
        },
        {
          "text": "rolling down from the north to the last",
          "offset": 6539,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "108:59"
        },
        {
          "text": "glacial maximum of around 20,000 years",
          "offset": 6542,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "109:02"
        },
        {
          "text": "ago,",
          "offset": 6545,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "109:05"
        },
        {
          "text": "Doli Vaniche and many other sites like",
          "offset": 6547,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "109:06"
        },
        {
          "text": "it were abandoned.",
          "offset": 6550,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "109:10"
        },
        {
          "text": "their people forced to move ever",
          "offset": 6553,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "109:12"
        },
        {
          "text": "southwards to escape the certain death",
          "offset": 6555,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "109:15"
        },
        {
          "text": "of the perafrost.",
          "offset": 6559,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "109:18"
        },
        {
          "text": "By around 18,000 BC, however, permanent",
          "offset": 6565,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "109:25"
        },
        {
          "text": "settlements of considerable scale once",
          "offset": 6570,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "109:29"
        },
        {
          "text": "again began to form",
          "offset": 6572,
          "duration": 9,
          "formattedTime": "109:32"
        },
        {
          "text": "in areas particularly abundant in life.",
          "offset": 6575,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "109:35"
        },
        {
          "text": "At the sites of Mezin and Mazerich in",
          "offset": 6583,
