          "formattedTime": "118:19"
        },
        {
          "text": "The construction of enclosures now even",
          "offset": 7105,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "118:25"
        },
        {
          "text": "being linked by isotopic evidence to",
          "offset": 7108,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "118:27"
        },
        {
          "text": "periods of annual superabundance",
          "offset": 7110,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "118:30"
        },
        {
          "text": "when vast herds of gazelle would descend",
          "offset": 7113,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "118:33"
        },
        {
          "text": "on the Haran plane",
          "offset": 7116,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "118:36"
        },
        {
          "text": "creating an immense surplus of food for",
          "offset": 7121,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "118:40"
        },
        {
          "text": "the hunters living nearby.",
          "offset": 7124,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "118:44"
        },
        {
          "text": "As we have seen time and time again, our",
          "offset": 7130,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "118:49"
        },
        {
          "text": "ancestors weren't just our equals in",
          "offset": 7134,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "118:53"
        },
        {
          "text": "cognitive capacity,",
          "offset": 7137,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "118:57"
        },
        {
          "text": "but in intellect, even philosophy, too.",
          "offset": 7139,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "118:59"
        },
        {
          "text": "And so we turn back to the megalith",
          "offset": 7147,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "119:07"
        },
        {
          "text": "builders of the earth plain.",
          "offset": 7150,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "119:10"
        },
        {
          "text": "Despite their impressive size and the",
          "offset": 7158,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "119:18"
        },
        {
          "text": "great skill of their construction, the",
          "offset": 7161,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "119:21"
        },
        {
          "text": "enclosures at Gbeclete",
          "offset": 7164,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "119:24"
        },
        {
          "text": "seem only to have been used for a",
          "offset": 7167,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "119:26"
        },
        {
          "text": "relatively short amount of time, much",
          "offset": 7169,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "119:29"
        },
        {
          "text": "less, for example, than some of the",
          "offset": 7173,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "119:32"
        },
        {
          "text": "previously discussed Ice Age sites.",
          "offset": 7175,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "119:34"
        },
        {
          "text": "Their raising and ultimately ritual",
          "offset": 7180,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "119:39"
        },
        {
          "text": "deaths and burials, often within just a",
          "offset": 7183,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "119:42"
        },
        {
          "text": "few generations,",
          "offset": 7186,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "119:46"
        },
        {
          "text": "may well have been the point.",
          "offset": 7188,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "119:48"
        },
        {
          "text": "Hierarchies raised to the sky only to be",
          "offset": 7193,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "119:52"
        },
        {
          "text": "torn down again as part of some longlost",
          "offset": 7197,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "119:57"
        },
        {
          "text": "ceremony.",
          "offset": 7201,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "120:00"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 7202,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "120:01"
        },
        {
          "text": "Just maybe it is festival activities at",
          "offset": 7207,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "120:07"
        },
        {
          "text": "sites like these that the very first",
          "offset": 7210,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "120:10"
        },
        {
          "text": "beginnings of larger societies and",
          "offset": 7213,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "120:12"
        },
        {
          "text": "nations first began to coalesce",
          "offset": 7216,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "120:15"
        },
        {
          "text": "united by stories and the links fostered",
          "offset": 7220,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "120:20"
        },
        {
          "text": "during those communal times.",
          "offset": 7224,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "120:23"
        },
        {
          "text": "Indeed, the abundance of flint shards",
          "offset": 7230,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "120:30"
        },
        {
          "text": "found all over the surface of Gbeclete,",
          "offset": 7233,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "120:33"
        },
        {
          "text": "many of which were brought in from afar,",
          "offset": 7237,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "120:36"
        },
        {
          "text": "suggests trading or exchange activities",
          "offset": 7240,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "120:40"
        },
        {
          "text": "with distant groups",
          "offset": 7244,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "120:43"
        },
        {
          "text": "or even full-blown seasonal migrations.",
          "offset": 7246,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "120:46"
        },
        {
          "text": "whether the stones themselves were taboo",
          "offset": 7253,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "120:53"
        },
        {
          "text": "for most of the year. Access denied to",
          "offset": 7256,
          "duration": 9,
          "formattedTime": "120:56"
        },
        {
          "text": "anyone but a hypothesized temple elite.",
          "offset": 7260,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "120:59"
        },
        {
          "text": "But given free access during festival",
          "offset": 7266,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "121:05"
        },
        {
          "text": "times, we can't be sure.",
          "offset": 7268,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "121:08"
        },
        {
          "text": "left to conjure fleeting visions of a",
          "offset": 7275,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "121:14"
        },
        {
          "text": "medieval carnival",
          "offset": 7278,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "121:18"
        },
        {
          "text": "or Roman Satanalia",
          "offset": 7281,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "121:20"
        },
        {
          "text": "where societal roles were switched.",
          "offset": 7284,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "121:24"
        },
        {
          "text": "The world turned upside down.",
          "offset": 7288,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "121:28"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 7292,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "121:32"
        },
        {
          "text": "There is however concrete evidence in",
          "offset": 7294,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "121:33"
        },
        {
          "text": "the abundant remains of gazelle, boar,",
          "offset": 7297,
          "duration": 10,
          "formattedTime": "121:36"
        },
        {
          "text": "goat, red deer, sheep, oxen, vultures,",
          "offset": 7301,
          "duration": 10,
          "formattedTime": "121:40"
        },
        {
          "text": "ducks, and an entire managerie of birds.",
          "offset": 7307,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "121:46"
        },
        {
          "text": "Most of the animals depicted on the",
          "offset": 7311,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "121:51"
        },
        {
          "text": "monoliths",
          "offset": 7313,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "121:53"
        },
        {
          "text": "that goepe",
          "offset": 7315,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "121:54"
        },
        {
          "text": "was very likely a site for feasting",
          "offset": 7317,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "121:56"
        },
        {
          "text": "events.",
          "offset": 7320,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "122:00"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 7322,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "122:02"
        },
        {
          "text": "But what did those feasts actually look",
          "offset": 7325,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "122:04"
        },
        {
          "text": "like?",
          "offset": 7328,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "122:08"
        },
        {
          "text": "Turning to the far edge of the world in",
          "offset": 7335,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "122:15"
        },
        {
          "text": "the Pacific Northwest of the United",
          "offset": 7338,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "122:18"
        },
        {
          "text": "States,",
          "offset": 7340,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "122:20"
        },
        {
          "text": "another land of totem poles, a wash with",
          "offset": 7342,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "122:22"
        },
        {
          "text": "memory and the customs of long venerated",
          "offset": 7346,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "122:25"
        },
        {
          "text": "ancestors.",
          "offset": 7349,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "122:29"
        },
        {
          "text": "The Quacul people have exercised a mid-",
          "offset": 7352,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "122:32"
        },
        {
          "text": "winter ceremony for as long as anyone",
          "offset": 7356,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "122:35"
        },
        {
          "text": "can remember.",
          "offset": 7358,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "122:38"
        },
        {
          "text": "When people came from afar to congregate",
          "offset": 7363,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "122:43"
        },
        {
          "text": "and regroup",
          "offset": 7367,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "122:46"
        },
        {
          "text": "under the harsh grip of an icy black",
          "offset": 7370,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "122:50"
        },
        {
          "text": "sky, a shifting ritual of so-called bear",
          "offset": 7372,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "122:52"
        },
        {
          "text": "dancers and fool dancers replace the",
          "offset": 7376,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "122:56"
        },
        {
          "text": "usual social hierarchy.",
          "offset": 7380,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "122:59"
        },
        {
          "text": "In scenes reminiscent of Roman Satinelia",
          "offset": 7384,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "123:03"
        },
        {
          "text": "and the medieval carnival, the mid",
          "offset": 7387,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "123:06"
        },
        {
          "text": "winter is a time when the lowest of the",
          "offset": 7389,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "123:09"
        },
        {
          "text": "low are elevated to the highest",
          "offset": 7392,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "123:11"
        },
        {
          "text": "positions in society",
          "offset": 7394,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "123:14"
        },
        {
          "text": "and vice versa.",
          "offset": 7397,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "123:16"
        },
        {
          "text": "though of course separated by vast gulfs",
          "offset": 7400,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "123:19"
        },
        {
          "text": "of distance and time.",
          "offset": 7403,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "123:23"
        },
        {
          "text": "Perhaps some small similarity may be",
          "offset": 7406,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "123:26"
        },
        {
          "text": "found with those purported festivals on",
          "offset": 7410,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "123:29"
        },
        {
          "text": "the southern edge of the Taurus",
          "offset": 7413,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "123:32"
        },
        {
          "text": "mountains so long ago.",
          "offset": 7414,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "123:34"
        },
        {
          "text": "For evidence of the festivals themselves",
          "offset": 7421,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "123:41"
        },
        {
          "text": "in that so-called stone hills culture,",
          "offset": 7424,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "123:44"
        },
        {
          "text": "we can look to Quebece's sister sites",
          "offset": 7428,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "123:47"
        },
        {
          "text": "too.",
          "offset": 7431,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "123:50"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 7434,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "123:53"
        },
        {
          "text": "Nali Chry in particular is a site which",
          "offset": 7436,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "123:56"
        },
        {
          "text": "has yielded an unusually rich array of",
          "offset": 7439,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "123:59"
        },
        {
          "text": "artifacts of many types.",
          "offset": 7442,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "124:02"
        },
        {
          "text": "One rare engraved stone basin on the",
          "offset": 7446,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "124:05"
        },
        {
          "text": "floor of one of the houses has even been",
          "offset": 7449,
          "duration": 9,
          "formattedTime": "124:09"
        },
        {
          "text": "suggested to be a sacrificial altar.",
          "offset": 7452,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "124:12"
        },
        {
          "text": "It was carved with an unusual central",
          "offset": 7459,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "124:19"
        },
        {
          "text": "figure originally interpreted as a",
          "offset": 7462,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "124:22"
        },
        {
          "text": "turtle. Opinions have shifted since to",
          "offset": 7465,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "124:25"
        },
        {
          "text": "interpret the scene as a woman in dance.",
          "offset": 7468,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "124:28"
        },
        {
          "text": "feet pointed down, her arms raised to",
          "offset": 7473,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "124:32"
        },
        {
          "text": "the sky.",
          "offset": 7476,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "124:35"
        },
        {
          "text": "If true, this would be one of the",
          "offset": 7480,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "124:39"
        },
        {
          "text": "earliest dancing scenes in all of",
          "offset": 7482,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "124:42"
        },
        {
          "text": "history.",
          "offset": 7485,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "124:44"
        },
        {
          "text": "An activity very often tied up in",
          "offset": 7488,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "124:47"
        },
        {
          "text": "festival and religious activities,",
          "offset": 7491,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "124:50"
        },
        {
          "text": "found in almost every society in",
          "offset": 7495,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "124:54"
        },
        {
          "text": "history.",
          "offset": 7498,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "124:57"
        },
        {
          "text": "We even have evidence of musical",
          "offset": 7502,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "125:02"
        },
        {
          "text": "instruments too",
          "offset": 7505,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "125:05"
        },
        {
          "text": "stretching far back into the Paleolithic",
          "offset": 7508,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "125:08"
        },
        {
          "text": "in the form of bull roarers, clappers,",
          "offset": 7512,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "125:12"
        },
        {
          "text": "rattles, and scrapers.",
          "offset": 7515,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "125:15"
        },
        {
          "text": "When reconstructed and played today,",
          "offset": 7522,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "125:22"
        },
        {
          "text": "they recall primordial sounds of",
          "offset": 7526,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "125:25"
        },
        {
          "text": "travelers dancing to the drum of the",
          "offset": 7529,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "125:28"
        },
        {
          "text": "divine.",
          "offset": 7532,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "125:31"
        },
        {
          "text": "Pilgrims even come from nearby and",
          "offset": 7534,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "125:34"
        },
        {
          "text": "distant lands to sacrifice, to feast,",
          "offset": 7538,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "125:37"
        },
        {
          "text": "and to celebrate in the shadow of the",
          "offset": 7542,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "125:42"
        },
        {
          "text": "obelisks.",
          "offset": 7545,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "125:45"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 7548,
          "duration": 9,
          "formattedTime": "125:47"
        },
        {
          "text": "We also know that Gabbece's significance",
          "offset": 7552,
          "duration": 10,
          "formattedTime": "125:52"
        },
        {
          "text": "extended far beyond the earth plain.",
          "offset": 7556,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "125:56"
        },
        {
          "text": "Obsidian deposits originating in",
          "offset": 7563,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "126:02"
        },
        {
          "text": "Capidosia to the northwest and beyond.",
          "offset": 7566,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "126:05"
        },
        {
          "text": "Perhaps brought by traveling",
          "offset": 7569,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "126:08"
        },
        {
          "text": "specialists, imbuing items and",
          "offset": 7571,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "126:10"
        },
        {
          "text": "themselves with power and energy for the",
          "offset": 7574,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "126:13"
        },
        {
          "text": "year to come.",
          "offset": 7577,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "126:16"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 7579,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "126:18"
        },
        {
          "text": "Other travelers at the dawn of settled",
          "offset": 7581,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "126:21"
        },
        {
          "text": "life,",
          "offset": 7584,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "126:23"
        },
        {
          "text": "entertainers,",
          "offset": 7585,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "126:25"
        },
        {
          "text": "healers,",
          "offset": 7587,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "126:27"
        },
        {
          "text": "storytellers",
          "offset": 7590,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "126:29"
        },
        {
          "text": "cannot be proven.",
          "offset": 7591,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "126:31"
        },
        {
          "text": "Any evidence that might have once",
          "offset": 7595,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "126:34"
        },
        {
          "text": "existed",
          "offset": 7597,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "126:36"
        },
        {
          "text": "long ago having disappeared into",
          "offset": 7598,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "126:38"
        },
        {
          "text": "nothing.",
          "offset": 7601,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "126:41"
        },
        {
          "text": "though we can speculate nonetheless.",
          "offset": 7606,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "126:46"
        },
        {
          "text": "Since the very earliest days of",
          "offset": 7616,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "126:55"
        },
        {
          "text": "archaeology and anthropology,",
          "offset": 7618,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "126:58"
        },
        {
          "text": "scholars have sought an understanding of",
          "offset": 7621,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "127:00"
        },
        {
          "text": "how our world came to be.",
          "offset": 7623,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "127:03"
        },
        {
          "text": "One of the most enduring and popular",
          "offset": 7630,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "127:09"
        },
        {
          "text": "ideas was an ominous one.",
          "offset": 7632,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "127:12"
        },
        {
          "text": "that warfare lay at the heart of",
          "offset": 7636,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "127:16"
        },
        {
          "text": "everything.",
          "offset": 7639,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "127:19"
        },
        {
          "text": "Social complexity spurred on by fear and",
          "offset": 7641,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "127:21"
        },
        {
          "text": "hatred above all.",
          "offset": 7646,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "127:25"
        },
        {
          "text": "And yet in recent decades, this concept",
          "offset": 7650,
          "duration": 10,
          "formattedTime": "127:29"
        },
        {
          "text": "has been undermined by a thousand cuts.",
          "offset": 7654,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "127:33"
        },
        {
          "text": "Again and again, new discoveries at",
          "offset": 7661,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "127:41"
        },
        {
          "text": "sites like Corral in the Americas and",
          "offset": 7664,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "127:44"
        },
        {
          "text": "now at Gabbec",
          "offset": 7668,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "127:48"
        },
        {
          "text": "lying at the very beginning of settled",
          "offset": 7671,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "127:50"
        },
        {
          "text": "societies show no evidence of any kind",
          "offset": 7673,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "127:53"
        },
        {
          "text": "of fighting.",
          "offset": 7677,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "127:56"
        },
        {
          "text": "Instead, a new theory has increasingly",
          "offset": 7684,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "128:03"
        },
        {
          "text": "risen in stature.",
          "offset": 7686,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "128:06"
        },
        {
          "text": "The concept that it might actually be",
          "offset": 7692,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "128:12"
        },
        {
          "text": "ritual that led to the adoption of",
          "offset": 7695,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "128:14"
        },
        {
          "text": "agriculture",
          "offset": 7698,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "128:17"
        },
        {
          "text": "and stratification and its initial",
          "offset": 7699,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "128:19"
        },
        {
          "text": "development.",
          "offset": 7702,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "128:22"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 7704,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "128:23"
        },
        {
          "text": "Though they weren't quite there yet, the",
          "offset": 7707,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "128:26"
        },
        {
          "text": "affluent hunters of the Stonehills",
          "offset": 7710,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "128:29"
        },
        {
          "text": "culture would be soon. And just maybe",
          "offset": 7712,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "128:31"
        },
        {
          "text": "they needed a revolution in the mind in",
          "offset": 7716,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "128:36"
        },
        {
          "text": "order to be able to do so.",
          "offset": 7719,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "128:39"
        },
        {
          "text": "After all, ritual and a strictly",
          "offset": 7726,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "128:46"
        },
        {
          "text": "followed set of ideas are necessary for",
          "offset": 7729,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "128:49"
        },
        {
          "text": "a farmer society.",
          "offset": 7732,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "128:52"
        },
        {
          "text": "Ideas which often give no instant",
          "offset": 7736,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "128:55"
        },
        {
          "text": "gratification like that of the hunters.",
          "offset": 7739,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "128:58"
        },
        {
          "text": "Instead, immense amounts of work has to",
          "offset": 7744,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "129:03"
        },
        {
          "text": "be invested in some illdefined and",
          "offset": 7747,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "129:06"
        },
        {
          "text": "sometimes even illusory goal.",
          "offset": 7750,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "129:09"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 7754,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "129:13"
        },
        {
          "text": "Early agrarian societies needed a high",
          "offset": 7757,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "129:17"
        },
        {
          "text": "level of social cohesion and management",
          "offset": 7760,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "129:20"
        },
        {
          "text": "simply in order to motivate their people",
          "offset": 7764,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "129:23"
        },
        {
          "text": "to get past this first step.",
          "offset": 7766,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "129:26"
        },
        {
          "text": "Could it be that such powerful bonds",
          "offset": 7770,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "129:30"
        },
        {
          "text": "were fostered at sites like Gabbecepe",
          "offset": 7773,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "129:33"
        },
        {
          "text": "where shared stories and myths unite",
          "offset": 7778,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "129:37"
        },
        {
          "text": "people with feasting as the ultimate",
          "offset": 7780,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "129:40"
        },
        {
          "text": "social glue",
          "offset": 7784,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "129:43"
        },
        {
          "text": "towards the end of the 20th century",
          "offset": 7792,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "129:51"
        },
        {
          "text": "basing his ideas on a lifetime of",
          "offset": 7794,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "129:54"
        },
        {
          "text": "research in the field anthropologist",
          "offset": 7797,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "129:56"
        },
        {
          "text": "Brian Iron Hayden took this idea further",
          "offset": 7800,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "129:59"
        },
        {
          "text": "with the concept of competitive",
          "offset": 7803,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "130:02"
        },
        {
          "text": "feasting.",
          "offset": 7805,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "130:05"
        },
        {
          "text": "In his hypothesis, any surplus of food",
          "offset": 7809,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "130:09"
        },
        {
          "text": "resources could be amassed by small",
          "offset": 7812,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "130:12"
        },
        {
          "text": "emerging huntergatherer hierarchies",
          "offset": 7815,
          "duration": 9,
          "formattedTime": "130:14"
        },
        {
          "text": "and invested to gain a labor force.",
          "offset": 7818,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "130:18"
        },
        {
          "text": "In a traditional society of hunter",
          "offset": 7826,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "130:25"
        },
        {
          "text": "gatherers, skilled hunters are able to",
          "offset": 7828,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "130:28"
        },
        {
          "text": "leverage immediate social capital in the",
          "offset": 7831,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "130:31"
        },
        {
          "text": "form of their skill set alone. The",
          "offset": 7834,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "130:34"
        },
        {
          "text": "unskilled are dead weight.",
          "offset": 7837,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "130:36"
        },
        {
          "text": "In a farming society, actual skills are",
          "offset": 7843,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "130:43"
        },
        {
          "text": "less important. It is physical capital,",
          "offset": 7846,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "130:46"
        },
        {
          "text": "goods that are valued above all.",
          "offset": 7850,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "130:50"
        },
        {
          "text": "goods which can be inherited and",
          "offset": 7854,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "130:54"
        },
        {
          "text": "significant wealth accrewed with no",
          "offset": 7857,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "130:56"
        },
        {
          "text": "skills involved at all.",
          "offset": 7859,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "130:59"
        },
        {
          "text": "Eventually when the latter groups grew",
          "offset": 7865,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "131:05"
        },
        {
          "text": "in power everything was to change",
          "offset": 7867,
          "duration": 11,
          "formattedTime": "131:07"
        },
        {
          "text": "inherent inequality going forth.",
          "offset": 7873,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "131:12"
        },
        {
          "text": "Hayden's hypothesis continues that once",
          "offset": 7879,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "131:18"
        },
        {
          "text": "competition for influence between rivals",
          "offset": 7882,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "131:21"
        },
        {
          "text": "begins,",
          "offset": 7884,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "131:24"
        },
        {
          "text": "experimentation in farming is driven",
          "offset": 7886,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "131:25"
        },
        {
          "text": "forwards",
          "offset": 7888,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "131:28"
        },
        {
          "text": "as the potential to produce a much",
          "offset": 7890,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "131:30"
        },
        {
          "text": "larger surplus is realized.",
          "offset": 7892,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "131:32"
        },
        {
          "text": "Individuals can then pursue prestige and",
          "offset": 7896,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "131:36"
        },
        {
          "text": "power through favors owed to them.",
          "offset": 7899,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "131:39"
        },
        {
          "text": "And yet feasts are clearly not always",
          "offset": 7906,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "131:46"
        },
        {
          "text": "competitive in nature. The norm may even",
          "offset": 7910,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "131:50"
        },
        {
          "text": "have been the complete opposite of",
          "offset": 7914,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "131:54"
        },
        {
          "text": "Hayden's idea.",
          "offset": 7916,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "131:56"
        },
        {
          "text": "That feasting was egalitarian in nature,",
          "offset": 7919,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "131:59"
        },
        {
          "text": "aimed at counteracting tendencies",
          "offset": 7923,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "132:02"
        },
        {
          "text": "towards the formation of unequal",
          "offset": 7925,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "132:05"
        },
        {
          "text": "hierarchies",
          "offset": 7927,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "132:07"
        },
        {
          "text": "and promoting the obligatory sharing of",
          "offset": 7929,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "132:09"
        },
        {
          "text": "food.",
          "offset": 7932,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "132:12"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 7933,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "132:13"
        },
        {
          "text": "Though it may well be that feasts had",
          "offset": 7937,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "132:16"
        },
        {
          "text": "little to do with the harnessing of",
          "offset": 7940,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "132:20"
        },
        {
          "text": "agriculture.",
          "offset": 7942,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "132:22"
        },
        {
          "text": "After all, animals and grains were all",
          "offset": 7945,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "132:25"
        },
        {
          "text": "wild at Gbeclete.",
          "offset": 7949,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "132:28"
        },
        {
          "text": "The origins of agriculture could well be",
          "offset": 7954,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "132:33"
        },
        {
          "text": "entirely separate from that nearly",
          "offset": 7956,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "132:36"
        },
        {
          "text": "12,000-year-old sanctuary of megaliths.",
          "offset": 7959,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "132:38"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 7963,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "132:42"
        },
        {
          "text": "Nevertheless, regardless of the origins",
          "offset": 7966,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "132:46"
        },
        {
          "text": "of agriculture,",
          "offset": 7969,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "132:49"
        },
        {
          "text": "it is clear that when societies knew how",
          "offset": 7971,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "132:51"
        },
        {
          "text": "to organize their members effectively,",
          "offset": 7974,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "132:53"
        },
        {
          "text": "they gained an evolutionary advantage.",
          "offset": 7976,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "132:56"
        },
        {
          "text": "A great deal of energy going not into",
          "offset": 7980,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "133:00"
        },
        {
          "text": "obviously productive work or even food",
          "offset": 7983,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "133:02"
        },
        {
          "text": "producing,",
          "offset": 7986,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "133:06"
        },
        {
          "text": "but in formulating a sense of unity",
          "offset": 7988,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "133:08"
        },
        {
          "text": "and shared identity.",
          "offset": 7992,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "133:11"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 7994,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "133:14"
        },
        {
          "text": "The emergence of agriculture then could",
          "offset": 8000,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "133:19"
        },
        {
          "text": "be tied to investment in ideology,",
          "offset": 8003,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "133:22"
        },
        {
          "text": "a greater societal good that would allow",
          "offset": 8008,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "133:28"
        },
        {
          "text": "willingly for the tolerance of",
          "offset": 8011,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "133:30"
        },
        {
          "text": "inequalities and hierarchy to form.",
          "offset": 8013,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "133:32"
        },
        {
          "text": "The same sort of sentiment that some",
          "offset": 8019,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "133:38"
        },
        {
          "text": "7,000 years later would lead far-flung",
          "offset": 8021,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "133:41"
        },
        {
          "text": "people to bring their cattle to",
          "offset": 8025,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "133:45"
        },
        {
          "text": "Durington Walls near Stonehenge.",
          "offset": 8027,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "133:47"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 8031,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "133:51"
        },
        {
          "text": "even later at Delelfi and Kusco",
          "offset": 8033,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "133:52"
        },
        {
          "text": "and at modern festivals too where people",
          "offset": 8039,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "133:59"
        },
        {
          "text": "still go to hear news from neighbors,",
          "offset": 8043,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "134:03"
        },
        {
          "text": "to meet husbands and wives",
          "offset": 8047,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "134:06"
        },
        {
          "text": "and to inadvertently spread communal",
          "offset": 8049,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "134:09"
        },
        {
          "text": "culture.",
          "offset": 8053,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "134:12"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 8054,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "134:14"
        },
        {
          "text": "But of course, there is often another",
          "offset": 8057,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "134:16"
        },
        {
          "text": "aspect to it as well.",
          "offset": 8061,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "134:20"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 8064,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "134:24"
        },
        {
          "text": "A chance to reason with the other world",
          "offset": 8068,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "134:27"
        },
        {
          "text": "and the divine",
          "offset": 8072,
          "duration": 22,
          "formattedTime": "134:31"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 8074,
          "duration": 20,
          "formattedTime": "134:33"
        },
        {
          "text": "In 1955,",
          "offset": 8095,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "134:54"
        },
        {
          "text": "Russian quarry workers digging pits some",
          "offset": 8096,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "134:56"
        },
        {
          "text": "200 kilometers east of Moscow came upon",
          "offset": 8099,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "134:59"
        },
        {
          "text": "something they weren't expecting.",
          "offset": 8103,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "135:02"
        },
        {
          "text": "The ruins of an ancient settlement",
          "offset": 8107,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "135:06"
        },
        {
          "text": "buried in the clay.",
          "offset": 8110,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "135:09"
        },
        {
          "text": "When the radiocarbon dates came back,",
          "offset": 8115,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "135:15"
        },
        {
          "text": "the group of experts called in from the",
          "offset": 8118,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "135:18"
        },
        {
          "text": "Russian Academy of Science could",
          "offset": 8121,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "135:20"
        },
        {
          "text": "scarcely believe the results.",
          "offset": 8123,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "135:22"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 8125,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "135:25"
        },
        {
          "text": "Scattered over 5 kilometers on the edge",
          "offset": 8129,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "135:29"
        },
        {
          "text": "of a remote Russian riverbank. The",
          "offset": 8133,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "135:32"
        },
        {
          "text": "prehistoric settlement of Sungeear",
          "offset": 8136,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "135:35"
        },
        {
          "text": "turned out to be one of the earliest",
          "offset": 8139,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "135:39"
        },
        {
          "text": "recorded sites of anatomically modern",
          "offset": 8141,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "135:41"
        },
        {
          "text": "humans found anywhere in Eurasia,",
          "offset": 8144,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "135:44"
        },
        {
          "text": "dating to somewhere between 32 and",
          "offset": 8151,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "135:50"
        },
        {
          "text": "28,000",
          "offset": 8154,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "135:54"
        },
        {
          "text": "BC.",
          "offset": 8156,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "135:56"
        },
        {
          "text": "Though still largely unknown in popular",
          "offset": 8161,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "136:01"
        },
        {
          "text": "culture,",
          "offset": 8164,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "136:04"
        },
        {
          "text": "particularly in the West due to the",
          "offset": 8166,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "136:05"
        },
        {
          "text": "disconnect of the Cold War, over the",
          "offset": 8168,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "136:07"
        },
        {
          "text": "next 20 years of excavations, the wildly",
          "offset": 8171,
          "duration": 9,
          "formattedTime": "136:10"
        },
        {
          "text": "significant discoveries kept coming in.",
          "offset": 8174,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "136:14"
        },
        {
          "text": "Perhaps most astonishing of all, both in",
          "offset": 8181,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "136:21"
        },
        {
          "text": "terms of their state of preservation and",
          "offset": 8185,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "136:25"
        },
        {
          "text": "their contents,",
          "offset": 8188,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "136:28"
        },
        {
          "text": "were the grave sites.",
          "offset": 8190,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "136:29"
        },
        {
          "text": "Also, some of the earliest ever found in",
          "offset": 8195,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "136:35"
        },
        {
          "text": "Eurasia",
          "offset": 8199,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "136:38"
        },
        {
          "text": "and as we shall see, among the most",
          "offset": 8200,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "136:40"
        },
        {
          "text": "unusual.",
          "offset": 8204,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "136:43"
        },
        {
          "text": "Grave two consisted of a pair of",
          "offset": 8208,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "136:48"
        },
        {
          "text": "adolescent children laid down facing one",
          "offset": 8211,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "136:51"
        },
        {
          "text": "another head to head along with an adult",
          "offset": 8215,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "136:55"
        },
        {
          "text": "leg bone filled with ochre.",
          "offset": 8218,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "136:58"
        },
        {
          "text": "Grave one contained an adult male",
          "offset": 8227,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "137:06"
        },
        {
          "text": "similarly coated in red ochre,",
          "offset": 8232,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "137:11"
        },
        {
          "text": "a substance associated with religious",
          "offset": 8235,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "137:14"
        },
        {
          "text": "rights and death rituals all over the",
          "offset": 8238,
          "duration": 10,
          "formattedTime": "137:17"
        },
        {
          "text": "world from the very beginning to today.",
          "offset": 8241,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "137:21"
        },
        {
          "text": "But most amazing of all were the",
          "offset": 8249,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "137:29"
        },
        {
          "text": "thousands upon thousands of intricately",
          "offset": 8252,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "137:32"
        },
        {
          "text": "crafted ivory beaded pieces of jewelry,",
          "offset": 8256,
          "duration": 10,
          "formattedTime": "137:36"
        },
        {
          "text": "clothing, and spears among other items.",
          "offset": 8260,
          "duration": 9,
          "formattedTime": "137:40"
        },
        {
          "text": "Quite literally coating the bodies.",
          "offset": 8266,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "137:45"
        },
        {
          "text": "Some 13,000 beads in all having been",
          "offset": 8269,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "137:49"
        },
        {
          "text": "uncovered.",
          "offset": 8273,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "137:53"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 8276,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "137:55"
        },
        {
          "text": "An artistic effort that would have taken",
          "offset": 8278,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "137:58"
        },
        {
          "text": "an estimated 10,000 hours to produce.",
          "offset": 8281,
          "duration": 9,
          "formattedTime": "138:00"
        },
        {
          "text": "A truly vast investment.",
          "offset": 8286,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "138:05"
        },
        {
          "text": "as well as being taken as some of the",
          "offset": 8292,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "138:12"
        },
        {
          "text": "earliest direct evidence for religious",
          "offset": 8295,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "138:14"
        },
        {
          "text": "practices in Eurasia. The Sungeear",
          "offset": 8297,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "138:17"
        },
        {
          "text": "burials are also often seen as a",
          "offset": 8300,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "138:20"
        },
        {
          "text": "particularly early example of a highly",
          "offset": 8304,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "138:23"
        },
        {
          "text": "developed systems of rank existing deep",
          "offset": 8306,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "138:26"
        },
        {
          "text": "in the Paleolithic past.",
          "offset": 8310,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "138:29"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 8312,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "138:32"
        },
        {
          "text": "It is a view further bolstered by a",
          "offset": 8314,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "138:34"
        },
        {
          "text": "similarly ancient find in Italy known as",
          "offset": 8317,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "138:37"
        },
        {
          "text": "Elp Principe,",
          "offset": 8322,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "138:41"
        },
        {
          "text": "adorned with a similarly incredible",
          "offset": 8325,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "138:45"
        },
        {
          "text": "array of grave goods.",
          "offset": 8328,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "138:48"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 8330,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "138:50"
        },
        {
          "text": "And yet further investigations into",
          "offset": 8334,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "138:53"
        },
        {
          "text": "Paleolithic burials from the Oricgnacian",
          "offset": 8337,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "138:56"
        },
        {
          "text": "to the Gravettian to the Magdalenian,",
          "offset": 8340,
          "duration": 9,
          "formattedTime": "139:00"
        },
        {
          "text": "from Spain to Russia to the Levant",
          "offset": 8345,
          "duration": 9,
          "formattedTime": "139:04"
        },
        {
          "text": "may hint at more unusual reasons for",
          "offset": 8349,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "139:09"
        },
        {
          "text": "having such ornate burials.",
          "offset": 8354,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "139:13"
        },
        {
          "text": "After all, no fortifications,",
          "offset": 8358,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "139:17"
        },
        {
          "text": "storehouses,",
          "offset": 8362,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "139:21"
        },
        {
          "text": "palaces,",
          "offset": 8363,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "139:23"
        },
        {
          "text": "or any other evidence of conventional",
          "offset": 8365,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "139:24"
        },
        {
          "text": "chieftains have been found,",
          "offset": 8368,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "139:27"
        },
        {
          "text": "let alone anything resembling a state",
          "offset": 8371,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "139:31"
        },
        {
          "text": "that we would recognize.",
          "offset": 8374,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "139:34"
        },
        {
          "text": "Elsewhere in Eurasia during the",
          "offset": 8381,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "139:40"
        },
        {
          "text": "Paleolithic,",
          "offset": 8383,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "139:42"
        },
        {
          "text": "a striking number of burials contain",
          "offset": 8384,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "139:44"
        },
        {
          "text": "individuals with unusual physical",
          "offset": 8387,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "139:47"
        },
        {
          "text": "characteristics.",
          "offset": 8390,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "139:50"
        },
        {
          "text": "Sometimes placed in striking and unusual",
          "offset": 8393,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "139:52"
        },
        {
          "text": "poses,",
          "offset": 8396,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "139:55"
        },
        {
          "text": "spiraling outwards, crouched or laid out",
          "offset": 8398,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "139:57"
        },
        {
          "text": "facing other deceased individuals",
          "offset": 8402,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "140:01"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 8405,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "140:04"
        },
        {
          "text": "at Cremes in Austria. Identical twins",
          "offset": 8408,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "140:07"
        },
        {
          "text": "were found, their bodies flanked by",
          "offset": 8411,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "140:11"
        },
        {
          "text": "great mammoth tusk lances and coated in",
          "offset": 8414,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "140:14"
        },
        {
          "text": "beads and ochre.",
          "offset": 8418,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "140:17"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 8421,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "140:20"
        },
        {
          "text": "At Ramoto in Calabria, an individual",
          "offset": 8423,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "140:23"
        },
        {
          "text": "with dwarfism was discovered.",
          "offset": 8426,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "140:26"
        },
        {
          "text": "And at Grimaldi Cave, an extremely tall",
          "offset": 8432,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "140:31"
        },
        {
          "text": "individual with gigantism was given",
          "offset": 8435,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "140:35"
        },
        {
          "text": "special care.",
          "offset": 8439,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "140:38"
        },
        {
          "text": "In recent decades, British archaeologist",
          "offset": 8444,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "140:44"
        },
        {
          "text": "Paul Pati has argued for significant",
          "offset": 8447,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "140:47"
        },
        {
          "text": "efforts being made by those interring",
          "offset": 8450,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "140:50"
        },
        {
          "text": "the dead to pin certain deceased",
          "offset": 8453,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "140:52"
        },
        {
          "text": "individuals down",
          "offset": 8456,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "140:55"
        },
        {
          "text": "with mammoth bones, wooden planks,",
          "offset": 8458,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "140:58"
        },
        {
          "text": "stones, or vast amounts of decorated",
          "offset": 8461,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "141:01"
        },
        {
          "text": "ornaments,",
          "offset": 8465,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "141:04"
        },
        {
          "text": "often tightly binding the bodies in",
          "offset": 8468,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "141:08"
        },
        {
          "text": "place.",
          "offset": 8471,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "141:10"
        },
        {
          "text": "Rather than reverence, the evidence",
          "offset": 8477,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "141:17"
        },
        {
          "text": "sometimes suggests more a culture of",
          "offset": 8480,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "141:19"
        },
        {
          "text": "fear,",
          "offset": 8483,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "141:23"
        },
        {
          "text": "just like in societies throughout",
          "offset": 8487,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "141:27"
        },
        {
          "text": "history, lasting well into the modern",
          "offset": 8490,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "141:29"
        },
        {
          "text": "era. mourers perhaps beseeching the dead",
          "offset": 8492,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "141:32"
        },
        {
          "text": "to stay in the afterlife,",
          "offset": 8496,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "141:36"
        },
        {
          "text": "even making certain precautions to stop",
          "offset": 8499,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "141:39"
        },
        {
          "text": "them from coming back.",
          "offset": 8503,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "141:42"
        },
        {
          "text": "From the Mochce pyramid builders of the",
          "offset": 8509,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "141:48"
        },
        {
          "text": "Peruvian coast to the passage graves of",
          "offset": 8511,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "141:51"
        },
        {
          "text": "Neolithic Ornne,",
          "offset": 8515,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "141:54"
        },
        {
          "text": "throughout history and all over the",
          "offset": 8517,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "141:56"
        },
        {
          "text": "world,",
          "offset": 8520,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "141:59"
        },
        {
          "text": "particularly in ancient shamanistic",
          "offset": 8521,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "142:01"
        },
        {
          "text": "societies,",
          "offset": 8524,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "142:04"
        },
        {
          "text": "individuals who are different in some",
          "offset": 8526,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "142:05"
        },
        {
          "text": "way, either mentally or physically have",
          "offset": 8528,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "142:08"
        },
        {
          "text": "often been thought to possess unusual",
          "offset": 8532,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "142:12"
        },
        {
          "text": "supernatural powers.",
          "offset": 8536,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "142:15"
        },
        {
          "text": "deemed closer to the gods.",
          "offset": 8538,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "142:18"
        },
        {
          "text": "Perhaps the so-called princely burials",
          "offset": 8549,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "142:29"
        },
        {
          "text": "might have been different in some way,",
          "offset": 8553,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "142:32"
        },
        {
          "text": "too.",
          "offset": 8555,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "142:35"
        },
        {
          "text": "Maybe they were albino,",
          "offset": 8557,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "142:36"
        },
        {
          "text": "autistic, or another genetic condition",
          "offset": 8560,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "142:39"
        },
        {
          "text": "otherwise unseen in the archaeological",
          "offset": 8563,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "142:43"
        },
        {
          "text": "record.",
          "offset": 8566,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "142:46"
        },
        {
          "text": "weighed down with objects to celebrate",
          "offset": 8570,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "142:50"
        },
        {
          "text": "them, but also maybe to contain their",
          "offset": 8573,
          "duration": 9,
          "formattedTime": "142:53"
        },
        {
          "text": "dangerous powers after death.",
          "offset": 8578,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "142:57"
        },
        {
          "text": "Just maybe, they are evidence of some of",
          "offset": 8584,
          "duration": 9,
          "formattedTime": "143:04"
        },
        {
          "text": "the earliest shamans in human history.",
          "offset": 8587,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "143:07"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 8595,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "143:14"
        },
        {
          "text": "Turning back to the mammoth hunters of",
          "offset": 8599,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "143:19"
        },
        {
          "text": "the Moravian Hills,",
          "offset": 8602,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "143:21"
        },
        {
          "text": "a number of burials were also found at",
          "offset": 8604,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "143:24"
        },
        {
          "text": "the site of Doli Vestaniche.",
          "offset": 8607,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "143:27"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 8610,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "143:30"
        },
        {
          "text": "One in particular deserving special",
          "offset": 8611,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "143:31"
        },
        {
          "text": "mention.",
          "offset": 8614,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "143:34"
        },
        {
          "text": "absolutely coated in ochre,",
          "offset": 8619,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "143:39"
        },
        {
          "text": "laid to rest beside a mighty mammoth",
          "offset": 8623,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "143:42"
        },
        {
          "text": "bone and with a hand resting on a fox,",
          "offset": 8626,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "143:45"
        },
        {
          "text": "the remarkably complete skeleton of a",
          "offset": 8630,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "143:50"
        },
        {
          "text": "woman around 40 years old was found.",
          "offset": 8633,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "143:52"
        },
        {
          "text": "And like the other ice age burials of",
          "offset": 8638,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "143:58"
        },
        {
          "text": "the Paleolithic,",
          "offset": 8641,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "144:00"
        },
        {
          "text": "she had several striking features.",
          "offset": 8643,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "144:02"
        },
        {
          "text": "In addition to her relatively advanced",
          "offset": 8649,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "144:08"
        },
        {
          "text": "age,",
          "offset": 8651,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "144:11"
        },
        {
          "text": "old enough to have been a grandparent.",
          "offset": 8653,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "144:12"
        },
        {
          "text": "From birth, the left side of her face",
          "offset": 8656,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "144:16"
        },
        {
          "text": "had very visible deformities.",
          "offset": 8659,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "144:19"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 8662,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "144:21"
        },
        {
          "text": "Was this so-called elder of Dolni",
          "offset": 8666,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "144:25"
        },
        {
          "text": "Vestiniche considered to be touched by",
          "offset": 8669,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "144:29"
        },
        {
          "text": "the gods?",
          "offset": 8672,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "144:32"
        },
        {
          "text": "As we have seen, a number of Venus",
          "offset": 8677,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "144:36"
        },
        {
          "text": "figurines were found at the site,",
          "offset": 8679,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "144:39"
        },
        {
          "text": "including an isolated spot around 80 m",
          "offset": 8682,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "144:42"
        },
        {
          "text": "upstream containing well over 2,000 clay",
          "offset": 8686,
          "duration": 9,
          "formattedTime": "144:45"
        },
        {
          "text": "figurines of various animals.",
          "offset": 8689,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "144:49"
        },
        {
          "text": "Most of them in fragments,",
          "offset": 8696,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "144:56"
        },
        {
          "text": "perhaps magical items",
          "offset": 8700,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "144:59"
        },
        {
          "text": "created to be ritualistically broken.",
          "offset": 8703,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "145:02"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 8707,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "145:06"
        },
        {
          "text": "The most incredible of all, however, had",
          "offset": 8710,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "145:10"
        },
        {
          "text": "exactly the same facial abnormalities as",
          "offset": 8714,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "145:13"
        },
        {
          "text": "the elder,",
          "offset": 8717,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "145:17"
        },
        {
          "text": "making it very likely to have been a",
          "offset": 8719,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "145:19"
        },
        {
          "text": "model or representation,",
          "offset": 8722,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "145:21"
        },
        {
          "text": "perhaps to remember her in future",
          "offset": 8725,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "145:24"
        },
        {
          "text": "generations.",
          "offset": 8727,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "145:27"
        },
        {
          "text": "It begs the question, do all the Venus",
          "offset": 8733,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "145:33"
        },
        {
