        },
        {
          "text": "ritual in process.",
          "offset": 8904,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "148:23"
        },
        {
          "text": "Given the shreds of evidence we've seen",
          "offset": 8912,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "148:32"
        },
        {
          "text": "from the very beginnings of humanity's",
          "offset": 8915,
          "duration": 5,
