          "offset": 8934,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "148:53"
        },
        {
          "text": "a hypothetical creative explosion linked",
          "offset": 8938,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "148:58"
        },
        {
          "text": "with the need for social cohesion in the",
          "offset": 8941,
