          "formattedTime": "149:46"
        },
        {
          "text": "concerned,",
          "offset": 8989,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "149:48"
        },
        {
          "text": "hereditary systems of rank seem the most",
          "offset": 8990,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "149:50"
        },
        {
          "text": "improbable interpretation of all.",
          "offset": 8993,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "149:53"
        },
        {
          "text": "Again, this begs the question,",
          "offset": 9000,
