        },
        {
          "text": "priesthood.",
          "offset": 9022,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "150:21"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 9024,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "150:23"
        },
        {
          "text": "Was there a shadowy cabal pulling the",
