          "formattedTime": "150:33"
        },
        {
          "text": "meritocratic theocracy.",
          "offset": 9037,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "150:36"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 9039,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "150:39"
        },
        {
          "text": "In the year 2000, the translation into",
