        },
        {
          "text": "in the archaeological community,",
          "offset": 9057,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "150:56"
        },
        {
          "text": "but ever elusive ripples into the realm",
          "offset": 9060,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "151:00"
        },
        {
          "text": "of popular culture.",
          "offset": 9063,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "151:03"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 9068,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "151:07"
        },
        {
          "text": "Ever since Gordon Child's Oasis theory",
          "offset": 9072,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "151:11"
        },
        {
          "text": "and the like in the early 1900s,",
          "offset": 9074,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "151:14"
        },
        {
          "text": "the majority of attempted explanations",
          "offset": 9078,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "151:17"
        },
        {
          "text": "for the so-called Neolithic Revolution",
          "offset": 9080,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "151:20"
        },
        {
          "text": "had focused on economic reasoning,",
          "offset": 9083,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "151:23"
        },
        {
          "text": "geographical needs, and material",
          "offset": 9087,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "151:27"
        },
        {
          "text": "circumstances dictating growth into",
          "offset": 9089,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "151:29"
        },
        {
          "text": "agricultural societies.",
          "offset": 9092,
          "duration": 9,
          "formattedTime": "151:32"
        },
        {
          "text": "Enter Jacqu Kovan.",
          "offset": 9096,
          "duration": 10,
          "formattedTime": "151:36"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 9101,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "151:41"
        },
        {
          "text": "In the early 1990s, after more than 50",
          "offset": 9108,
