          "offset": 9117,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "151:56"
        },
        {
          "text": "Kovan went public with a completely",
          "offset": 9119,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "151:59"
        },
        {
          "text": "different idea.",
          "offset": 9122,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "152:02"
        },
        {
          "text": "In the birth of the gods and the origins",
          "offset": 9126,
          "duration": 4,
