          "offset": 9167,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "152:46"
        },
        {
          "text": "perspective from seeing humanity as a",
          "offset": 9169,
          "duration": 9,
          "formattedTime": "152:48"
        },
        {
          "text": "part of nature to being outside of it.",
          "offset": 9172,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "152:52"
        },
