        },
        {
          "text": "right.",
          "offset": 9185,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "153:05"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 9186,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "153:06"
        },
        {
          "text": "In other words, in order to become a",
          "offset": 9190,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "153:09"
        },
        {
          "text": "farmer, you have to think like one",
          "offset": 9193,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "153:12"
        },
        {
          "text": "first.",
          "offset": 9195,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "153:15"
        },
        {
          "text": "Perhaps like all later religions",
          "offset": 9198,
          "duration": 10,
          "formattedTime": "153:18"
        },
        {
          "text": "beginning as a single creative spark",
          "offset": 9202,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "153:21"
        },
        {
          "text": "rather than economic need, environmental",
          "offset": 9208,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "153:28"
        },
        {
          "text": "shift or even individual social",
          "offset": 9211,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "153:31"
        },
        {
          "text": "promotion. A collective epiphany",
          "offset": 9214,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "153:34"
        },
        {
          "text": "expressed in new symbols and ideas",
          "offset": 9218,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "153:37"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 9222,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "153:42"
        },
        {
          "text": "at the very dawn of civilization.",
          "offset": 9224,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "153:44"
        },
        {
          "text": "Though of course it remains completely",
          "offset": 9232,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "153:51"
        },
        {
          "text": "untestable",
          "offset": 9234,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "153:54"
        },
        {
          "text": "if even at all true and it could go",
          "offset": 9236,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "153:55"
        },
        {
          "text": "alongside other theories to a certain",
          "offset": 9239,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "153:58"
        },
        {
          "text": "extent. Jacqu Kovan's birth of the gods",
          "offset": 9241,
