        },
        {
          "text": "much as 3 or 400,000 years.",
          "offset": 9263,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "154:22"
        },
        {
          "text": "Kon's death the very next year in 2001",
          "offset": 9273,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "154:32"
        },
        {
          "text": "only added to the allure of the theory",
          "offset": 9277,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "154:37"
        },
        {
          "text": "which remains immensely influential",
          "offset": 9281,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "154:41"
        },
        {
          "text": "amongst archaeologists today.",
          "offset": 9284,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "154:44"
        },
        {
          "text": "Far from the rigid economic reasoning of",
          "offset": 9290,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "154:49"
        },
        {
          "text": "Braidwood and Child, Jacqu Kovan evokes",
          "offset": 9293,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "154:52"
        },
        {
          "text": "distant ancestral memories of ecstatic",
          "offset": 9297,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "154:56"
        },
        {
          "text": "dance",
          "offset": 9300,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "154:59"
        },
        {
          "text": "beneath the colossal T-shaped pillars of",
          "offset": 9302,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "155:01"
        },
        {
          "text": "elder days.",
          "offset": 9305,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "155:04"
        },
        {
          "text": "From the early 20th century to today, a",
          "offset": 9312,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "155:12"
        },
        {
          "text": "number of sociologists and",
          "offset": 9316,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "155:15"
        },
        {
          "text": "anthropologists alike have studied the",
          "offset": 9318,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "155:17"
        },
        {
          "text": "nature of religious ecstasy.",
          "offset": 9321,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "155:20"
        },
        {
          "text": "Commonly observed all over the world and",
          "offset": 9326,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "155:26"
        },
        {
          "text": "in all walks of life.",
          "offset": 9329,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "155:29"
        },
        {
          "text": "Perhaps most notable being the work of",
          "offset": 9339,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "155:39"
        },
        {
          "text": "Msia Eliard and Emil Durkheim.",
          "offset": 9342,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "155:42"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 9346,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "155:45"
        },
        {
          "text": "For them, the effevescence and elation",
          "offset": 9349,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "155:49"
        },
        {
          "text": "of religious ceremony has a tendency to",
          "offset": 9352,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "155:52"
        },
        {
          "text": "ferment a sense of belonging and",
          "offset": 9355,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "155:55"
        },
        {
          "text": "contentment in a community.",
          "offset": 9358,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "155:57"
        },
        {
          "text": "very possibly in prehistoric and",
          "offset": 9363,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "156:03"
        },
        {
          "text": "historic times, allowing for ever larger",
          "offset": 9366,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "156:05"
        },
        {
          "text": "conglomerations of people to coalesce",
          "offset": 9369,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "156:08"
        },
        {
          "text": "than ever before.",
          "offset": 9372,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "156:11"
        },
        {
          "text": "Sometimes ultimately resulting in",
          "offset": 9375,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "156:14"
        },
        {
          "text": "asymmetrical power structures beginning",
          "offset": 9378,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "156:17"
        },
        {
          "text": "to form.",
          "offset": 9380,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "156:20"
        },
        {
          "text": "An expert in world religions, Messia",
          "offset": 9385,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "156:25"
        },
        {
          "text": "Eliard in particular, talked of the",
          "offset": 9388,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "156:28"
        },
        {
          "text": "pursuits of ecstasy being an integral",
          "offset": 9391,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "156:31"
        },
        {
          "text": "part of the religious experience.",
          "offset": 9394,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "156:33"
        },
        {
          "text": "The transformative feeling of awe, for",
          "offset": 9399,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "156:39"
        },
        {
          "text": "example, being one that goes handinhand",
          "offset": 9402,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "156:41"
        },
        {
          "text": "with music, monuments, landscapes, and",
          "offset": 9405,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "156:44"
        },
        {
          "text": "nature.",
          "offset": 9409,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "156:49"
        },
        {
          "text": "Music and dancing in particular, often",
          "offset": 9414,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "156:53"
        },
        {
          "text": "inducing translike altered states and a",
          "offset": 9417,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "156:56"
        },
        {
          "text": "sense of unity.",
          "offset": 9420,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "157:00"
        },
        {
          "text": "All of which were present at Gabbecepe.",
          "offset": 9424,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "157:04"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 9429,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "157:08"
        },
        {
          "text": "Of course, by their very nature, Jacqu",
          "offset": 9431,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "157:11"
        },
        {
          "text": "Kovan's ideas remain entirely",
          "offset": 9435,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "157:14"
        },
        {
          "text": "untestable.",
          "offset": 9437,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "157:17"
        },
        {
          "text": "little more than hints of a shamanic",
          "offset": 9440,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "157:20"
        },
        {
          "text": "council leading a societal revolution.",
          "offset": 9442,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "157:22"
        },
        {
          "text": "A wash with awe and ecstatic devotion,",
          "offset": 9446,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "157:26"
        },
        {
          "text": "building on timehonored ideas,",
          "offset": 9450,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "157:30"
        },
        {
          "text": "stretching back tens of thousands of",
          "offset": 9453,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "157:33"
        },
        {
          "text": "years into the Orign,",
          "offset": 9456,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "157:35"
        },
        {
          "text": "but imbued with new found immediacy.",
          "offset": 9461,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "157:40"
        },
        {
          "text": "Annual festival centers apparently",
          "offset": 9468,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "157:48"
        },
        {
          "text": "common in older hunting societies for",
          "offset": 9471,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "157:50"
        },
        {
          "text": "exchange and verbal communication. Ever",
          "offset": 9474,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "157:53"
        },
        {
          "text": "growing and ever spreading the new word.",
          "offset": 9477,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "157:57"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 9482,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "158:01"
        },
        {
          "text": "It's even possible that domestication of",
          "offset": 9484,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "158:04"
        },
        {
          "text": "plants and animals ultimately came about",
          "offset": 9487,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "158:07"
        },
        {
          "text": "in part as a means of feeding",
          "offset": 9491,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "158:10"
        },
        {
          "text": "increasingly large groups of people",
          "offset": 9493,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "158:12"
        },
        {
          "text": "drawn to holy sites to build and to",
          "offset": 9495,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "158:15"
        },
        {
          "text": "worship.",
          "offset": 9499,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "158:19"
        },
        {
          "text": "domesticated plants and animals showing",
          "offset": 9503,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "158:23"
        },
        {
          "text": "up slightly later at sites like Navali",
          "offset": 9506,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "158:26"
        },
        {
          "text": "Chry and Chanu.",
          "offset": 9509,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "158:29"
        },
        {
          "text": "The art of which still very much echoed",
          "offset": 9515,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "158:34"
        },
        {
          "text": "that found at Gbeckley and Carahan",
          "offset": 9518,
          "duration": 9,
          "formattedTime": "158:37"
        },
        {
          "text": "and their own older levels.",
          "offset": 9522,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "158:41"
        },
        {
          "text": "Of course, another equally possible",
          "offset": 9529,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "158:48"
        },
        {
          "text": "theory favored by Klaus Schmidt holds",
          "offset": 9531,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "158:51"
        },
        {
          "text": "that religion actually kept the hunters",
          "offset": 9535,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "158:55"
        },
        {
          "text": "of Gbeclete from pursuing agriculture",
          "offset": 9538,
          "duration": 10,
          "formattedTime": "158:57"
        },
        {
          "text": "where others to the south did so",
          "offset": 9542,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "159:02"
        },
        {
          "text": "being a last hold out of a resolute",
          "offset": 9548,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "159:08"
        },
        {
          "text": "culture of hunters on the precipice of",
          "offset": 9551,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "159:11"
        },
        {
          "text": "new beginnings.",
          "offset": 9555,
          "duration": 9,
          "formattedTime": "159:14"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 9556,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "159:16"
        },
        {
          "text": "In the late 1800s,",
          "offset": 9566,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "159:26"
        },
        {
          "text": "German philosopher Carl Marx, one of the",
          "offset": 9569,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "159:28"
        },
        {
          "text": "most influential thinkers ever to put",
          "offset": 9572,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "159:32"
        },
        {
          "text": "pen to paper, implied religion to be a",
          "offset": 9575,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "159:34"
        },
        {
          "text": "conscious invention of the elite, to",
          "offset": 9579,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "159:38"
        },
        {
          "text": "control the masses.",
          "offset": 9582,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "159:41"
        },
        {
          "text": "The reality, as usually is the case,",
          "offset": 9585,
          "duration": 9,
          "formattedTime": "159:44"
        },
        {
          "text": "seems to be far more complex.",
          "offset": 9588,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "159:48"
        },
        {
          "text": "Religious ideas, conceived of until",
          "offset": 9594,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "159:54"
        },
        {
          "text": "relatively recently as a form of",
          "offset": 9597,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "159:57"
        },
        {
          "text": "science,",
          "offset": 9600,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "159:59"
        },
        {
          "text": "seem to have been utterly intertwined",
          "offset": 9602,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "160:01"
        },
        {
          "text": "with humanity since the very beginning.",
          "offset": 9604,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "160:04"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 9609,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "160:08"
        },
        {
          "text": "We humans are a curious and immensely",
          "offset": 9612,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "160:11"
        },
        {
          "text": "creative species.",
          "offset": 9615,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "160:15"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 9619,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "160:18"
        },
        {
          "text": "And as French anthropologist Claude Levi",
          "offset": 9623,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "160:23"
        },
        {
          "text": "Strauss first pointed out in the 1950s",
          "offset": 9626,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "160:26"
        },
        {
          "text": "and60s,",
          "offset": 9629,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "160:29"
        },
        {
          "text": "in prehistoric societies, mythological",
          "offset": 9631,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "160:30"
        },
        {
          "text": "thought and religion were the only ways",
          "offset": 9634,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "160:34"
        },
        {
          "text": "of explaining and exploring the world",
          "offset": 9637,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "160:37"
        },
        {
          "text": "and the bigger questions within.",
          "offset": 9641,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "160:40"
        },
        {
          "text": "Above all else, the individuals who",
          "offset": 9648,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "160:47"
        },
        {
          "text": "built Gobeclete were our intellectual",
          "offset": 9651,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "160:51"
        },
        {
          "text": "equals,",
          "offset": 9654,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "160:54"
        },
        {
          "text": "possessing exactly the same mental",
          "offset": 9662,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "161:01"
        },
        {
          "text": "capacity that we have today,",
          "offset": 9664,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "161:04"
        },
        {
          "text": "just with a more basic cultural",
          "offset": 9667,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "161:07"
        },
        {
          "text": "tradition and knowledge base, but no",
          "offset": 9670,
          "duration": 9,
          "formattedTime": "161:09"
        },
        {
          "text": "less colorful creativity to draw from.",
          "offset": 9673,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "161:12"
        },
        {
          "text": "Far from a shadowy elite controlling the",
          "offset": 9682,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "161:22"
        },
        {
          "text": "masses",
          "offset": 9685,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "161:24"
        },
        {
          "text": "like scientists and doctors today, early",
          "offset": 9686,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "161:26"
        },
        {
          "text": "shamans or proto priests would very",
          "offset": 9690,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "161:30"
        },
        {
          "text": "likely have spent their days attempting",
          "offset": 9693,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "161:33"
        },
        {
          "text": "to help their communities",
          "offset": 9696,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "161:35"
        },
        {
          "text": "to intervene with spirits, perhaps",
          "offset": 9698,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "161:38"
        },
        {
          "text": "ancestors,",
          "offset": 9701,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "161:41"
        },
        {
          "text": "and ultimately acting for the greater",
          "offset": 9704,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "161:44"
        },
        {
          "text": "good.",
          "offset": 9707,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "161:46"
        },
        {
          "text": "If they didn't, they probably wouldn't",
          "offset": 9709,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "161:48"
        },
        {
          "text": "have been in their positions for much",
          "offset": 9712,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "161:51"
        },
        {
          "text": "longer.",
          "offset": 9714,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "161:53"
        },
        {
          "text": "Like the vespers at Delelfi in the Greek",
          "offset": 9718,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "161:57"
        },
        {
          "text": "classical age, perhaps going into",
          "offset": 9721,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "162:00"
        },
        {
          "text": "psychedelic transances to draw out near",
          "offset": 9724,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "162:03"
        },
        {
          "text": "impenetrable yet nonetheless useful",
          "offset": 9727,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "162:06"
        },
        {
          "text": "prophecies for those in need.",
          "offset": 9730,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "162:10"
        },
        {
          "text": "And maybe like the vespers at Delelfi,",
          "offset": 9735,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "162:14"
        },
        {
          "text": "such transes took an obvious toll on",
          "offset": 9738,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "162:18"
        },
        {
          "text": "their bodies,",
          "offset": 9741,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "162:21"
        },
        {
          "text": "even killing them after a time.",
          "offset": 9743,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "162:23"
        },
        {
          "text": "And of course, much more than today.",
          "offset": 9750,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "162:29"
        },
        {
          "text": "Death was very much a part of life in",
          "offset": 9754,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "162:33"
        },
        {
          "text": "those days.",
          "offset": 9757,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "162:37"
        },
        {
          "text": "[Music]",
          "offset": 9759,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "162:38"
        },
        {
          "text": "And sometimes, just like in practically",
          "offset": 9764,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "162:43"
        },
        {
          "text": "all societies that ever evolved, at one",
          "offset": 9767,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "162:47"
        },
        {
          "text": "stage or another, a situation might be",
          "offset": 9771,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "162:50"
        },
        {
          "text": "serious enough so as to warrant or",
          "offset": 9774,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "162:54"
        },
        {
          "text": "require",
          "offset": 9778,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "162:57"
        },
        {
          "text": "a sacrifice.",
          "offset": 9779,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "162:59"
        },
        {
          "text": "There is a certain Hittite ritual from",
          "offset": 9790,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "163:09"
        },
        {
          "text": "the second millennium BC recorded on",
          "offset": 9793,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "163:12"
        },
        {
          "text": "cuneaoifor tablets which can still be",
          "offset": 9796,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "163:16"
        },
        {
          "text": "read today.",
          "offset": 9799,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "163:18"
        },
        {
          "text": "It speaks of a timehonored tradition in",
          "offset": 9802,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "163:21"
        },
        {
          "text": "ancient Anatolia",
          "offset": 9805,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "163:24"
        },
        {
          "text": "where members of a community would",
          "offset": 9807,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "163:26"
        },
        {
          "text": "symbolically pile up sources of evil and",
          "offset": 9809,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "163:29"
        },
        {
          "text": "anxiety onto a male goat.",
          "offset": 9812,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "163:31"
        },
        {
          "text": "The sorry animal would then be chased",
          "offset": 9815,
          "duration": 6,
          "formattedTime": "163:35"
        },
        {
          "text": "out into the desert and left to its",
          "offset": 9818,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "163:37"
        },
        {
          "text": "fate,",
          "offset": 9821,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "163:40"
        },
        {
          "text": "thus relieving the society of its",
          "offset": 9823,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "163:42"
        },
        {
          "text": "troubles for a time.",
          "offset": 9825,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "163:45"
        },
        {
          "text": "It's been argued that pillar one at",
          "offset": 9834,
          "duration": 4,
          "formattedTime": "163:54"
        },
        {
          "text": "Gobecletepe",
          "offset": 9837,
          "duration": 5,
          "formattedTime": "163:56"
        },
        {
          "text": "could indicate a similar ritual.",
          "offset": 9838,
          "duration": 8,
          "formattedTime": "163:58"
        },
        {
          "text": "Of course, the origins of the idea of a",
          "offset": 9842,
          "duration": 7,
          "formattedTime": "164:01"
        },
        {
          "text": "scapegoat,",
          "offset": 9846,
          "duration": 3,
          "formattedTime": "164:05"
        },
        {
          "text": "a ritual carried out unconsciously time",
          "offset": 9851,
          "duration": 7,
